{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2027-01-27T14:39:00", "text": "Great, George! Next, there's a 'Data Parsing Error in Consumer API' in Apache Kafka. This mirrors our data parsing issue. Here's the PR: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/863. George Taylor, could you take a look at this one?", "utterranceID": "20270127-3-13cef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270127-3-13cef"}
