{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_724e1180", "timestamp": "2026-10-25T07:22:00", "text": "Hi team, I hope you're all doing well! 😊 I wanted to start a discussion about our new GraphQL API integration. I've found some open-source projects with similar features that might give us some insights. Let's dive in!", "utterranceID": "20261025-0-d0912"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261025-0-d0912"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_724e1180", "timestamp": "2026-10-25T07:23:00", "text": "First up, we have a feature from Apache Kafka. It's about integrating a REST API with Kafka Streams for efficient data processing. You can check it out here: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/4939. What do you all think? Could this be relevant for us?", "utterranceID": "20261025-1-140fc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261025-1-140fc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8cbee5b3", "timestamp": "2026-10-25T07:24:00", "text": "Hey Julia, thanks for sharing! This Kafka feature seems pretty relevant, especially since we're also looking at seamless data flow. The way they handle stream processing could give us some ideas on optimizing our data handling. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261025-2-20d32"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261025-2-20d32"}
