{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01e37306", "timestamp": "2026-10-22T05:14:00", "text": "Absolutely, Julia! Real-time insights could help us react quickly to any issues or opportunities. It might be a bit complex to implement, but the benefits could be significant. Let's consider how we might integrate this into our system.", "utterranceID": "20261022-6-fb552"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261022-6-fb552"}
