{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-d3ea0a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0dd1bf2e", "timestamp": "2026-06-07T23:30:00", "text": "@eid_54b986cf, I agree with Hannah. Also, in the 'Non-Functional Requirements' section, we should specify performance benchmarks, like response times for AI-generated insights. This will help us set clear expectations for QA testing.", "utterranceID": "20260607-2-3c7db"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260607-2-3c7db"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-d3ea0a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_53a6add1", "timestamp": "2026-06-07T23:35:00", "text": "From a UX perspective, I think the 'user interface should be intuitive and user-friendly' is a bit vague. Can we define what 'intuitive' means in this context? Maybe include some user personas or scenarios to guide design decisions?", "utterranceID": "20260607-3-bef2a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260607-3-bef2a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-d3ea0a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2026-06-07T23:39:00", "text": "Good point, Julia. Also, regarding 'Integration Requirements', it might be beneficial to specify which APIs we plan to support initially. This could help prioritize development efforts and manage user expectations.", "utterranceID": "20260607-4-3f6e9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260607-4-3f6e9"}
