{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cf7cd7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T17:51:00", "text": "Awesome insights, guys! Lastly, let's discuss Redash's Customizable Query Dashboards. This feature enables users to design dashboards with queries and visualizations that align with their role-specific data requirements. Here's the link: https://github.com/getredash/redash/pull/4923. What do you think, George?", "utterranceID": "20260924-7-420fe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-7-420fe"}
