{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ae9183"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ab6f41bc", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T16:46:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with CollaborateForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261217-0-b3467"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-0-b3467"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ae9183"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ab6f41bc", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T16:49:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Failure to Adapt to User Feedback' issue. The AI Suggestion Engine isn't learning from user feedback, leading to repeated suggestions of previously rejected data points. This affects the AI Suggestion Engine and impacts customer CUST-0049. @eid_67036b20, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20261217-1-de69a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-1-de69a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ae9183"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67036b20", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T16:52:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the AI Suggestion Engine and see why it's not adapting to feedback. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261217-2-d8c46"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-2-d8c46"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ae9183"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ab6f41bc", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T16:53:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Inconsistent Visualization Recommendations'. The AI Suggestion Engine is proposing visualizations that don't align with the discussion context, affecting customer CUST-0116. @eid_67036b20, this is also yours.", "utterranceID": "20261217-3-5f49f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-3-5f49f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ae9183"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67036b20", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T16:54:00", "text": "Understood! I'll look into the context alignment for visualization recommendations as well. Let's get this sorted! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261217-4-554f2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-4-554f2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ae9183"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ab6f41bc", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T16:56:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks for taking those on, @eid_67036b20! Lastly, we have a 'Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) Misconfiguration'. Incorrect RBAC settings are allowing users with lower privileges to access sensitive data, which is a big security risk. This affects the Security Module and impacts customer CUST-0102. @eid_7fba1318, can you handle this one?", "utterranceID": "20261217-5-0577f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-5-0577f"}
