{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmagarcia-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f17ba0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_284b912c", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:40:00", "text": "Great find, Emma! I'll review the Django PR to see how they addressed the vulnerability. It could provide some valuable strategies for our fix. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20260712-4-0eacb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260712-4-0eacb"}
