{"title": "Integrate Feedback Loop into Analytics Models", "summary": "Implement a feedback loop mechanism that collects user interactions and feeds them back into the analytics models to refine predictions. This will allow the models to learn from user behavior and improve over time.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/extAIX/pull/5", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "True", "number": "5", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_01942cf0"}, "created_at": "2026-10-20T03:06:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_b4d260c1"}, "comment": "LGTM, approved! Great work, @eid_01942cf0. This will be a fantastic addition to our analytics capabilities. 🚀", "submitted_at": "2026-10-20T14:27:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_5782059f"}, "comment": "I agree with George Brown. The system's prediction accuracy seems to improve over time with the feedback loop. Everything looks solid to me. LGTM, approved! ✅", "submitted_at": "2026-10-20T14:23:00"}, {"state": "PENDING", "user": {"login": "eid_ecaa9084"}, "comment": "Same here! The implementation is clean, and the criteria are all met. The models are definitely learning from user interactions. Well done, @eid_01942cf0! LGTM, approved! 🎉", "submitted_at": "2026-10-20T14:26:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_extAIX_pull_5"}
