{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2027-03-26T01:32:00", "text": "Exactly, Alice. The update was necessary to enhance security protocols. The third-party applications experiencing issues are using outdated libraries that are no longer compatible with our updated security standards.", "utterranceID": "20270325-4-9886f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270325-4-9886f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-03-26T01:33:00", "text": "Did we confirm this with the third-party vendors, Charlie?", "utterranceID": "20270325-5-3ca3a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270325-5-3ca3a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2027-03-26T01:38:00", "text": "Yes, Ian. I reached out to a few of the vendors, and they acknowledged the need to update their libraries to align with the latest security protocols. It's more of a configuration issue on their end.", "utterranceID": "20270325-6-dbe33"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270325-6-dbe33"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-03-26T01:41:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, Charlie. So, no action needed from our side?", "utterranceID": "20270325-7-cef12"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270325-7-cef12"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2027-03-26T01:45:00", "text": "That's correct, George. I've documented the findings and informed the relevant stakeholders. If any third-party vendors need assistance with the update, we can provide guidance.", "utterranceID": "20270325-8-d851a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270325-8-d851a"}
