{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-17T03:57:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current Salesforce issues. Let's take a look at them! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270216-0-106a8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270216-0-106a8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-17T03:58:00", "text": "First, there's a memory leak issue in TensorFlow during model training. It seems prolonged sessions lead to increased memory usage, which slows down model convergence. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/1075. @eid_bac7c6c4, this sounds similar to the memory leak we're dealing with in EdgeForce. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20270216-1-9aab0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270216-1-9aab0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-02-17T04:00:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This is definitely relevant. The gradual memory increase could be a clue for our neural network layer issue. I'll review their approach and see if we can apply any of their fixes. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20270216-2-88429"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270216-2-88429"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-17T04:03:00", "text": "Great! Next up, there's a security flaw in PyTorch that allows unauthorized access to model checkpoints, risking data integrity. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/1076. Julia Smith, this seems to align with the security vulnerability we're tackling. What do you think?", "utterranceID": "20270216-3-c093b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270216-3-c093b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-02-17T04:08:00", "text": "Absolutely, Julia! This is very similar to our issue. I'll dive into their solution and see if we can adapt it for our security & access control problem. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20270216-4-cfacc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270216-4-cfacc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-17T04:12:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks Julia! Lastly, OpenCV has an inference delay issue on ARM-based low-power devices, which affects real-time applications. Here's the PR: https://github.com/opencv/opencv/pull/1077. Alice, this might give us some insights for the delayed inference response we're seeing. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20270216-5-f6750"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270216-5-f6750"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-02-17T04:13:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This is spot on. I'll look into how OpenCV is addressing the delay and see if we can implement similar optimizations for our low-power devices. ⚡", "utterranceID": "20270216-6-95261"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270216-6-95261"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-17T04:15:00", "text": "Perfect, thanks everyone for jumping on these! Let's keep these open-source solutions in mind as we work on our fixes. Feel free to reach out if you need any more info or support. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270216-7-7e6b7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270216-7-7e6b7"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-03-07T20:16:00", "text": "The root cause was that session tokens were not being invalidated after logout or timeout. Additionally, they were being transmitted without encryption, which made them susceptible to interception.", "utterranceID": "20270307-1-d297a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270307-1-d297a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-03-07T20:19:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, @eid_bac7c6c4! How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270307-2-71580"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270307-2-71580"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-03-07T20:23:00", "text": "Good question, Julia. We implemented a fix by ensuring that session tokens are now invalidated immediately upon logout or timeout. We also added encryption for token transmission using TLS to prevent interception.", "utterranceID": "20270307-3-b7bf4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270307-3-b7bf4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2027-03-07T20:28:00", "text": "Great work, Julia Jones! This should significantly improve our security posture.", "utterranceID": "20270307-4-675ac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270307-4-675ac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-03-07T20:32:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie! Let me know if you notice any other issues or have further questions.", "utterranceID": "20270307-5-d6f7d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270307-5-d6f7d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-03-07T20:33:00", "text": "Will do, thanks again for the quick turnaround on this fix!", "utterranceID": "20270307-6-95768"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270307-6-95768"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T09:05:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with EdgeForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270312-0-5816c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270312-0-5816c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T09:09:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Suboptimal Model Compression' issue. The AI models on EdgeForce devices aren't optimally compressed, causing increased computational load and slower processing times. This affects the AI Processing Engine and impacts users who rely on real-time data processing, like those in autonomous systems. @eid_edf6a3fc, this one's for you. The impacted customer is CUST-0066.", "utterranceID": "20270312-1-94d29"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270312-1-94d29"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_edf6a3fc", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T09:11:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the AI Processing Engine and see what's causing the compression issue. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270312-2-7b77f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270312-2-7b77f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T09:15:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Data Serialization Error in API Responses'. The API is intermittently returning improperly serialized data, which is causing parsing errors in client applications. This affects the API Layer and impacts developers and applications relying on consistent data retrieval. @eid_bac7c6c4, can you take this one? The impacted customer is CUST-0028.", "utterranceID": "20270312-3-45069"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270312-3-45069"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T09:16:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll check out the API Layer and work on resolving the serialization errors. Thanks for assigning this to me! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270312-4-3ff18"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270312-4-3ff18"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T09:20:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have a 'Model Update Rollback Error'. Failed model updates aren't properly rolled back, leaving devices with incomplete or corrupted models. This affects the Model Management & Update Module and impacts users who may receive inaccurate insights. @eid_4df3bcc2, this one's yours. The impacted customer is CUST-0076.", "utterranceID": "20270312-5-6ba8e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270312-5-6ba8e"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T03:16:00", "text": "Sure thing, Julia Smith. The root cause was that the thermal management system wasn't effectively dissipating heat, which led to the device throttling the CPU and GPU performance to prevent damage.", "utterranceID": "20261230-2-d49a5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261230-2-d49a5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T03:20:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Julia Jones. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261230-3-e70fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261230-3-e70fb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T03:23:00", "text": "We implemented a more efficient heat sink design and optimized the fan control algorithm to improve heat dissipation. This prevents the device from reaching critical temperatures and ensures the AI Processing Engine operates at full capacity.", "utterranceID": "20261230-4-2d4d6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261230-4-2d4d6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T03:24:00", "text": "Awesome work, @eid_bac7c6c4! This should really help with the performance issues we've been seeing.", "utterranceID": "20261230-5-b44b6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261230-5-b44b6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T03:26:00", "text": "Agreed, thanks for tackling this so quickly, Julia Jones. Looking forward to seeing the improvements in action.", "utterranceID": "20261230-6-62835"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261230-6-62835"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T03:27:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you encounter any more issues. Happy to help!", "utterranceID": "20261230-7-5bb20"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261230-7-5bb20"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-01T11:05:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect outputs due to data corruption during model updates has been resolved. 🎉", "utterranceID": "20270101-0-02fc9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270101-0-02fc9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-01T11:10:00", "text": "The issue was caused by an incomplete transaction handling mechanism during model updates, which led to partial writes and data inconsistency.", "utterranceID": "20270101-1-4bfac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270101-1-4bfac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-01T11:15:00", "text": "I've implemented a fix by introducing a more robust transaction management system that ensures atomicity during updates. This prevents partial writes and maintains data integrity.", "utterranceID": "20270101-2-6afe4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270101-2-6afe4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-01T11:18:00", "text": "You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/36", "utterranceID": "20270101-3-7411d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270101-3-7411d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-01-01T11:20:00", "text": "Great job, Julia Smith! Thanks for the update and for resolving this so quickly. I'll review the changes in the PR.", "utterranceID": "20270101-4-7fe4e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270101-4-7fe4e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-01T11:21:00", "text": "@eid_2347b567 Thanks, Julia! This was a critical issue, and I'm glad it's been addressed. I'll also take a look at the PR.", "utterranceID": "20270101-5-52cd1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270101-5-52cd1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-01T11:22:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia Jones and Julia Martinez! Let me know if you have any questions or need further clarification on the changes.", "utterranceID": "20270101-6-8a463"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270101-6-8a463"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-13T05:55:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with EdgeForce that need our immediate attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270112-0-82da9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270112-0-82da9"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T17:00:00", "text": "Hi @eid_54905dcb, I'll review it too. Looking forward to seeing how you've tackled the data retrieval. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261114-2-5081c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-2-5081c"}
