{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T17:06:00", "text": "I agree with Alice. The documentation is clear and concise. I also ran some tests, and the data is being fetched correctly from the local environment. Everything seems to be working smoothly. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261114-4-29a56"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-4-29a56"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T17:08:00", "text": "Performance-wise, the endpoints are responsive, and I didn't encounter any reliability issues during my testing. Looks solid to me! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261114-5-189be"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-5-189be"}
