{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_54905dcb", "timestamp": "2026-11-12T17:19:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice and Julia! Appreciate the quick review and feedback. Glad everything's in order. 🎉", "utterranceID": "20261114-9-0ceb8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-9-0ceb8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T03:38:00", "text": "@here check some functionalities of our product here https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/EdgeForce/demo_2", "utterranceID": "20261113-0-d833e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-0-d833e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T19:38:00", "text": "Hi team, I wanted to discuss some open-source projects that have implemented JWT authentication features similar to what we're planning. Let's see if we can draw any insights from them. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261114-0-8dec8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-0-8dec8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T19:40:00", "text": "First up, we have Keycloak's feature: 'Implement JWT-Based Role Mapping'. This PR enhances role mapping by using JWT claims to dynamically assign user roles. You can check it out here: https://github.com/keycloak/keycloak/pull/3178", "utterranceID": "20261114-1-6c4de"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-1-6c4de"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T19:45:00", "text": "That sounds pretty useful! Keycloak's approach to dynamic role assignment could definitely streamline our access control. We should consider how they handle claims extraction and role mapping. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261114-2-cfc2d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-2-cfc2d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_edf6a3fc", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T19:46:00", "text": "Agreed, Julia. Keycloak's dynamic role mapping could help us reduce manual role assignments. It might be worth looking into their implementation details to see if we can adapt some of their strategies.", "utterranceID": "20261114-3-85878"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-3-85878"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bf6c7f21", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:04:00", "text": "Good points, both of you. For performance inconsistencies, we might need to revisit the 'Edge Processing Layer' section. Let's consider optimizing our data processing algorithms and resource management strategies. What do you think, @eid_e51b439b?", "utterranceID": "20260908-3-a140e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-3-a140e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e51b439b", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:07:00", "text": "Absolutely, Alice. We should also look into the architecture design to better handle large-scale data. Maybe add a subsection on scalability improvements in the 'System Architecture' part?", "utterranceID": "20260908-4-0b68f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-4-0b68f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_caa2e58d", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:12:00", "text": "Great suggestions! For integration options, should we expand the 'Integration Layer' to include more APIs and connectors? This could help with third-party app compatibility.", "utterranceID": "20260908-5-9cfaa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-5-9cfaa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:17:00", "text": "Yes, Bob. We need to shift from a closed ecosystem to a more open one. Adding more APIs could be a game-changer for flexibility.", "utterranceID": "20260908-6-e9c9b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-6-e9c9b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:20:00", "text": "On the UI front, let's make the interface more intuitive for non-technical users. We could add a section on UI redesign focusing on simplicity and customization options.", "utterranceID": "20260908-7-2ec03"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-7-2ec03"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bf6c7f21", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:25:00", "text": "Agreed, Julia. And for the update disruptions, we should enhance our testing protocols and rollback procedures. Maybe add a 'Reliability and Update Management' section?", "utterranceID": "20260908-8-54a2b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-8-54a2b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_caa2e58d", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:27:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! To summarize, we'll add sections on setup automation, performance optimization, expanded integrations, UI redesign, and update management. Let's draft these changes and reconvene next week to finalize. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260908-9-a384f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-9-a384f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_caa2e58d", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T17:32:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_ef_aix_product_vision_document|Product Vision Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260910-0-ec514"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-0-ec514"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_caa2e58d", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T00:27:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Product Requirements Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We need to address the setup complexity, performance inconsistencies, limited integration options, UI challenges, and update disruptions. Let's dive in! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260911-0-d0bf6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-0-d0bf6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T00:31:00", "text": "Hey @eid_caa2e58d, for the setup complexity, I suggest we add a section on developing comprehensive setup automation tools. We could include scripts that simplify the initial configuration process. This should help reduce the technical expertise required. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260911-1-c0b5e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-1-c0b5e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1a7d9807", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T00:34:00", "text": "I agree with Charlie. Also, we should enhance the user guidance documentation. Maybe include a step-by-step setup guide with visuals? This could be part of the 'User Experience' section. 📚", "utterranceID": "20260911-2-e00c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-2-e00c0"}

