{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_edf6a3fc", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T16:49:00", "text": "Sure, the PR was initially created to enhance our user authentication process with JWT tokens. However, if we're moving away from this approach, it might not be needed anymore.", "utterranceID": "20261016-2-2e7c7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-2-2e7c7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1a7d9807", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T16:50:00", "text": "From a QA perspective, we haven't started testing this feature yet. If it's not aligned with the new direction, it might be best to hold off.", "utterranceID": "20261016-3-e8e3e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-3-e8e3e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T16:53:00", "text": "Agreed. If the product team has confirmed the change, we should consider not merging it.", "utterranceID": "20261016-4-eed8d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-4-eed8d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c9c3d8d5", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T16:56:00", "text": "Does anyone know if there are any dependencies on this PR that might be affected if we don't merge it?", "utterranceID": "20261016-5-c269d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-5-c269d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T17:01:00", "text": "I don't think there are any dependencies. The JWT functionality was pretty self-contained.", "utterranceID": "20261016-6-797c4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-6-797c4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9db3abf4", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T17:02:00", "text": "In that case, it seems like not merging it would be the best course of action.", "utterranceID": "20261016-7-3c386"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-7-3c386"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a9002ae2", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T17:06:00", "text": "Alright, @eid_edf6a3fc, could you please ensure that PR# 6 is not merged? We should keep it open for now until we have a final decision from the product team.", "utterranceID": "20261016-8-7f7ef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-8-7f7ef"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T01:42:00", "text": "Thanks for all the feedback, team! I'll take a closer look at these features and see how we can adapt some of these ideas into our implementation. Let's aim to incorporate the best practices from these projects. I'll keep you all updated! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261028-10-102dc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-10-102dc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T04:06:00", "text": "Hi team, please check my PR for implementing user authentication endpoints: https://github.com/salesforce/EF_AIX/pull/12. It includes login and registration functionalities to secure the API. Let me know your thoughts! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261030-0-b1eea"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-0-b1eea"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T04:10:00", "text": "Hey @eid_4df3bcc2, just took a look at the PR. The endpoints for login and registration are well-implemented. The code is clean and easy to follow. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261030-1-31110"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-1-31110"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T04:15:00", "text": "Hi @eid_4df3bcc2, I reviewed the PR as well. User data is securely stored, and I see that you're using bcrypt for password hashing, which is great! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261030-2-eac64"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-2-eac64"}
