{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6268ef7", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T20:34:00", "text": "Thanks for the quick turnaround, Charlie Miller. I'll coordinate with the documentation team to get the updates done.", "utterranceID": "20261102-6-3a3a7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-6-3a3a7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T20:36:00", "text": "Perfect, thanks Charlie Taylor. Let me know if you need any more details from my side.", "utterranceID": "20261102-7-86e85"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-7-86e85"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6268ef7", "timestamp": "2026-11-05T06:33:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Unresponsive UI Elements During Data Drill-Down' has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FlowForce/pull/45.", "utterranceID": "20261105-0-5aa6a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261105-0-5aa6a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6268ef7", "timestamp": "2026-11-05T06:36:00", "text": "The root cause was identified as inefficient event handling in the UI layer. It was struggling to manage multiple user interactions during intensive data operations, which led to the unresponsiveness.", "utterranceID": "20261105-1-fa047"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261105-1-fa047"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6268ef7", "timestamp": "2026-11-05T06:41:00", "text": "To fix this, I optimized the event handling by implementing a debounce mechanism. This ensures that the UI processes events at a manageable rate, preventing overload during data drill-down operations.", "utterranceID": "20261105-2-16bb1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261105-2-16bb1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-05T06:42:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_b6268ef7! That should make a big difference for users who need to analyze data in detail.", "utterranceID": "20261105-3-1e901"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261105-3-1e901"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T19:42:00", "text": "First up, we have a problem with the anomaly detection feature in the AI Model & Analysis Engine. It's flagging normal traffic patterns as anomalies, which is causing unnecessary optimization actions. This is impacting CUST-0007. @eid_8605f7ee, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260910-1-ac314"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-1-ac314"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8605f7ee", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T19:47:00", "text": "Got it! I'll look into the anomaly detection issue for CUST-0007. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260910-2-26182"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-2-26182"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T19:52:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, there's a delayed data propagation issue in the Database & Data Synchronization Module. Data updates aren't propagating timely across nodes, leading to inconsistencies. This is affecting CUST-0074. @eid_399e4119, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20260910-3-31ab6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-3-31ab6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_399e4119", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T19:57:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the data propagation issue for CUST-0074 and see what's causing the delay. 🕵️‍♂️", "utterranceID": "20260910-4-f8baa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-4-f8baa"}
