{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9a7b2132", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T06:49:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Weak Password Policy Enforcement' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FlowForce/pull/34.", "utterranceID": "20260915-0-c22f4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-0-c22f4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9a7b2132", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T06:51:00", "text": "The root cause was that our system wasn't enforcing password complexity requirements during password creation, which allowed users to set weak passwords.", "utterranceID": "20260915-1-b07e5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-1-b07e5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9a7b2132", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T06:52:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the password validation logic to include checks for minimum length, uppercase and lowercase letters, numbers, and special characters. This should significantly reduce the risk of unauthorized access through brute force attacks.", "utterranceID": "20260915-2-33897"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-2-33897"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f2474622", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T06:53:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_9a7b2132! Thanks for addressing this so quickly.", "utterranceID": "20260915-3-7e496"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-3-7e496"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_399e4119", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T06:58:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian. This fix will definitely enhance our security posture. @eid_9a7b2132, did you also update the user guidelines to reflect the new password requirements?", "utterranceID": "20260915-4-68256"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-4-68256"}
