{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:10:16", "text": "@here Stay updated with this news article on the latest trends in AI-driven lead qualification. It highlights key industry shifts and emerging technologies. https://www.forbes.com/sites/forbestechcouncil/2023/09/15/the-future-of-ai-in-lead-qualification/", "utterranceID": "20260403-33-19c9c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-33-19c9c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:13:00", "text": "Hey @eid_66d09012, sounds good! I think we should start with a clear problem statement and the objectives of LeadQualification. What do you all think?", "utterranceID": "20260403-1-c1331"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-1-c1331"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:14:00", "text": "Agreed, George M. We should also include user personas to understand who will benefit most from our AI-powered lead scoring. @eid_66d09012, do we have any existing data on this?", "utterranceID": "20260403-2-04b81"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-2-04b81"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_66d09012", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:19:00", "text": "Great point, Charlie S! We have some initial data from past projects that we can leverage. I'll compile that and share it here by tomorrow. 📊", "utterranceID": "20260403-3-55374"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-3-55374"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:24:00", "text": "For the technical section, we should outline the AI models we'll use and how they'll integrate with existing systems. @eid_ee9ca887, any thoughts on this?", "utterranceID": "20260403-4-2dbc8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-4-2dbc8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:27:00", "text": "Absolutely, Julia G. We can use a mix of supervised learning models and real-time data processing. I'll draft a technical overview by Friday. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260403-5-f538f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-5-f538f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31ca5b45", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:30:00", "text": "Don't forget about the testing strategy! We need to ensure the system is reliable and accurate. I'll start drafting the QA section. @eid_4de5cd7f, can you help with this?", "utterranceID": "20260403-6-46ab7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-6-46ab7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4de5cd7f", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:34:00", "text": "Sure thing, Fiona! I'll focus on the test cases for different lead scenarios. Let's aim to have a draft by next week. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260403-7-b2d49"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-7-b2d49"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:36:00", "text": "What about the user interface? We need to make sure it's intuitive for sales teams to use. @eid_59bbe6f6, any insights from your UX research?", "utterranceID": "20260403-8-77bd3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-8-77bd3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:40:00", "text": "Yes, Julia D! Based on our research, a dashboard with clear visualizations of lead scores and engagement patterns would be ideal. I'll mock up some designs by Monday. 🎨", "utterranceID": "20260403-9-6a533"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-9-6a533"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-LeadQualification", "channelID": "ch-ation-f9a7af"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_50da4819", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T14:43:00", "text": "Sounds like we're on the right track! Let's set a deadline for the first draft of the PRD. How about we aim for the end of next week?", "utterranceID": "20260403-10-73bf6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-10-73bf6"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T14:14:00", "text": "First up, there's a bug in Kubernetes titled 'API Server Rate Limiting Under Load'. It describes how high traffic causes the API server to throttle requests, leading to delayed responses for cluster operations. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/601. @eid_a43a4389, this seems similar to our API rate limiting issue. What do you think?", "utterranceID": "20260905-1-aee63"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260905-1-aee63"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T14:18:00", "text": "Thanks for sharing, Ian! This is definitely relevant. The way Kubernetes handles rate limiting could give us some insights into optimizing our API Gateway. I'll dive into the PR and see if there are any strategies we can adopt. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260905-2-12afd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260905-2-12afd"}
