{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T14:24:00", "text": "Absolutely, Ian! This is spot on. I'll review the Nginx PR to see how they tackled the load distribution. It might give us some ideas on how to adjust our settings for better balance. 💪", "utterranceID": "20260905-4-8da33"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260905-4-8da33"}
