{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T08:34:00", "text": "Finally, let's discuss ElasticSearch's Enhanced Query DSL for User Profiles. This PR expands the query DSL to support complex queries on user profile data, including nested and relational fields. Check it out here: https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/3615. What do you think, Charlie?", "utterranceID": "20260903-7-f254f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-7-f254f"}
