{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_32ff39b2", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:18:00", "text": "Hi team, I noticed that PR#8 was approved and merged, but I've heard that the product direction has changed. Do we need to consider reverting this PR?", "utterranceID": "20260915-0-a9019"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-0-a9019"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7b2a9f4a", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:19:00", "text": "Hey everyone, yes, the product team has decided to take a different approach, which might make this schema unnecessary. We should discuss if reverting is the best option.", "utterranceID": "20260915-1-a9344"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-1-a9344"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31ca5b45", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:23:00", "text": "Can someone clarify what the new product direction is and how it affects the GraphQL schema?", "utterranceID": "20260915-2-b4f3f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-2-b4f3f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e0ce30d", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:25:00", "text": "The new direction focuses more on REST APIs for customer profiles instead of GraphQL, so this schema might not be needed anymore.", "utterranceID": "20260915-3-65700"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-3-65700"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4de5cd7f", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:30:00", "text": "If we don't need the schema, reverting seems like the logical step. But are there any parts of the schema that could still be useful?", "utterranceID": "20260915-4-b7f91"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-4-b7f91"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_71a4de1d", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:34:00", "text": "Good point. @eid_85a4de81, could you provide insight into whether any components of the schema might still align with the new direction?", "utterranceID": "20260915-5-779d4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-5-779d4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:37:00", "text": "Sure, the schema was quite comprehensive, but if we're shifting to REST, most of it might not be applicable. I can review it to see if any parts are salvageable.", "utterranceID": "20260915-6-20bdf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-6-20bdf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1cfce648", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:40:00", "text": "Thanks for the clarification. It seems like reverting is the best course of action unless we find something useful in the schema.", "utterranceID": "20260915-7-92ee3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-7-92ee3"}
