{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-42f139"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1cfce648", "timestamp": "2026-09-25T16:00:00", "text": "Hi team, I just heard that the product direction has changed, and it seems like PR#13 might not be necessary anymore. Can we discuss whether we should revert it?", "utterranceID": "20260925-0-81d1f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260925-0-81d1f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-42f139"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_932ce89c", "timestamp": "2026-09-25T16:05:00", "text": "Hey everyone, I approved the PR because it seemed aligned with our previous goals. Can someone clarify what the new direction is?", "utterranceID": "20260925-1-6b79a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260925-1-6b79a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-42f139"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4de5cd7f", "timestamp": "2026-09-25T16:09:00", "text": "From what I understand, we're moving away from using NoSQL for customer profiles and sticking with our current relational database setup.", "utterranceID": "20260925-2-1b9fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260925-2-1b9fb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-42f139"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31ca5b45", "timestamp": "2026-09-25T16:13:00", "text": "That makes sense. If we're not using NoSQL, then the flexible schemas wouldn't be needed, right?", "utterranceID": "20260925-3-eb1f1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260925-3-eb1f1"}
