{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_022d1fd9", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T07:49:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect cache invalidation, titled 'Cache Invalidation Failure', has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/50.", "utterranceID": "20270128-0-34d96"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270128-0-34d96"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T07:52:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_022d1fd9! Could you explain what was causing the issue?", "utterranceID": "20270128-1-8597e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270128-1-8597e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_022d1fd9", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T07:57:00", "text": "Sure, George Garcia. The root cause was that our cache invalidation mechanism wasn't triggering when customer profiles were updated. This led to stale data being served from the cache, which affected the pitch generation process.", "utterranceID": "20270128-2-4ddb3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270128-2-4ddb3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T07:59:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Emma Smith. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270128-3-142d6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270128-3-142d6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_022d1fd9", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T08:02:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I updated the cache invalidation logic to listen for changes in customer profiles. Now, whenever there's an update, the cache is properly invalidated, ensuring that the most recent data is used.", "utterranceID": "20270128-4-6e745"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270128-4-6e745"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T08:07:00", "text": "Awesome work, @eid_022d1fd9! This should improve the accuracy of our pitches significantly.", "utterranceID": "20270128-5-55832"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270128-5-55832"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_022d1fd9", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T08:11:00", "text": "Thanks, George Miller! Let me know if you encounter any more issues. I'm here to help.", "utterranceID": "20270128-6-0d25f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270128-6-0d25f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T08:16:00", "text": "Thanks again, Emma Smith. I'll keep an eye on it and report back if anything comes up.", "utterranceID": "20270128-7-c3cca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270128-7-c3cca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2027-02-09T23:58:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with PitchForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270209-0-728bd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270209-0-728bd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2027-02-09T23:59:00", "text": "First up, we have a UI Rendering Issue on Mobile Devices. The interface isn't rendering correctly, causing elements to overlap or get cut off. This affects the User Interface & Mobile Compatibility, impacting customer CUST-0094. @eid_dd1ff0ca, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270209-1-beb99"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270209-1-beb99"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_dd1ff0ca", "timestamp": "2027-02-10T00:04:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the UI rendering issue on mobile. Thanks for the heads-up. 📱", "utterranceID": "20270209-2-d9b61"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270209-2-d9b61"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d9f42fd7", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T09:59:00", "text": "Agreed, Emma. It might also be a design oversight. Maybe there wasn't enough focus on integration features during the product development phase.", "utterranceID": "20260704-3-59cbc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-3-59cbc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4de5cd7f", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T10:02:00", "text": "That's possible, George. We should also consider operational factors, like insufficient partnerships or collaborations with CRM providers.", "utterranceID": "20260704-4-d4e95"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-4-d4e95"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_32ff39b2", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T10:06:00", "text": "I think we should start by reviewing the existing API documentation to see where the gaps are. @eid_469598db, do we have access to that?", "utterranceID": "20260704-5-54fb5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-5-54fb5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_469598db", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T10:09:00", "text": "Yes, Charlie, we do. I'll share the link to the documentation after this meeting.", "utterranceID": "20260704-6-919e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-6-919e2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_66d09012", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T10:14:00", "text": "Great. Once we identify the gaps, we can prioritize which CRM systems to focus on for better integration.", "utterranceID": "20260704-7-18cee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-7-18cee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_df39cc9e", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T10:18:00", "text": "Let's make sure to document these customer issues in our planning documents for the next release of pAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260704-8-113f0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-8-113f0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d9f42fd7", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T10:21:00", "text": "Absolutely, Emma. This will help us ensure that we address these integration issues effectively.", "utterranceID": "20260704-9-b5999"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-9-b5999"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T21:40:00", "text": "Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of pAIX. The report came from QA Specialist eid_7b85a749.", "utterranceID": "20260716-0-fbf67"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-0-fbf67"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_888411ab", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T21:43:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie. What kind of issues are we looking at?", "utterranceID": "20260716-1-71791"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-1-71791"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T21:44:00", "text": "Users are experiencing occasional slowdowns during peak usage times, which is affecting performance.", "utterranceID": "20260716-2-6bee1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-2-6bee1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T21:48:00", "text": "Could it be a technical issue like insufficient server capacity or resource allocation?", "utterranceID": "20260716-3-642a9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-3-642a9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_50da4819", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T21:53:00", "text": "That's possible, George. We should check the server logs during those peak times.", "utterranceID": "20260716-4-86d20"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-4-86d20"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T21:54:00", "text": "Another angle could be operational. Maybe we lack proper load balancing or scaling strategies.", "utterranceID": "20260716-5-614c9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-5-614c9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T21:57:00", "text": "Good point, Julia. We should review our current load balancing setup.", "utterranceID": "20260716-6-88bec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-6-88bec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_888411ab", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T21:58:00", "text": "Also, inefficient backend processes or algorithms might be causing bottlenecks.", "utterranceID": "20260716-7-9e382"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-7-9e382"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T22:02:00", "text": "Agreed, Hannah. We should analyze the backend processes for any inefficiencies.", "utterranceID": "20260716-8-a14ee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-8-a14ee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_50da4819", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T22:06:00", "text": "Let's document these issues and potential causes in our planning documents for the next release of pAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260716-9-4a37b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-9-4a37b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T22:08:00", "text": "Sounds good. We need to ensure these are addressed before the next release.", "utterranceID": "20260716-10-2d57f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-10-2d57f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T22:17:00", "text": "@eid_e37380e3 joined planning-pAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260712-80-215b3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260712-80-215b3"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-07-14T17:24:00", "text": "Yes, George. We should also consider mentioning backend optimizations to prevent bottlenecks. Adding a note on regular performance audits could be beneficial too. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260713-4-88144"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260713-4-88144"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-07-14T17:25:00", "text": "Regarding the UI complexity, we should revise the 'User Interface' section to emphasize user-friendly onboarding and tutorial features. Incorporating user feedback more effectively during design phases could also be highlighted. Thoughts, @eid_50da4819?", "utterranceID": "20260713-5-92431"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260713-5-92431"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_50da4819", "timestamp": "2026-07-14T17:28:00", "text": "Absolutely, Charlie. We could add a paragraph about simplifying the UI layout and enhancing the onboarding process to make it more intuitive for new users. This should help reduce the learning curve. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260713-6-6cb66"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260713-6-6cb66"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5af96a7d", "timestamp": "2026-07-14T17:33:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! To summarize: we'll enhance the 'Core AI Engine' with NLP improvements, update 'System Architecture' for better performance handling, and refine the 'User Interface' for usability. Let's also add a section on expanding CRM integration options. I'll draft these changes and share them for review. Next steps: I'll circulate the updated document by EOD. Thanks, team! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260713-7-b70ee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260713-7-b70ee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5af96a7d", "timestamp": "2026-07-15T05:13:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_paix_market_research_report|Market Research Report>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260714-0-0afce"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260714-0-0afce"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c0df5be6", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T16:54:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Product Vision Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some feedback from the latest release of pAIX that we need to address. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260716-0-ec922"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-0-ec922"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1cfce648", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T16:55:10", "text": "@here Explore the capabilities of the OpenAI GPT-3 library, which powers many AI-driven applications like pAIX. Dive into its features and how it can be used for generating personalized content. https://github.com/openai/gpt-3", "utterranceID": "20260716-101-92e7c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-101-92e7c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T16:58:00", "text": "Hey @eid_c0df5be6, I think we should start by addressing the AI-generated pitches issue. We need to enhance our NLP capabilities to capture more context-specific nuances. Maybe we can add a section in the Core AI Engine about expanding our training datasets to include more industry-specific data?", "utterranceID": "20260716-1-dba92"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-1-dba92"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T17:00:00", "text": "Agreed, Julia. Also, from a UX perspective, we should consider revising the User Interface section to include more intuitive onboarding features. This could help new users get up to speed faster and reduce the learning curve. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260716-2-20438"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-2-20438"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_888411ab", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T17:03:00", "text": "Good points, @eid_85a4de81 and @eid_59bbe6f6. For the integration issue, we should expand the System Architecture section to emphasize the need for broader CRM compatibility. This could involve developing more APIs or forming partnerships with major CRM providers.", "utterranceID": "20260716-3-c6e7e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-3-c6e7e"}

