{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-42f139"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_48e149b5", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T07:10:00", "text": "@here see how our product works: https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/PitchForce/demo_3", "utterranceID": "20261015-0-a812b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261015-0-a812b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-42f139"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4de5cd7f", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T11:28:00", "text": "Hi team, I noticed that PR# 20 is approved but not merged yet. I heard there's been a change in product direction. Can someone clarify if we still need this PR?", "utterranceID": "20261016-0-309a1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-0-309a1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-42f139"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a8a4fdcb", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T11:32:00", "text": "Hey everyone, yes, the product team decided to pivot away from using the NoSQL database for customer profiles. This means the data ingestion pipelines in PR# 20 might not be necessary anymore.", "utterranceID": "20261016-1-c86d5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-1-c86d5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-42f139"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31ca5b45", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T11:33:00", "text": "Thanks for the update @eid_a8a4fdcb. Just to confirm, is there any part of the PR that could still be useful in the new direction?", "utterranceID": "20261016-2-e79fd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-2-e79fd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-42f139"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_73ca2844", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T11:35:00", "text": "Good question @eid_31ca5b45. From what I understand, the entire pipeline is tailored for the NoSQL database, so it might not align with our new strategy.", "utterranceID": "20261016-3-1f83a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-3-1f83a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-42f139"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1cfce648", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T11:36:00", "text": "If the PR is not aligned with our current goals, should we consider not merging it at all?", "utterranceID": "20261016-4-02e3e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-4-02e3e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-42f139"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_32ff39b2", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T11:37:00", "text": "Agreed. It seems like merging it would just add unnecessary code to our base.", "utterranceID": "20261016-5-82a90"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-5-82a90"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-42f139"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_71a4de1d", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T11:39:00", "text": "I think we should ask @eid_8df92d08 to hold off on merging it. If it's already merged, we might need to revert it.", "utterranceID": "20261016-6-c64ff"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261016-6-c64ff"}

