{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SalesforceAISearch", "channelID": "ch-earch-52b890"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_52681a26", "timestamp": "2026-09-23T23:11:00", "text": "Hi team, I want to discuss the System Design Document for our SalesforceAISearch product. Let's brainstorm what we need to include! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260923-0-555b4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-0-555b4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SalesforceAISearch", "channelID": "ch-earch-52b890"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_719a0253", "timestamp": "2026-09-23T23:16:00", "text": "Hey @eid_52681a26, I think we should start with the architecture overview. We need to clearly define how the AI algorithms will integrate with the existing Salesforce platform.", "utterranceID": "20260923-1-14e34"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-1-14e34"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SalesforceAISearch", "channelID": "ch-earch-52b890"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2c384d22", "timestamp": "2026-09-23T23:21:00", "text": "Agreed, @eid_719a0253. We should also include a section on user personas and how the AI will interpret different query intents. This will help in understanding the context better.", "utterranceID": "20260923-2-b2f5e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-2-b2f5e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SalesforceAISearch", "channelID": "ch-earch-52b890"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_374a009b", "timestamp": "2026-09-23T23:23:00", "text": "Don't forget about the testing strategy! We need to ensure the AI delivers consistent and relevant results. @eid_97b4acd0 and I can draft this section.", "utterranceID": "20260923-3-a959f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-3-a959f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SalesforceAISearch", "channelID": "ch-earch-52b890"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_97b4acd0", "timestamp": "2026-09-23T23:25:00", "text": "Yes, @eid_374a009b, let's outline the test cases and scenarios. We should cover edge cases too. 🧪", "utterranceID": "20260923-4-ddc13"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-4-ddc13"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SalesforceAISearch", "channelID": "ch-earch-52b890"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9937f1d5", "timestamp": "2026-09-23T23:27:00", "text": "For the product requirements, we should specify the key features and performance metrics. This will guide our development and testing phases.", "utterranceID": "20260923-5-4cb0a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-5-4cb0a"}
