{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2027-04-27T12:25:00", "text": "Nice work, David! This should really improve the accuracy of our search results.", "utterranceID": "20270427-5-196f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270427-5-196f5"}

