{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_160fca3c", "timestamp": "2027-04-08T19:39:00", "text": "Thanks, team! Let's get these issues sorted out. 💪", "utterranceID": "20270408-10-32f97"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270408-10-32f97"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5715d9e", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T00:01:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the 'Insecure API Endpoint Exposure' in SearchForce.", "utterranceID": "20270408-0-981a7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270408-0-981a7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5715d9e", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T00:02:00", "text": "The concern was that an API endpoint was exposed without proper authentication, potentially allowing unauthorized access to execute search queries.", "utterranceID": "20270408-1-b3778"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270408-1-b3778"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5715d9e", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T00:04:00", "text": "After reviewing the configuration and testing the endpoint, I found that this is actually expected behavior for our internal testing environment.", "utterranceID": "20270408-2-109e9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270408-2-109e9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1897c0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5715d9e", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T00:08:00", "text": "The endpoint in question is only accessible within our secure internal network and is used for automated testing purposes. It is not exposed to the public internet.", "utterranceID": "20270408-3-e0c15"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270408-3-e0c15"}

