{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SalesforceAISearch", "channelID": "ch-earch-52b890"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4ddcb99f", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T14:38:00", "text": "@eid_2c384d22, let's ensure we have a clear vision statement. Something that aligns with our overall product strategy. Any ideas on how to phrase it?", "utterranceID": "20260910-4-c48f6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-4-c48f6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SalesforceAISearch", "channelID": "ch-earch-52b890"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2c384d22", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T14:40:00", "text": "Absolutely, Ian. How about: 'Empowering users with intelligent search capabilities that deliver precise and contextually relevant results'? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260910-5-43aea"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-5-43aea"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SalesforceAISearch", "channelID": "ch-earch-52b890"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4ddcb99f", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T14:45:00", "text": "I like it, Charlie! Let's refine it a bit more, but it's a solid start. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260910-6-f376f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-6-f376f"}
