{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-03-31T03:00:00", "text": "Also, what about the design aspect? Are we doing enough contextual analysis to differentiate between literal and sarcastic statements?", "utterranceID": "20260328-7-ece5d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260328-7-ece5d"}
