{"title": "Optimize Query Execution Plan for Sentiment Data Retrieval", "summary": "### Summary of the Issue
The database management system was generating suboptimal query execution plans for retrieving sentiment data, resulting in prolonged query processing times. This was due to outdated statistics and missing query optimization hints.

### Changes Made
- Updated database statistics to ensure the query optimizer has the most current data.
- Added query optimization hints to guide the execution plan towards more efficient paths.

### Testing
- Verified that the updated statistics are correctly reflected in the database.
- Executed the affected queries and confirmed improved execution times.
- Conducted regression testing to ensure no other parts of the system were adversely affected.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/39", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "True", "number": "39", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_fa6ec727"}, "created_at": "2026-10-06T02:39:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_d96fb219"}, "comment": "The changes look great! The updated statistics and optimization hints significantly improve query performance. I've reviewed the code and tested the execution times, and everything is functioning as expected. Approved for merge.", "submitted_at": "2026-10-06T01:18:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_SentimentForce_pull_39"}

