{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:49:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian and Charlie. Please let me know if you notice any further issues. I'll be monitoring the system closely for the next few days.", "utterranceID": "20260825-5-ef489"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-5-ef489"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T07:58:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the 'Stale Sentiment Cache'. The concern was that outdated sentiment data was being displayed on the dashboard.", "utterranceID": "20260828-0-c903a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-0-c903a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T08:01:00", "text": "After reviewing the cache invalidation policy, I found that the current behavior is actually expected. The cache is designed to refresh every 24 hours to balance performance and data freshness.", "utterranceID": "20260828-1-e3848"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-1-e3848"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T08:06:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. So, it's not a bug but rather a feature of our caching strategy?", "utterranceID": "20260828-2-0a039"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-2-0a039"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T08:08:00", "text": "Exactly, @eid_6cc1a0f6. The policy is set to ensure that we don't overwhelm the backend with frequent requests, which could degrade performance.", "utterranceID": "20260828-3-1c18b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-3-1c18b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T08:11:00", "text": "Makes sense. Did you verify that the cache is indeed refreshing as expected every 24 hours?", "utterranceID": "20260828-4-ac355"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-4-ac355"}
