{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T03:56:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SentimentForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261013-0-d74dd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-0-d74dd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T03:57:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Sentiment Model Drift' issue. The sentiment analysis model on the backend server has drifted, causing inaccurate sentiment scores on the Real-Time Dashboard. This is impacting CUST-0003, and it's crucial for maintaining effective real-time monitoring. @eid_31cb6db5, this one's for you!", "utterranceID": "20261013-1-42144"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-1-42144"}
