{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-08-24T00:01:00", "text": "Oh, that's unexpected! I thought we had resolved that by clarifying the use of static indices in the test environment. @eid_92c62291, any insights on this?", "utterranceID": "20260823-1-1fd23"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260823-1-1fd23"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-08-24T00:06:00", "text": "Hmm, that's interesting. Maybe there's a misunderstanding on the customer's end about the environment settings? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260823-2-ad6cb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260823-2-ad6cb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-08-24T00:10:00", "text": "Could it be that the dynamic indices aren't updating as expected in production, @George? Just a thought.", "utterranceID": "20260823-3-2143b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260823-3-2143b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-08-24T00:11:00", "text": "Good point, Charlie. I'll double-check the production settings to ensure the dynamic indices are functioning correctly. I'll also reach out to the customer for more details. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260823-4-989c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260823-4-989c0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-08-24T00:14:00", "text": "Thanks, @George! Let's make sure we get this sorted out for CUST-0089. Keep us posted on what you find. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260823-5-4b07e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260823-5-4b07e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-08-24T00:19:00", "text": "Will do! I'll update everyone once I have more information. Thanks for the heads-up, Ian. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260823-6-b54d2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260823-6-b54d2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-08-24T15:30:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Security Vulnerability in Data Export Feature' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/TrendForce/pull/30.", "utterranceID": "20260824-0-81cef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260824-0-81cef"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-08-24T15:31:00", "text": "The root cause was insufficient validation of user permissions before allowing data export operations. Essentially, the system wasn't properly checking if a user had the right permissions to export data, which led to unauthorized access.", "utterranceID": "20260824-1-a7cb1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260824-1-a7cb1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-08-24T15:32:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a more robust access control mechanism that verifies user permissions at multiple checkpoints during the export process. This ensures that only authorized users can initiate and complete data exports.", "utterranceID": "20260824-2-f5689"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260824-2-f5689"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-08-24T15:37:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_01942cf0! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. I'll review the changes and run some tests on my end.", "utterranceID": "20260824-3-60dc6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260824-3-60dc6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-08-24T15:39:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie. This was a critical issue, and I'm glad it's resolved. I'll update the documentation to reflect the changes in the export feature.", "utterranceID": "20260824-4-4e087"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260824-4-4e087"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-08-24T15:41:00", "text": "Nice job, Charlie Davis! Let me know if you need any help with further testing or deployment.", "utterranceID": "20260824-5-71534"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260824-5-71534"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c56b63"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2026-08-24T15:44:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! @eid_92c62291, @eid_5782059f, and @eid_82e9fcef, your support is much appreciated. Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing.", "utterranceID": "20260824-6-009fa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260824-6-009fa"}
