{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-504165"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-08-02T23:41:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with TrendForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260802-0-22cee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260802-0-22cee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-504165"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-08-02T23:43:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Insecure Direct Object Reference in Export Module'. The export module is allowing users to manipulate the export URL and access data objects without proper authorization. This affects the Data Export Functionality and poses a significant security risk. Impacted customer is CUST-0047. @eid_ecaa9084, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20260802-1-6b999"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260802-1-6b999"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-504165"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2026-08-02T23:46:00", "text": "Got it, I'll start looking into the authorization checks in the export module right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 🔍", "utterranceID": "20260802-2-1fbe9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260802-2-1fbe9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-504165"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-08-02T23:51:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Inaccurate Trend Prediction Due to Data Skew'. The TrendForce module is giving inaccurate predictions when datasets have significant outliers. This affects the Trend Analysis Algorithm and could lead to misguided decisions for strategic planning. Impacted customer is CUST-0075. @eid_14a5889d, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260802-3-fe0d8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260802-3-fe0d8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-504165"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_14a5889d", "timestamp": "2026-08-02T23:53:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the algorithm and see how we can handle skewed data better. 📊", "utterranceID": "20260802-4-a0175"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260802-4-a0175"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-TrendForce", "channelID": "ch-force-504165"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-08-02T23:55:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have a 'Data Aggregation Bottleneck'. TrendForce is experiencing delays when aggregating large datasets, which is slowing down the user interface. This affects both the User Interface & Backend Data Processing. Impacted customer is CUST-0116. @eid_2542cff3, can you look into this?", "utterranceID": "20260802-5-35711"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260802-5-35711"}
