{"title": "Optimize Network Communication for Edge and Central Servers", "summary": "This PR aims to optimize the network communication between edge nodes and central servers to ensure efficient data transfer and synchronization. It involves implementing protocols and strategies to minimize bandwidth usage and improve data throughput.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/flowAIX/pull/19", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "True", "number": "19", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_136119e9"}, "created_at": "2026-05-06T09:46:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_1e8695b6"}, "comment": "The network protocols are optimized, achieving a bandwidth reduction of around 16%. Performance benchmarks are solid with improved data throughput and reduced network latency. Everything checks out from my side. LGTM, approved!", "submitted_at": "2026-05-06T21:14:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_c92d3e03"}, "comment": "The documentation is clear and accurately reflects the changes in communication strategies. Data synchronization tests show reliable performance. All acceptance criteria are met, and the improvements are evident. LGTM, approved!", "submitted_at": "2026-05-06T21:16:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_flowAIX_pull_19"}
