{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianmiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-orcex-406de8"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T05:38:00", "text": "Lastly, Kubernetes has a PR titled 'Cluster Health Monitoring and Alerting'. It adds a feature to monitor cluster health and send alerts for any anomalies. Here's the link: https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/2790", "utterranceID": "20260825-7-62e6a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-7-62e6a"}

