{"title": "Implement User Interaction Logging for Feedback Loop", "summary": "This PR introduces a logging mechanism to capture user interactions with the AI suggestions. The data collected will be used to inform the feedback loop, allowing the AI model to learn from user behavior and preferences.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/1", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "False", "number": "1", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_a7dd9c52"}, "created_at": "2026-07-06T22:51:00", "reviews": [{"state": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "user": {"login": "eid_01e37306"}, "comment": "The code accurately logs user interactions, but it needs to include the interaction type in the logs. Additionally, please provide more details on the data privacy and security measures implemented to ensure user information is protected.", "submitted_at": "2026-07-07T07:33:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_8cbee5b3"}, "comment": "The logging mechanism is efficient, but please conduct performance tests to ensure it doesn't impact the application significantly. Looking forward to reviewing the updates.", "submitted_at": "2026-07-07T07:39:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_CollaborateForce_pull_1"}
