{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-e89893"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9b8bc088", "timestamp": "2026-07-22T21:58:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! @eid_82e9fcef, I'll add specifics about our cloud provider and how it supports our architecture. @eid_c7622c8e, I'll include the encryption standards like AES-256. @Julia Davis, I'll gather some beta test results to illustrate the AI benefits. Anything else?", "utterranceID": "20260722-4-72eaa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260722-4-72eaa"}
