{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T20:09:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect bottleneck identification in the FlowForce feature has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FlowForce/pull/44.", "utterranceID": "20261102-0-4df84"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-0-4df84"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T20:14:00", "text": "The root cause was an error in the machine learning model's training data. It included mislabeled examples of bottlenecks, which led to inaccurate flagging of API endpoints.", "utterranceID": "20261102-1-1c266"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-1-1c266"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T20:19:00", "text": "To fix this, we retrained the model with a corrected dataset and implemented additional validation checks to ensure the accuracy of bottleneck identification. This should prevent similar issues in the future.", "utterranceID": "20261102-2-98425"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-2-98425"}
