{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2026-12-24T02:33:00", "text": "Got it! I'll check the replication logs and see where the inconsistencies are coming from. I'll update you once I have more info. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261223-4-fc3f8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261223-4-fc3f8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-12-24T02:35:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have a 'Cache Invalidation Failure'. Stale customer data is being served from the cache, leading to outdated information in pitch generation. This also affects Database Management & Data Synchronization and impacts customer CUST-0114. @eid_022d1fd9, can you take this one on? 🤓", "utterranceID": "20261223-5-5076c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261223-5-5076c"}
