{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_022d1fd9", "timestamp": "2026-12-24T02:48:00", "text": "Thanks for the support, team! Let's keep the momentum going. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261223-10-f178e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261223-10-f178e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T11:35:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us tackle our current issues. Let's take a look at them together! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261226-0-2fdc5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-0-2fdc5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T11:40:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Bias in Model Predictions' issue in TensorFlow. The model is showing biased predictions due to imbalanced training data, which is similar to our 'Bias in Training Data' problem. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/388. @eid_e6d2ec9d, this might give you some insights! 🙏", "utterranceID": "20261226-1-6ddb8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-1-6ddb8"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2027-02-11T12:18:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks Bob! Lastly, there's a Model Drift issue in PyTorch related to continuous learning. It reduces prediction accuracy over time, similar to what we're seeing. Here's the PR: https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/410. Emma, could you explore this one?", "utterranceID": "20270211-5-74f00"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270211-5-74f00"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-02-11T12:19:00", "text": "Sure thing, George! I'll check out how PyTorch is handling model drift and see if we can apply any of their strategies to our situation. 🧠", "utterranceID": "20270211-6-eca19"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270211-6-eca19"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2027-02-11T12:22:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep sharing insights and see how these open-source solutions can guide us. If you find anything useful, let's discuss it further. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270211-7-2d8cf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270211-7-2d8cf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_dd1ff0ca", "timestamp": "2027-02-11T12:27:00", "text": "Will do! I'll update once I have more info from the React Native PR. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270211-8-3f49e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270211-8-3f49e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_38700e5f", "timestamp": "2027-02-11T12:32:00", "text": "Same here, I'll keep you posted on the TensorFlow findings. 🤖", "utterranceID": "20270211-9-da9ad"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270211-9-da9ad"}
