{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-42f139"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a8a4fdcb", "timestamp": "2026-10-05T00:42:00", "text": "Just went through the code, and it looks great! The pipelines are well-integrated with the NoSQL database, and I appreciate the thorough testing for performance. The error handling and logging mechanisms are also spot on. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261004-3-59bb8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-3-59bb8"}
