{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-01-26T17:09:00", "text": "To address the issue, we curated a more balanced training dataset that better represents the diverse needs of our target audience. We also implemented a bias detection and mitigation algorithm to ensure future datasets remain unbiased.", "utterranceID": "20270126-4-a97ad"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270126-4-a97ad"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2027-01-26T17:13:00", "text": "That's a solid approach, Emma. Thanks for tackling this so efficiently!", "utterranceID": "20270126-5-b1a4f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270126-5-b1a4f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-01-26T17:15:00", "text": "Thanks, George Miller! If anyone has further questions or notices any issues, feel free to reach out.", "utterranceID": "20270126-6-b9d46"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270126-6-b9d46"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2027-01-26T17:18:00", "text": "Will do, Emma. Thanks again for the quick turnaround!", "utterranceID": "20270126-7-24a27"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270126-7-24a27"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_022d1fd9", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T07:49:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect cache invalidation, titled 'Cache Invalidation Failure', has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/50.", "utterranceID": "20270128-0-34d96"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270128-0-34d96"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T07:52:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_022d1fd9! Could you explain what was causing the issue?", "utterranceID": "20270128-1-8597e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270128-1-8597e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_022d1fd9", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T07:57:00", "text": "Sure, George Garcia. The root cause was that our cache invalidation mechanism wasn't triggering when customer profiles were updated. This led to stale data being served from the cache, which affected the pitch generation process.", "utterranceID": "20270128-2-4ddb3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270128-2-4ddb3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T07:59:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Emma Smith. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270128-3-142d6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270128-3-142d6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_022d1fd9", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T08:02:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I updated the cache invalidation logic to listen for changes in customer profiles. Now, whenever there's an update, the cache is properly invalidated, ensuring that the most recent data is used.", "utterranceID": "20270128-4-6e745"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270128-4-6e745"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T08:07:00", "text": "Awesome work, @eid_022d1fd9! This should improve the accuracy of our pitches significantly.", "utterranceID": "20270128-5-55832"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270128-5-55832"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_022d1fd9", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T08:11:00", "text": "Thanks, George Miller! Let me know if you encounter any more issues. I'm here to help.", "utterranceID": "20270128-6-0d25f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270128-6-0d25f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T08:16:00", "text": "Thanks again, Emma Smith. I'll keep an eye on it and report back if anything comes up.", "utterranceID": "20270128-7-c3cca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270128-7-c3cca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2027-02-09T23:58:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with PitchForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270209-0-728bd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270209-0-728bd"}
