{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchFlow", "channelID": "ch-hflow-283c92"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e96d2f38", "timestamp": "2026-09-01T00:12:00", "text": "First up, there's a 'Non-Responsive Button in Form Components' issue in the React project. The submit button becomes unresponsive under certain conditions, similar to our SearchFlow cancel button problem. Check it out here: https://github.com/facebook/react/pull/238. @eid_f73462f7, any thoughts on this?", "utterranceID": "20260831-1-ec6a8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260831-1-ec6a8"}
