{"Channel": {"name": "planning-onForceX", "channelID": "ch-orcex-60b1fb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5346d7a5", "timestamp": "2026-07-17T21:23:14", "text": "@here Learn about the integration of AI in communication platforms with this blog post, which discusses features like onForceX's smart actions. https://www.ai-blog.com/2023/07/integrating-ai-in-communication-platforms/", "utterranceID": "20260717-94-143ec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260717-94-143ec"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T08:39:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I implemented a robust rate limiting mechanism using a token bucket algorithm. This ensures that each endpoint now has a strict limit on the number of requests that can be made in a given timeframe, effectively mitigating the risk of brute force attacks.", "utterranceID": "20261201-4-4d000"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-4-4d000"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_443fee06", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T08:40:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid solution. Thanks for handling this so promptly, David!", "utterranceID": "20261201-5-851ac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-5-851ac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T08:43:00", "text": "Agreed, nice work! Let us know if there's anything else we need to do on our end.", "utterranceID": "20261201-6-e3b3a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-6-e3b3a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T08:45:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_802e8eff and @eid_443fee06. No further action is needed from you guys at the moment. I'll keep monitoring the endpoints to ensure everything runs smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261201-7-679da"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-7-679da"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T14:33:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Blocking JavaScript Execution in ActionGenie' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ActionGenie/pull/34.", "utterranceID": "20261209-0-5e084"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-0-5e084"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T14:35:00", "text": "The root cause was that heavy computational tasks were being executed on the main thread without yielding. This blocked the UI thread, causing the interface to freeze when ActionGenie executed complex JavaScript logic.", "utterranceID": "20261209-1-1cb12"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-1-1cb12"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T14:37:00", "text": "To fix this, I refactored the code to offload these heavy tasks to a Web Worker. This allows the main thread to remain responsive, preventing the UI from freezing. Let me know if you have any questions!", "utterranceID": "20261209-2-f233e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-2-f233e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_443fee06", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T14:38:00", "text": "Great work, David! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. I'll test it out and let you know if I encounter any issues.", "utterranceID": "20261209-3-5e533"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-3-5e533"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T14:40:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_fc4619fa! Moving the tasks to a Web Worker sounds like a solid solution. I'll also take a look and run some tests on my end.", "utterranceID": "20261209-4-12ea7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-4-12ea7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T14:41:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_443fee06 and Charlie. I appreciate your help with testing. Let me know if anything comes up!", "utterranceID": "20261209-5-814a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-5-814a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_443fee06", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T00:04:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect suggestions for regional dialects in ActionGenie has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ActionGenie/pull/35.", "utterranceID": "20261210-0-e4709"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-0-e4709"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T00:07:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_443fee06! Can you explain what was causing the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261210-1-a93ed"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-1-a93ed"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_443fee06", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T00:09:00", "text": "Sure, Charlie. The root cause was that our NLP model didn't have enough training data for regional dialects and less common languages. This led to poor understanding and inaccurate action suggestions.", "utterranceID": "20261210-2-f3dbd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-2-f3dbd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bea0ad"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T00:11:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, David G. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261210-3-a9410"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-3-a9410"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e96d2f38", "timestamp": "2027-01-12T04:54:00", "text": "First, we have a bug in the Celery project titled 'Task Queue Bottleneck Due to Unhandled Exceptions'. It sounds very similar to our issue with unhandled exceptions causing delays. You can check it out here: https://github.com/celery/celery/pull/26. @eid_b98a194c, this might be useful for your current task!", "utterranceID": "20270112-1-5e109"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270112-1-5e109"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b98a194c", "timestamp": "2027-01-12T04:56:00", "text": "Thanks, David! I'll review the PR and see if there are any insights we can apply to our task queue management system. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270112-2-c3e95"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270112-2-c3e95"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e96d2f38", "timestamp": "2027-01-12T05:01:00", "text": "Next up, there's a Kubernetes bug titled 'Inefficient Load Balancing Across Nodes'. This is quite similar to our load balancing issue. Here's the link: https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/27. Bob, this might be relevant for your work on load balancing. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270112-3-ee92c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270112-3-ee92c"}
