{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8c5414f1", "timestamp": "2027-01-28T03:01:00", "text": "Thanks, David! I'll review the Express.js PR. It's crucial to see how others handle CORS settings to protect user data. If anyone has experience with CORS configurations, feel free to share! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20270127-6-83160"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270127-6-83160"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e96d2f38", "timestamp": "2027-01-28T03:03:00", "text": "Awesome! Let's keep these open-source examples in mind as we work through our issues. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or want to discuss further. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270127-7-4313f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270127-7-4313f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b98a194c", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T11:33:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Task Queue Bottleneck Due to Unhandled Exceptions' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ActionGenie/pull/42.", "utterranceID": "20270129-0-953e5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-0-953e5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b98a194c", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T11:37:00", "text": "The root cause was that certain edge cases were triggering exceptions that weren't properly caught and handled. This caused the task queue to become blocked, preventing further task processing.", "utterranceID": "20270129-1-d1956"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-1-d1956"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b98a194c", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T11:38:00", "text": "To fix this, I added a try-catch block around the task execution logic to ensure all exceptions are caught and logged. Additionally, I implemented a retry mechanism for transient errors, which should prevent the queue from getting stuck again.", "utterranceID": "20270129-2-76a74"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-2-76a74"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e96d2f38", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T11:43:00", "text": "Great work, Charlie Smith! Thanks for resolving this so quickly. This should really help with our processing times.", "utterranceID": "20270129-3-b4a85"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-3-b4a85"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b23ad28c", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T11:47:00", "text": "@eid_b98a194c Awesome job! I'll monitor the task queue performance over the next few days to ensure everything is running smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20270129-4-2d78e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-4-2d78e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0cd4cb", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T11:49:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie Smith. I'll update the documentation to reflect these changes. Let me know if there's anything specific you want included.", "utterranceID": "20270129-5-ba252"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-5-ba252"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b98a194c", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T11:53:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you notice any issues or have further questions.", "utterranceID": "20270129-6-038f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-6-038f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-29b89d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0cd4cb", "timestamp": "2027-02-01T00:37:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Inefficient Load Balancing Across Servers' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ActionGenie/pull/43.", "utterranceID": "20270131-0-ae050"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-0-ae050"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bf4d34"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92294e45", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T02:17:00", "text": "The root cause was that the UI thread was getting blocked due to synchronous processing of action suggestions. This was causing the interface to become unresponsive when ActionGenie tried to suggest multiple actions at once in busy channels.", "utterranceID": "20270118-1-ba417"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-1-ba417"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bf4d34"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92294e45", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T02:22:00", "text": "To fix this, I refactored the code to handle action suggestions asynchronously. Now, suggestions are processed in a separate thread, which keeps the UI responsive even when multiple suggestions are being generated.", "utterranceID": "20270118-2-18b62"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-2-18b62"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bf4d34"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T02:27:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_92294e45! Thanks for tackling this so quickly. I'll test it out in a few busy channels to ensure everything is smooth.", "utterranceID": "20270118-3-810af"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-3-810af"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bf4d34"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T02:28:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah! This should really improve the user experience. I'll update the documentation to reflect these changes.", "utterranceID": "20270118-4-a243b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-4-a243b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-bf4d34"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92294e45", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T02:32:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian and Emma! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. I'll be around to help.", "utterranceID": "20270118-5-3620e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-5-3620e"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d67508f1", "timestamp": "2026-12-24T22:28:00", "text": "Sure, Emma. The root cause was an improper implementation of access control mechanisms in the API responsible for retrieving action history data. It wasn't properly verifying user permissions before granting access.", "utterranceID": "20261224-2-b2881"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-2-b2881"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_21de287d", "timestamp": "2026-12-24T22:32:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Bob. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261224-3-33729"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-3-33729"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d67508f1", "timestamp": "2026-12-24T22:36:00", "text": "To resolve it, I updated the API to include a robust access control check. Now, it verifies the user's permissions against the action history they are trying to access. This ensures that only authorized users can view the data.", "utterranceID": "20261224-4-beec7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-4-beec7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8175da95", "timestamp": "2026-12-24T22:40:00", "text": "Awesome work, @eid_d67508f1! This should definitely help in maintaining data privacy.", "utterranceID": "20261224-5-c2e69"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-5-c2e69"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d67508f1", "timestamp": "2026-12-24T22:45:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona! If anyone encounters any issues or has further questions, feel free to reach out.", "utterranceID": "20261224-6-75490"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-6-75490"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4afd9484", "timestamp": "2026-12-24T22:48:00", "text": "Will do, Bob. Thanks for the quick turnaround on this!", "utterranceID": "20261224-7-2681f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-7-2681f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_21de287d", "timestamp": "2026-12-28T05:34:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect processing of non-Latin scripts in ActionGenie has been resolved. 🎉", "utterranceID": "20261228-0-b89a8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261228-0-b89a8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_21de287d", "timestamp": "2026-12-28T05:37:00", "text": "The issue was due to encoding problems in our language processing system, which caused garbled text and incorrect action suggestions.", "utterranceID": "20261228-1-471a1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261228-1-471a1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_21de287d", "timestamp": "2026-12-28T05:42:00", "text": "I've fixed it by updating the text encoding library to support a wider range of character sets and added a fallback mechanism for unsupported scripts.", "utterranceID": "20261228-2-85bbf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261228-2-85bbf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_21de287d", "timestamp": "2026-12-28T05:45:00", "text": "You can check out the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ActionGenie/pull/38", "utterranceID": "20261228-3-ed910"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261228-3-ed910"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmajones-ActionGenie", "channelID": "ch-genie-6dda6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d67508f1", "timestamp": "2026-12-28T05:49:00", "text": "@eid_21de287d Great job, Hannah! Thanks for tackling this so quickly.", "utterranceID": "20261228-4-f1e72"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261228-4-f1e72"}
