{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9307fe85", "timestamp": "2026-11-26T07:18:00", "text": "The concern was that model parameters are stored in an unencrypted format, which could potentially allow unauthorized access.", "utterranceID": "20261125-1-d5ab2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261125-1-d5ab2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9307fe85", "timestamp": "2026-11-26T07:21:00", "text": "After reviewing the storage mechanism, I found that this is actually the expected behavior for our current system setup.", "utterranceID": "20261125-2-6a6d8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261125-2-6a6d8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9307fe85", "timestamp": "2026-11-26T07:25:00", "text": "The parameters are stored in a secure, isolated environment that is not exposed to external networks, which mitigates the risk of unauthorized access.", "utterranceID": "20261125-3-b0b77"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261125-3-b0b77"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9307fe85", "timestamp": "2026-11-26T07:28:00", "text": "Additionally, the system is configured to restrict access to authorized personnel only, ensuring that any interaction with the parameters is logged and monitored.", "utterranceID": "20261125-4-36f84"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261125-4-36f84"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9307fe85", "timestamp": "2026-11-26T07:29:00", "text": "I confirmed this with our security team, and they agree that no further action is required at this time.", "utterranceID": "20261125-5-33e1d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261125-5-33e1d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-26T07:32:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Bob. It's good to know that our current setup already addresses this concern.", "utterranceID": "20261125-6-6e8ad"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261125-6-6e8ad"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_15ac3a3b", "timestamp": "2026-11-26T07:35:00", "text": "@eid_9307fe85 Thanks for clarifying, Bob. It's reassuring to know that our access controls are robust.", "utterranceID": "20261125-7-e6662"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261125-7-e6662"}
