{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_edf6a3fc", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T16:16:00", "text": "Blueprints are a fantastic way to keep things modular. @eid_2347b567, maybe we can adapt this concept to ensure our API remains scalable as it grows. What do you think?", "utterranceID": "20261008-6-2dd15"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-6-2dd15"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T16:21:00", "text": "Absolutely, Fiona. I'll look into how we can incorporate a similar modular design. It could really help us maintain a clean architecture. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261008-7-2fa75"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-7-2fa75"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_54905dcb", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T16:23:00", "text": "Flask's simplicity is always appealing. Their blueprints could definitely help us avoid a monolithic structure.", "utterranceID": "20261008-8-02424"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-8-02424"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T16:27:00", "text": "Lastly, we have Express.js's [Middleware for Enhanced API Security](https://github.com/expressjs/express/pull/3156). This feature implements middleware for security enhancements like rate limiting and input validation.", "utterranceID": "20261008-9-88c00"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-9-88c00"}
