{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5058fefc", "timestamp": "2027-04-04T19:05:00", "text": "Sure, Ian. I implemented a more efficient data chunking strategy that processes the model in smaller, manageable pieces. This reduces the load on the UI and prevents it from freezing.", "utterranceID": "20270404-5-3c8fa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270404-5-3c8fa"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2027-04-04T19:08:00", "text": "Nice work, Fiona! This should improve the user experience significantly.", "utterranceID": "20270404-6-3be6a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270404-6-3be6a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5058fefc", "timestamp": "2027-04-04T19:11:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie! Let me know if you encounter any more issues or if there's anything else I can help with.", "utterranceID": "20270404-7-c3065"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270404-7-c3065"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4555ba9c", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T05:20:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect token expiry times causing authentication failures has been resolved. You can check out the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/52.", "utterranceID": "20270409-0-afacf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270409-0-afacf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5058fefc", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T05:23:00", "text": "Great news, Ian! Can you explain what was causing the issue?", "utterranceID": "20270409-1-509d0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270409-1-509d0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4555ba9c", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T05:24:00", "text": "Sure, Fiona. The root cause was a synchronization issue between the API layer and the authentication service. During token refresh operations, there were discrepancies in how token expiry times were validated, leading to intermittent rejections.", "utterranceID": "20270409-2-b5112"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270409-2-b5112"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T05:27:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, @eid_4555ba9c. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270409-3-dcdcd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270409-3-dcdcd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4555ba9c", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T05:31:00", "text": "To resolve it, I implemented a consistent time-check mechanism across both the API layer and the authentication service. This ensures that both components are in sync when validating token expiry times, especially during refresh operations.", "utterranceID": "20270409-4-76dc9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270409-4-76dc9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T05:36:00", "text": "Nice work, Ian! This should help reduce those unexpected authentication failures we've been seeing.", "utterranceID": "20270409-5-0bb18"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270409-5-0bb18"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4555ba9c", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T05:41:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie Miller. Let me know if you encounter any more issues related to this. I'll be monitoring the logs closely for the next few days.", "utterranceID": "20270409-6-7b3dc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270409-6-7b3dc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5058fefc", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T05:44:00", "text": "Appreciate your efforts, Ian. This fix will definitely improve our API reliability.", "utterranceID": "20270409-7-4d481"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270409-7-4d481"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T05:46:00", "text": "Agreed. Thanks for jumping on this so quickly, Ian.", "utterranceID": "20270409-8-f88f9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270409-8-f88f9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2027-04-12T21:43:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect data drift detection has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/53.", "utterranceID": "20270412-0-e3c82"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270412-0-e3c82"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5058fefc", "timestamp": "2027-04-12T21:48:00", "text": "Great news, Charlie! Can you explain what was causing the issue?", "utterranceID": "20270412-1-f1135"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270412-1-f1135"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2027-04-12T21:50:00", "text": "Sure, Fiona. The root cause was an incorrect threshold setting in the data drift detection algorithm. It was set too high, causing the system to overlook significant changes in data patterns.", "utterranceID": "20270412-2-c5ccd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270412-2-c5ccd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-04-12T21:54:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, @eid_3e076e53. How did you fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270412-3-92411"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270412-3-92411"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T20:16:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona! This was a critical issue, and I'm glad it's resolved. I'll review the PR shortly.", "utterranceID": "20270222-4-ba3b5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-4-ba3b5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T20:18:00", "text": "Nice job, Fiona! Let me know if there's anything else you need from my end to ensure everything is running smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20270222-5-24070"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-5-24070"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_edf6a3fc", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T20:21:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia and Charlie! I appreciate the support. Let me know if you encounter any issues or have further questions.", "utterranceID": "20270222-6-3d1fd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-6-3d1fd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-27T05:11:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with EdgeForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270226-0-4b8c3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270226-0-4b8c3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-27T05:12:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Improper Session Management'. Sessions for accessing AI models aren't managed properly, which could lead to session hijacking and unauthorized access. This affects the Security & Access Control area and poses a significant risk, especially for environments handling confidential data. Impacted customer is CUST-0113. @eid_bac7c6c4, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20270226-1-4ed8d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270226-1-4ed8d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-02-27T05:14:00", "text": "Got it, I'll prioritize this. Security is crucial, especially with sensitive AI models. I'll start investigating the session management protocols right away. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20270226-2-e8365"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270226-2-e8365"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-27T05:16:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_bac7c6c4! Next, we have 'Incorrect Scaling of Visual Elements'. Visual elements like graphs and charts aren't scaling correctly on different screen sizes, leading to distorted visualizations. This affects the User Interface & Visualization Module, causing frustration and workflow interruptions for users. Impacted customer is CUST-0019. @eid_4b38019b, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270226-3-0a412"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270226-3-0a412"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2027-02-27T05:18:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the UI scaling issues and see what's causing the distortion. It's important users can interact with the UI smoothly. 📊", "utterranceID": "20270226-4-dd119"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270226-4-dd119"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-27T05:22:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Lastly, we have an 'AI Model Versioning Conflict'. The API is serving responses from incorrect AI model versions, leading to inconsistent data outputs. This impacts the API Layer and could cause application errors for developers relying on consistent data. Impacted customer is CUST-0041. @eid_bac7c6c4, this one's also for you.", "utterranceID": "20270226-5-8c322"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270226-5-8c322"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-02-27T05:27:00", "text": "Understood, I'll handle this as well. Ensuring the API serves the correct model versions is critical for data consistency. I'll coordinate with the API team to resolve this. 🤖", "utterranceID": "20270226-6-1116c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270226-6-1116c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-27T05:32:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep communication open and update each other on progress. Feel free to ask questions or share insights as you work through these issues. 💬", "utterranceID": "20270226-7-6fa01"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270226-7-6fa01"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T21:40:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current Salesforce issues. Let's take a look at them together! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261229-0-55379"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-0-55379"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T21:44:00", "text": "First, there's a 'Data Corruption During Model Training' issue in TensorFlow. Users are experiencing data corruption with large datasets, leading to inaccurate predictions. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/1051. @eid_2347b567, this seems similar to our data corruption issue. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20261229-1-25f6e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-1-25f6e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T21:49:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This is definitely relevant. The TensorFlow issue might give us insights into handling large datasets more effectively. I'll review their approach and see if we can apply any of their fixes. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261229-2-45078"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-2-45078"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T21:54:00", "text": "Great! Next, we have an 'Inconsistent Model Serialization' issue in PyTorch. Serialized models are producing different results on different devices, which sounds a lot like our serialization problem. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/1052. Julia Smith, could you take a look at this one too?", "utterranceID": "20261229-3-a30ec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-3-a30ec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T21:59:00", "text": "Absolutely, Julia! The PyTorch issue could provide some valuable insights into ensuring consistency across devices. I'll dive into their PR and see what strategies they used. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261229-4-f7476"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-4-f7476"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T22:03:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's an 'Overheating Under Load' issue in Raspberry Pi OS. Devices are overheating during intensive tasks, causing throttling. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/raspberrypi/linux/pull/1053. Julia Jones, this seems similar to our thermal management issue. What do you think?", "utterranceID": "20261229-5-ec4c7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-5-ec4c7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T22:06:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This is very relevant. I'll review their thermal management strategies and see if we can adapt any of their solutions to our EdgeForce devices. 🔥", "utterranceID": "20261229-6-38810"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-6-38810"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T22:10:00", "text": "Perfect! Let's use these insights to improve our solutions. If anyone needs more info or resources, just shout. Let's keep our customers happy and systems running smoothly! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261229-7-857bc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-7-857bc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T22:15:00", "text": "Thanks for the resources, Julia! I'll keep everyone updated on my findings. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261229-8-06100"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-8-06100"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T22:16:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! I'll start testing some of the Raspberry Pi OS strategies and let you know how it goes. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261229-9-09bb1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-9-09bb1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T03:12:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Inadequate Thermal Management' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/35.", "utterranceID": "20261230-0-83273"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261230-0-83273"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T03:15:00", "text": "That's great news, @eid_bac7c6c4! Could you explain what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20261230-1-e69e6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261230-1-e69e6"}

