{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T11:31:00", "text": "@eid_b6a30126 created this channel on 2027-01-06 11:31:00. This is the very beginning of the bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce channel.", "utterranceID": "20270106-0-94d0f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-0-94d0f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T11:31:00", "text": "@eid_b6a30126 joined bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce. Also, @eid_a0fe567d, @eid_5058fefc, @eid_4555ba9c, @eid_3e076e53, @eid_54905dcb joined via invite.", "utterranceID": "20270106-1-10f24"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-1-10f24"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T13:02:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with EdgeForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270106-0-3d920"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-0-3d920"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T13:05:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Insecure Model Serialization'. The problem is that AI models are being serialized and stored in an unencrypted format. This affects the Security & Access Control area and poses a significant risk, especially for environments handling confidential data. Impacted customer is CUST-0095. @eid_3e076e53, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20270106-1-22057"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-1-22057"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T13:09:00", "text": "Got it, thanks for the heads-up! I'll start looking into securing the serialization process to prevent unauthorized access. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20270106-2-2e52a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-2-2e52a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T13:12:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Rate Limiting Misconfiguration'. API requests are being throttled unexpectedly due to incorrect settings, impacting the API Layer. This is causing issues for developers and applications relying on consistent data retrieval. Customer affected is CUST-0078. @eid_54905dcb, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270106-3-e7691"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-3-e7691"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_54905dcb", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T13:16:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll review the rate limiting configurations and make the necessary adjustments to ensure smooth API operations. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270106-4-ce99a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-4-ce99a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T13:21:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have 'Delayed Response in Interactive Dashboards'. Users are experiencing significant delays when interacting with data visualizations in the UI. This affects the User Interface & Visualization Module and is causing frustration for CUST-0077. @eid_4555ba9c, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20270106-5-de034"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-5-de034"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4555ba9c", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T13:23:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll dive into the dashboard performance issues and work on optimizing the response times. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20270106-6-44df2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-6-44df2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T13:28:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep the impacted customers updated on our progress. Feel free to reach out if you need any additional resources or support. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270106-7-dc915"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-7-dc915"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T13:30:00", "text": "Will do! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_b6a30126. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270106-8-96492"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-8-96492"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_54905dcb", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T13:34:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_b6a30126! Let's get these issues sorted out. 💪", "utterranceID": "20270106-9-08200"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-9-08200"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4555ba9c", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T13:38:00", "text": "Thanks for the info, @eid_b6a30126. Let's make it happen! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270106-10-f5984"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-10-f5984"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-27T01:19:00", "text": "I've fixed the bug by updating the configuration parser to correctly handle edge cases in the YAML files. The parser now properly interprets all hyperparameter values, ensuring accurate model updates.", "utterranceID": "20270126-2-0f9f8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270126-2-0f9f8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-27T01:23:00", "text": "You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/38", "utterranceID": "20270126-3-60ac4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270126-3-60ac4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-27T01:25:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Julia Smith! Great job on resolving this quickly. I'll review the changes in the PR.", "utterranceID": "20270126-4-4baa6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270126-4-4baa6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-27T01:26:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia Martinez! Let me know if you have any questions or need further clarification on the changes.", "utterranceID": "20270126-5-21d02"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270126-5-21d02"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-27T01:30:00", "text": "Will do. Appreciate the swift resolution. This should help improve our model's performance significantly.", "utterranceID": "20270126-6-ebc34"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270126-6-ebc34"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:32:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with EdgeForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270129-0-78c77"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-0-78c77"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:35:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Memory Leak in Visualization Rendering'. This is affecting the User Interface & Visualization Module, causing slow performance and crashes. Customer CUST-0076 is impacted. @eid_4df3bcc2, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20270129-1-78766"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-1-78766"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:36:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the memory leak issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270129-2-329b6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-2-329b6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:38:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, there's a 'Version Mismatch in Model Deployment'. This is causing discrepancies in predictions, affecting Customer CUST-0088. It's in the Model Management & Update Module. @eid_4df3bcc2, you're also on this one.", "utterranceID": "20270129-3-06832"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-3-06832"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:43:00", "text": "Understood. I'll make sure to address the version mismatch issue as well. If anyone has insights on recent deployments, let me know! 🤔", "utterranceID": "20270129-4-80962"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-4-80962"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:44:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_4df3bcc2! Lastly, we have a 'Cache Invalidation Failure' in the API Layer. This is leading to stale data being served, impacting Customer CUST-0101. @eid_edf6a3fc, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270129-5-0708d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-5-0708d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_edf6a3fc", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:48:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the cache invalidation issue and see what's causing the stale data. If anyone has logs or recent changes to the API, please share! 📊", "utterranceID": "20270129-6-83917"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-6-83917"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:53:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these so quickly! Let's keep the communication open and update each other as we make progress. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270129-7-000b3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-7-000b3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:55:00", "text": "Will do! I'll keep you all posted on the visualization and model deployment issues. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20270129-8-fac61"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-8-fac61"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_edf6a3fc", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:56:00", "text": "Same here, I'll update once I have more info on the cache issue. Thanks for coordinating, @eid_91523bad! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270129-9-e583f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-9-e583f"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-01T16:31:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that are similar to the ones we're tackling in Salesforce. Let's take a look and see if we can learn anything from them! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270201-0-3e1be"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270201-0-3e1be"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-01T16:34:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Memory Leak in Dashboard Rendering' in Grafana. Users are experiencing increased memory usage leading to slow performance and crashes, much like our visualization issue. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/grafana/grafana/pull/1067. @eid_4df3bcc2, this might be useful for your current work!", "utterranceID": "20270201-1-e839e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270201-1-e839e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-02-01T16:38:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This sounds very similar to what we're seeing with EdgeForce. I'll review the PR and see if there are any insights or fixes we can apply. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270201-2-75463"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270201-2-75463"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-01T16:39:00", "text": "Next, there's a 'Version Mismatch in Model Serving' issue in TensorFlow. It's causing inconsistent model predictions due to version discrepancies, similar to our model deployment problem. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/1068. Alice, any thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20270201-3-366c2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270201-3-366c2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-02-01T16:44:00", "text": "This is spot on with what we're dealing with. I'll dive into the TensorFlow PR and see if their approach can help us resolve our version mismatch. If anyone else has experience with TensorFlow, feel free to chime in! 🤔", "utterranceID": "20270201-4-17e00"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270201-4-17e00"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-01T16:49:00", "text": "Lastly, there's a 'Cache Invalidation Bug in API Gateway' in Kong. It's leading to stale API responses, which is exactly what we're seeing in our API Layer. Here's the PR: https://github.com/Kong/kong/pull/1069. Fiona, this might be relevant for you!", "utterranceID": "20270201-5-f63d9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270201-5-f63d9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_edf6a3fc", "timestamp": "2027-02-01T16:50:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! I'll take a look at the Kong PR and see if their solution can be adapted for our cache invalidation issue. If anyone has additional insights or logs, please share! 📊", "utterranceID": "20270201-6-1a763"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270201-6-1a763"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-01T16:51:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for being proactive! Let's keep sharing any findings or solutions that could help us resolve our issues faster. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270201-7-03168"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270201-7-03168"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-02-01T16:54:00", "text": "Will do! I'll update the team as I make progress on the visualization and model deployment issues. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20270201-8-87fdd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270201-8-87fdd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_edf6a3fc", "timestamp": "2027-02-01T16:59:00", "text": "Same here, I'll keep you posted on the cache invalidation progress. Thanks for coordinating, Julia! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270201-9-8b22a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270201-9-8b22a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-02-04T06:16:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about inconsistent model visualization updates has been resolved. 🎉", "utterranceID": "20270203-0-db28d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270203-0-db28d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-02-04T06:20:00", "text": "The issue was due to a race condition in the event handling system. Updates to the visualization were not synchronized with the data processing pipeline, leading to discrepancies.", "utterranceID": "20270203-1-ff3ae"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270203-1-ff3ae"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-03-30T03:41:00", "text": "Awesome! Thanks for the update, Julia. Let me know if there's anything else you need from the QA side.", "utterranceID": "20270329-5-06064"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270329-5-06064"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-03-30T03:46:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you encounter any more issues. I'll be around to help.", "utterranceID": "20270329-6-1f512"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270329-6-1f512"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T08:43:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect rollbacks during model updates has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/50.", "utterranceID": "20270401-0-fe24c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-0-fe24c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T08:46:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_4df3bcc2! Can you remind us what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20270401-1-78981"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-1-78981"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T08:48:00", "text": "Sure, Julia. The issue was with the transaction management system. It wasn't correctly reverting changes when an update failed, which led to incomplete or corrupted models on devices.", "utterranceID": "20270401-2-ef3d2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-2-ef3d2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_edf6a3fc", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T08:49:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Alice. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270401-3-45888"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-3-45888"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T08:52:00", "text": "I updated the transaction management logic to ensure it properly tracks all changes during an update. Now, if an update fails, it correctly rolls back all changes, leaving the device in its previous stable state.", "utterranceID": "20270401-4-d801a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-4-d801a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T08:55:00", "text": "Nice work, Alice! This should definitely improve the reliability of our predictions.", "utterranceID": "20270401-5-54ca7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-5-54ca7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T08:59:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_91523bad! Let me know if you encounter any further issues.", "utterranceID": "20270401-6-efd52"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-6-efd52"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-04-01T09:03:00", "text": "Will do, Alice. Thanks for the quick turnaround on this!", "utterranceID": "20270401-7-343f6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270401-7-343f6"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c9c3d8d5", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T00:37:00", "text": "For the performance issue, we might need to revisit the 'Edge Processing Layer' section. Let's consider optimizing our data processing algorithms and resource management strategies. We should also mention testing on varied hardware to ensure consistent performance. 💻", "utterranceID": "20260911-3-42f67"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-3-42f67"}
