{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T17:45:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Security Vulnerability in API Flow Authentication' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FlowForce/pull/41.", "utterranceID": "20261018-0-b4f1e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-0-b4f1e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T17:48:00", "text": "The root cause was improper validation of authentication tokens in the API flow management module, which allowed unauthorized access to API flows.", "utterranceID": "20261018-1-14f08"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-1-14f08"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T17:52:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a stricter validation process for authentication tokens, ensuring they are verified against a secure token registry before granting access to any API flows.", "utterranceID": "20261018-2-c240c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-2-c240c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T17:57:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_fc0f17c3! This was a critical issue, and I'm glad it's resolved. Thanks for the quick turnaround.", "utterranceID": "20261018-3-921aa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-3-921aa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T18:02:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona! This fix will definitely enhance our security posture. I'll update the documentation to reflect these changes.", "utterranceID": "20261018-4-2e3b8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-4-2e3b8"}
