{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T08:24:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that mirror the issues we're tackling in Salesforce. Let's take a look and see what we can learn! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260828-0-7cc26"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-0-7cc26"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T08:25:00", "text": "First up, we have a bug in OpenSSL: **Weak Encryption Algorithm for Stored Data**. This is similar to our weak encryption issue in the Authentication Module. You can check out the PR here: https://github.com/openssl/openssl/pull/1276. @eid_b7702c98, any thoughts on this?", "utterranceID": "20260828-1-7147b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-1-7147b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T08:27:00", "text": "Thanks, David! This is definitely relevant. The OpenSSL team is addressing outdated encryption algorithms, which is exactly what we're dealing with. I'll review their approach and see if we can apply similar improvements. 🔐", "utterranceID": "20260828-2-8348f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-2-8348f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T08:30:00", "text": "Great, Bob! Next, let's look at TensorFlow's issue: **Inaccurate Model Predictions Due to Data Preprocessing Bug**. This mirrors our data preprocessing error affecting forecasts. Here's the PR: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/1277. Alice, what do you think?", "utterranceID": "20260828-3-5f99e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-3-5f99e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_57e922c4", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T08:35:00", "text": "This is spot on, David! The TensorFlow team is tackling preprocessing errors that lead to inaccurate predictions, just like our forecasting issue. I'll dive into their solution and see how we can enhance our data preprocessing logic. 📊", "utterranceID": "20260828-4-67219"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-4-67219"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T08:40:00", "text": "Awesome, Alice! Lastly, we have a PostgreSQL bug: **Suboptimal Query Execution Plans**. This is similar to our inefficient query execution issue. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/postgres/postgres/pull/1278. Bob, any insights?", "utterranceID": "20260828-5-49d27"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-5-49d27"}
