{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T21:35:00", "text": "@eid_48e149b5 joined develop-juliadavis-PitchForce.", "utterranceID": "20260918-64-9ccbd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-64-9ccbd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_48e149b5", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T02:26:00", "text": "Hi team, I came across some interesting open-source projects that have implemented similar backward compatibility features. Thought it might be useful to discuss them as we work on our PR. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260918-0-9d06a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-0-9d06a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_48e149b5", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T02:29:00", "text": "First up, there's a PR from Django: [Backward Compatibility Layer for ORM Queries](https://github.com/django/django/pull/3625). It ensures existing ORM queries remain functional by translating them to the new query syntax. Sounds pretty relevant to what we're doing!", "utterranceID": "20260918-1-bc7bd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-1-bc7bd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8b67a68f", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T02:31:00", "text": "That's interesting, Alice! Django's approach could definitely offer some insights. Their ORM is quite robust, and maintaining backward compatibility there is no small feat. We might be able to borrow some ideas on how they handle query translation. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260918-2-a71a3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-2-a71a3"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-07-14T17:24:00", "text": "Yes, George. We should also consider mentioning backend optimizations to prevent bottlenecks. Adding a note on regular performance audits could be beneficial too. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260713-4-88144"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260713-4-88144"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-07-14T17:25:00", "text": "Regarding the UI complexity, we should revise the 'User Interface' section to emphasize user-friendly onboarding and tutorial features. Incorporating user feedback more effectively during design phases could also be highlighted. Thoughts, @eid_50da4819?", "utterranceID": "20260713-5-92431"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260713-5-92431"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_50da4819", "timestamp": "2026-07-14T17:28:00", "text": "Absolutely, Charlie. We could add a paragraph about simplifying the UI layout and enhancing the onboarding process to make it more intuitive for new users. This should help reduce the learning curve. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260713-6-6cb66"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260713-6-6cb66"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5af96a7d", "timestamp": "2026-07-14T17:33:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! To summarize: we'll enhance the 'Core AI Engine' with NLP improvements, update 'System Architecture' for better performance handling, and refine the 'User Interface' for usability. Let's also add a section on expanding CRM integration options. I'll draft these changes and share them for review. Next steps: I'll circulate the updated document by EOD. Thanks, team! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260713-7-b70ee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260713-7-b70ee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5af96a7d", "timestamp": "2026-07-15T05:13:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_paix_market_research_report|Market Research Report>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260714-0-0afce"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260714-0-0afce"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c0df5be6", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T16:54:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Product Vision Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some feedback from the latest release of pAIX that we need to address. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260716-0-ec922"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-0-ec922"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1cfce648", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T16:55:10", "text": "@here Explore the capabilities of the OpenAI GPT-3 library, which powers many AI-driven applications like pAIX. Dive into its features and how it can be used for generating personalized content. https://github.com/openai/gpt-3", "utterranceID": "20260716-101-92e7c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-101-92e7c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T16:58:00", "text": "Hey @eid_c0df5be6, I think we should start by addressing the AI-generated pitches issue. We need to enhance our NLP capabilities to capture more context-specific nuances. Maybe we can add a section in the Core AI Engine about expanding our training datasets to include more industry-specific data?", "utterranceID": "20260716-1-dba92"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-1-dba92"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T17:00:00", "text": "Agreed, Julia. Also, from a UX perspective, we should consider revising the User Interface section to include more intuitive onboarding features. This could help new users get up to speed faster and reduce the learning curve. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260716-2-20438"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-2-20438"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_888411ab", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T17:03:00", "text": "Good points, @eid_85a4de81 and @eid_59bbe6f6. For the integration issue, we should expand the System Architecture section to emphasize the need for broader CRM compatibility. This could involve developing more APIs or forming partnerships with major CRM providers.", "utterranceID": "20260716-3-c6e7e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-3-c6e7e"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-42f3dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_17e55125", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T21:21:00", "text": "On it! Looking forward to seeing how you've integrated the pre-trained models. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260903-3-98a02"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-3-98a02"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-42f3dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_022d1fd9", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T21:25:00", "text": "Just finished reviewing. The integration looks solid, and I was able to load and use the pre-trained models without any issues. Documentation is clear and helpful. Great job, @eid_dd1ff0ca! LGTM, approved! ✅", "utterranceID": "20260903-4-64272"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-4-64272"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-42f3dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_38700e5f", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T21:30:00", "text": "I agree with @eid_022d1fd9. The unit tests are comprehensive and ensure the models perform as expected. Everything meets the acceptance criteria. Well done, @eid_dd1ff0ca! LGTM, approved! 🎉", "utterranceID": "20260903-5-5faf0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-5-5faf0"}
