{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T04:26:00", "text": "First up, there's a bug in React Native titled 'Swipe Gesture Detection Failure'. Mobile users are experiencing inconsistent swipe gesture recognition, which is similar to our 'Gesture Recognition Failures' issue. You can check it out here: https://github.com/facebook/react-native/pull/412. @eid_a041a433, does this sound familiar?", "utterranceID": "20270221-1-7d4e6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270221-1-7d4e6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a041a433", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T04:27:00", "text": "Absolutely, Julia! This React Native issue seems quite similar to what we're seeing with PitchForce. I'll review their approach and see if we can apply any of their solutions to our problem. Thanks for sharing! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270221-2-94c91"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270221-2-94c91"}
