{"title": "Optimize Query Execution Plans by Updating Statistics and Adding Query Hints", "summary": "### Summary
This pull request addresses the issue of suboptimal query execution plans in ProposalForce, which was causing delays in proposal generation.

### Changes Made
- Updated database statistics to ensure the query optimizer has the most current data.
- Added specific query hints to guide the optimizer towards more efficient execution plans.

### Testing
- Verified that the updated statistics and query hints result in improved execution plans by analyzing query performance metrics.
- Conducted regression testing to ensure no adverse effects on existing functionalities.
