{"Channel": {"name": "develop-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-d38149"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-05-18T13:59:00", "text": "@eid_fd8cecea renamed the channel to develop-charliegarcia-SentimentForce.", "utterranceID": "20260518-63-d42b0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260518-63-d42b0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-d38149"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-05-22T04:30:00", "text": "Hi team, 👋 I wanted to kick off a discussion about some open-source features that might inform our evaluation of RabbitMQ and Kafka for our message queue needs. Let's dive in!", "utterranceID": "20260521-0-45c25"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260521-0-45c25"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-d38149"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-05-22T04:31:00", "text": "First up, we have a feature from Apache Kafka: the Enhanced Topic Monitoring Dashboard. This PR introduces a new dashboard for real-time monitoring of topic performance and health metrics. You can check it out here: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/2110. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260521-1-90708"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260521-1-90708"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-d38149"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-05-22T04:32:00", "text": "@Ian Garcia, this dashboard could be super useful for us, especially if we go with Kafka. Real-time monitoring is crucial for maintaining performance and quickly identifying issues. It seems like a solid addition. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260521-2-ac6e0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260521-2-ac6e0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-d38149"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_443fee06", "timestamp": "2026-05-22T04:33:00", "text": "Agreed, David Miller. Having a built-in monitoring tool would save us from integrating third-party solutions. Plus, it aligns well with our need for ease of integration. 📊", "utterranceID": "20260521-3-b93cf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260521-3-b93cf"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T20:31:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian. Appreciate the thorough investigation!", "utterranceID": "20261211-10-22511"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261211-10-22511"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T20:32:00", "text": "No problem, @eid_d96fb219. Let me know if there's anything else you need.", "utterranceID": "20261211-11-12a87"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261211-11-12a87"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-13T08:13:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SentimentForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261212-0-5fd39"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261212-0-5fd39"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-13T08:18:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Timezone Misalignment in Data Processing' issue. This is affecting the API Integration Module and causing incorrect timestamps, which leads to inaccurate sentiment trends. Customer CUST-0053 is impacted. @eid_13cb0e90, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261212-1-92a01"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261212-1-92a01"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-13T08:21:00", "text": "Got it, @eid_d96fb219! I'll start looking into the timezone misalignment issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261212-2-1ff85"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261212-2-1ff85"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-13T08:22:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Suboptimal Data Caching Strategy' issue. This is causing frequent cache misses and increased database load, leading to slow response times for sentiment reports. Customer CUST-0107 is affected. @eid_8658e19c, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20261212-3-39293"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261212-3-39293"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-13T08:27:00", "text": "Sure thing, I'll dive into the caching strategy and see how we can optimize it. Thanks for assigning this to me, @eid_d96fb219! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261212-4-f7a76"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261212-4-f7a76"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-13T08:29:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's an 'Inconsistent Sentiment Scoring Across Channels' issue. This is impacting the Sentiment Analysis Engine and causing inaccurate sentiment reports for Customer CUST-0042. @eid_8658e19c, can you also take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261212-5-b1565"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261212-5-b1565"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-13T08:32:00", "text": "No problem, I'll work on the sentiment scoring inconsistency as well. Let's make sure our reports are accurate! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261212-6-ee2cc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261212-6-ee2cc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-13T08:35:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you need any more details or run into any roadblocks. Let's get these issues resolved for our customers! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261212-7-a70a0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261212-7-a70a0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-13T08:37:00", "text": "Will do, thanks for coordinating, @eid_d96fb219! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261212-8-af072"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261212-8-af072"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-13T08:40:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_d96fb219! I'll keep you posted on the progress. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261212-9-e314b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261212-9-e314b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-16T20:47:00", "text": "Hi team, I found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current issues. Let's take a look at them! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261216-0-15ecf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261216-0-15ecf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-16T20:48:00", "text": "First up, we have a bug in Django related to 'Timezone Misalignment in DateTimeField'. This is similar to our timezone issue in SentimentForce. You can check out the PR here: https://github.com/django/django/pull/187. Julia, any thoughts on this?", "utterranceID": "20261216-1-ee216"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261216-1-ee216"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:19:00", "text": "Absolutely, Charlie! This is quite similar to what we're seeing with SentimentForce. I'll review their approach and see if we can apply any of their solutions to our Real-Time Dashboard. Thanks for sharing! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261019-2-e3d26"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-2-e3d26"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:24:00", "text": "Great! Next up, we have a 'Token Expiry Misconfiguration' in OAuth2 Proxy. Their access tokens aren't expiring as expected, which is a security risk. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/oauth2-proxy/oauth2-proxy/pull/172. David, this seems to align with our token expiry issue. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20261019-3-a4a66"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-3-a4a66"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:29:00", "text": "Yes, Charlie, this is very relevant! I'll dive into their PR to see how they tackled the token expiry problem. It might give us some insights for our User Authentication Module. Security first! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261019-4-d805d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-4-d805d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:30:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks David! Lastly, there's a 'Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) in Comment Section' vulnerability in WordPress. Attackers can inject scripts in the comment section, which is similar to our login page issue. Here's the PR: https://github.com/WordPress/WordPress/pull/173. Can you also take a look at this one?", "utterranceID": "20261019-5-992e5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-5-992e5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:31:00", "text": "Sure thing, Charlie! I'll review their fix for the XSS vulnerability and see if we can apply similar measures to secure our login page. 🛡️", "utterranceID": "20261019-6-13d2b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-6-13d2b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:33:00", "text": "Thanks, David! Let's keep these open-source solutions in mind as we work on our bugs. If you need any help or want to discuss further, just ping me. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261019-7-3439e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-7-3439e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:37:00", "text": "Will do, Charlie! I'll update you once I have more insights from the Django PR. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261019-8-02a6e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-8-02a6e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:39:00", "text": "Same here, I'll keep you posted on both the OAuth2 Proxy and WordPress issues. Thanks for coordinating, Charlie!", "utterranceID": "20261019-9-9c9c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-9-9c9c0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:29:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect sarcasm detection in our sentiment analysis engine has been resolved. You can check the details here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/40", "utterranceID": "20261021-0-bc593"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-0-bc593"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:32:00", "text": "That's great news, Ian! Can you remind us what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20261021-1-2822d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-1-2822d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:37:00", "text": "Sure, David. The root cause was that our sentiment model lacked advanced contextual understanding and tone detection, which are crucial for identifying sarcasm.", "utterranceID": "20261021-2-e7e4c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-2-e7e4c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:42:00", "text": "How did you manage to fix it, @eid_31cb6db5?", "utterranceID": "20261021-3-dee68"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-3-dee68"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:44:00", "text": "Good question, Charlie. We enhanced the model by integrating a new layer that uses transformer-based architecture to better understand context and tone. This allows it to differentiate between literal and sarcastic remarks more effectively.", "utterranceID": "20261021-4-70cf9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-4-70cf9"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T00:14:00", "text": "Awesome! Let's leverage these insights to improve our solutions. If you need any more info or run into issues, just ping me. Let's keep up the great work, team! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261002-7-66b65"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-7-66b65"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T00:15:00", "text": "Will do, thanks for the resources, Emma! It's always helpful to learn from the open-source community. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261002-8-17fca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-8-17fca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T00:16:00", "text": "Absolutely, thanks for coordinating, Emma! Let's get these issues sorted out. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261002-9-b432b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-9-b432b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:40:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Inefficient Query Execution Plan' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/39.", "utterranceID": "20261006-0-953d7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-0-953d7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:42:00", "text": "The root cause was due to a lack of updated statistics and missing query optimization hints, which led to the database generating suboptimal execution plans for retrieving sentiment data.", "utterranceID": "20261006-1-6de80"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-1-6de80"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:47:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the statistics on the relevant tables and added specific query optimization hints to guide the database management system towards more efficient execution paths.", "utterranceID": "20261006-2-455fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-2-455fb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:51:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_fa6ec727! This should help improve the query processing times significantly.", "utterranceID": "20261006-3-f16c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-3-f16c0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:53:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona! This was a critical issue, and I'm glad it's resolved. I'll run some tests to ensure everything is working smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261006-4-ebb1b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-4-ebb1b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:55:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob and Emma! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. I'm here to help.", "utterranceID": "20261006-5-f96d0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-5-f96d0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:56:00", "text": "Will do, Fiona. Thanks again for the quick turnaround on this!", "utterranceID": "20261006-6-c5cec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-6-c5cec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:44:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the security vulnerability in the user authentication module.", "utterranceID": "20261008-0-ffc40"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-0-ffc40"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:48:00", "text": "The concern was that a flaw allows unauthorized access to sentiment analysis reports, which could risk data privacy.", "utterranceID": "20261008-1-05881"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-1-05881"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:51:00", "text": "After reviewing the details, I found that this is not actually a bug that requires fixing.", "utterranceID": "20261008-2-37440"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-2-37440"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:52:00", "text": "Hey Fiona, could you explain why it's not a bug? It sounded serious.", "utterranceID": "20261008-3-e05e9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-3-e05e9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:56:00", "text": "Sure, Bob. The issue stems from a misunderstanding of how our authentication tokens are supposed to work.", "utterranceID": "20261008-4-f8949"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-4-f8949"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:57:00", "text": "The tokens are indeed validated and encrypted correctly. The unauthorized access was due to a misconfiguration in the user roles on the client side.", "utterranceID": "20261008-5-d5995"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-5-d5995"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T02:02:00", "text": "@eid_fa6ec727 So, it was a configuration issue rather than a code problem?", "utterranceID": "20261008-6-936bf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-6-936bf"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-04-23T02:59:00", "text": "Hey George, for the sentiment analysis misinterpretation, I think we should expand the NLP Engine section to include a focus on sarcasm and humor detection. We might need to incorporate additional datasets that include these elements. Thoughts, @eid_5890ce38?", "utterranceID": "20260422-1-808a1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260422-1-808a1"}
