{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-16T20:53:00", "text": "Great, thanks Julia! Next, there's a Redis bug titled 'Inefficient Cache Eviction Policy'. This is quite similar to our caching strategy issue. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/redis/redis/pull/188. Ian, what do you think?", "utterranceID": "20261216-3-813c4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261216-3-813c4"}
