{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-16T21:07:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma! I'll keep you posted on any progress or insights. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261216-9-a9c02"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261216-9-a9c02"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:29:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect timestamps in SentimentForce due to timezone misalignment has been resolved. 🎉 You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/48", "utterranceID": "20261219-0-37452"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-0-37452"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:30:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_13cb0e90! Can you give us a quick rundown of what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261219-1-9f3bb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-1-9f3bb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:32:00", "text": "Sure thing, Ian. The root cause was that our API Integration Module wasn't converting timestamps to a consistent timezone before processing. This led to temporal data inconsistencies and inaccurate sentiment trends.", "utterranceID": "20261219-2-87113"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-2-87113"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:36:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Julia. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261219-3-56141"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-3-56141"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:40:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I updated the API Integration Module to include a timezone conversion step. Now, all incoming timestamps are converted to UTC before any processing occurs. This ensures consistency across all data points.", "utterranceID": "20261219-4-917da"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-4-917da"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T22:23:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SentimentForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261017-0-c1d54"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261017-0-c1d54"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T22:25:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Time Zone Misalignment in Data Processing' issue. The sentiment data is processed with incorrect time zone settings, causing misalignment in the timing of sentiment updates on the dashboard. This affects the Real-Time Dashboard & Backend Server, impacting customer CUST-0052. @eid_fc4619fa, this one's for you!", "utterranceID": "20261017-1-dfb9a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261017-1-dfb9a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T22:30:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the time zone settings and see what's causing the misalignment. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261017-2-f0815"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261017-2-f0815"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T22:31:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Token Expiry Misconfiguration' issue. The authentication tokens aren't expiring as they should, which could expose sensitive sentiment data to unauthorized users. This affects the User Authentication Module and impacts customer CUST-0031. @eid_6cc1a0f6, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261017-3-586a3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261017-3-586a3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T22:32:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll dive into the token settings and ensure they expire correctly. Security is a top priority! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261017-4-84b34"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261017-4-84b34"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T22:37:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_6cc1a0f6! Lastly, there's a 'Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) in Login Page' vulnerability. This could allow attackers to execute malicious scripts and potentially steal user credentials. It's also in the User Authentication Module, impacting customer CUST-0089. @eid_6cc1a0f6, can you handle this one too?", "utterranceID": "20261017-5-a22fc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261017-5-a22fc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T22:41:00", "text": "Yes, I'll take care of the XSS issue as well. I'll make sure our login page is secure and free from vulnerabilities. 🛡️", "utterranceID": "20261017-6-b9403"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261017-6-b9403"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T22:43:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these so quickly! Let's keep our customers happy and secure. If you need any help or further details, just let me know. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261017-7-52975"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261017-7-52975"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T22:47:00", "text": "Will do! I'll update you once I have more info on the time zone issue. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261017-8-41803"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261017-8-41803"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T22:50:00", "text": "Same here, I'll keep you posted on both the token expiry and XSS issues. Thanks for coordinating, @eid_802e8eff!", "utterranceID": "20261017-9-7f6c9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261017-9-7f6c9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:12:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current issues. Let's take a look at them! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261019-0-249bc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-0-249bc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:16:00", "text": "First, there's a 'Time Zone Misalignment in Scheduled Tasks' issue in Django. Scheduled tasks are running at the wrong times due to time zone misconfigurations. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/django/django/pull/171. @eid_fc4619fa, this sounds similar to our time zone issue, right?", "utterranceID": "20261019-1-49a27"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-1-49a27"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:48:00", "text": "Impressive work, Ian! This should really improve our sentiment analysis accuracy.", "utterranceID": "20261021-5-0fb3e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-5-0fb3e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:52:00", "text": "Absolutely, Ian. Thanks for the update and the hard work on this fix!", "utterranceID": "20261021-6-3e1be"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-6-3e1be"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:56:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you encounter any more issues or have further questions.", "utterranceID": "20261021-7-64dfa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-7-64dfa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-25T12:55:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Slack Channel Subscription Errors' has been resolved. 🎉", "utterranceID": "20261025-0-75ca9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261025-0-75ca9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-25T12:57:00", "text": "The issue was that our system wasn't subscribing to new Slack channels automatically, which meant we were missing out on sentiment data from those channels.", "utterranceID": "20261025-1-cc882"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261025-1-cc882"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-25T12:59:00", "text": "The root cause was that our API Integration Module didn't dynamically update its channel subscription list when new channels were created or existing ones were renamed.", "utterranceID": "20261025-2-b3ce2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261025-2-b3ce2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-25T13:02:00", "text": "I've fixed this by implementing a listener that detects changes in the channel list and updates the subscription list accordingly. You can check out the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/41", "utterranceID": "20261025-3-fe9fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261025-3-fe9fb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-25T13:06:00", "text": "Great work, David! Thanks for the quick turnaround on this. I'll review the PR shortly.", "utterranceID": "20261025-4-6a6ca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261025-4-6a6ca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-25T13:10:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_6cc1a0f6! This should really help us keep our sentiment data up to date. I'll make sure to test it out on our end.", "utterranceID": "20261025-5-03ddc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261025-5-03ddc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-25T13:11:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie and Ian! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing.", "utterranceID": "20261025-6-6e0aa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261025-6-6e0aa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:11:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect sentiment scores on the dashboard, titled 'Sentiment Model Drift', has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/42.", "utterranceID": "20261028-0-a22e3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-0-a22e3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:12:00", "text": "The root cause was that our sentiment analysis model hadn't been retrained with recent data, which led to outdated or inaccurate sentiment scores being displayed.", "utterranceID": "20261028-1-ae66c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-1-ae66c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:17:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the model training pipeline to automatically incorporate new data every month. This ensures the model stays current and accurate. I've also added a monitoring system to alert us if the model's performance starts to degrade.", "utterranceID": "20261028-2-a2cdb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-2-a2cdb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:18:00", "text": "Great work, Ian! Thanks for getting this sorted out so quickly. The monitoring system sounds like a solid addition.", "utterranceID": "20261028-3-46138"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-3-46138"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:23:00", "text": "@eid_31cb6db5 Thanks, Ian! This should definitely improve the accuracy of our sentiment scores. Let me know if you need any help with the monitoring system.", "utterranceID": "20261028-4-37214"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-4-37214"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-04-06T09:43:00", "text": "Absolutely, Emma. This will help us prioritize and address these issues effectively in the next release.", "utterranceID": "20260505-8-43040"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260505-8-43040"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-04-08T22:42:00", "text": "Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of imentAIX. The issue was reported by QA Specialist eid_df392037.", "utterranceID": "20260421-0-bef37"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260421-0-bef37"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ec3b5d65", "timestamp": "2026-04-08T22:45:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma. What exactly did they find?", "utterranceID": "20260421-1-39038"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260421-1-39038"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-04-08T22:47:00", "text": "The integration with Slack is inconsistent, causing delays in real-time sentiment updates.", "utterranceID": "20260421-2-3bf2d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260421-2-3bf2d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2589c967", "timestamp": "2026-04-08T22:48:00", "text": "Hmm, could it be due to API rate limits or connectivity issues with Slack?", "utterranceID": "20260421-3-33f00"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260421-3-33f00"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-04-08T22:51:00", "text": "That's possible, Ian. We should check if we're hitting any rate limits.", "utterranceID": "20260421-4-4e96c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260421-4-4e96c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ec3b5d65", "timestamp": "2026-04-08T22:54:00", "text": "Also, do we have adequate monitoring for integration errors? That might be another angle.", "utterranceID": "20260421-5-26351"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260421-5-26351"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-04-08T22:56:00", "text": "Good point, George. We might need to improve our error handling and monitoring.", "utterranceID": "20260421-6-9c6ac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260421-6-9c6ac"}
