{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-07-23T00:45:00", "text": "Great, Ian! Next up, we have an issue in Apache Kafka called 'Inconsistent Topic Prioritization'. Messages aren't prioritized correctly, leading to delays. This is quite similar to our data source prioritization problem. Here's the link: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/1439", "utterranceID": "20260722-3-5b2fd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260722-3-5b2fd"}
