{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-ctaix-4b2909"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ba9224d2", "timestamp": "2026-04-22T23:24:00", "text": "Alright, I've gone through the PR. The schema design looks solid, and I like the flexibility you've built in for unstructured data. However, I noticed that the indexing strategy might need some tweaking. Have you considered compound indexes for some of the more complex queries?", "utterranceID": "20260423-3-0c079"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260423-3-0c079"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-ctaix-4b2909"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9a7b2132", "timestamp": "2026-04-22T23:25:00", "text": "Thanks for the feedback, Alice! I did think about compound indexes but wasn't sure if they would add too much overhead. I'll revisit that part and see how it can be improved. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260423-4-a9052"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260423-4-a9052"}
