{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bb46d667", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T01:01:00", "text": "Sure, David. The root cause was a bug in the authentication module's API key parsing logic. It was incorrectly splitting the keys, which led to malformed keys being sent to the data sources, causing authentication errors.", "utterranceID": "20261011-2-4f87a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-2-4f87a"}
