{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bb46d667", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T01:20:00", "text": "Thanks, David. Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing.", "utterranceID": "20261011-7-008d4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-7-008d4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T11:40:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the AI Connector failing to establish a secure connection due to expired SSL/TLS certificates.", "utterranceID": "20261013-0-94c13"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-0-94c13"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T11:43:00", "text": "After reviewing the bug titled 'Expired Certificate Handling Error', I've determined that it does not require a fix.", "utterranceID": "20261013-1-245d8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-1-245d8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T11:46:00", "text": "@eid_f12eccf0 Could you explain why it's not a bug? It seemed like a critical issue at first glance.", "utterranceID": "20261013-2-04e2c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-2-04e2c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T11:49:00", "text": "Sure, Hannah. The issue arises because the authentication module is correctly refusing connections when it encounters expired certificates. This is expected behavior to ensure secure data integration.", "utterranceID": "20261013-3-d15d3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-3-d15d3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bb46d667", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T11:52:00", "text": "So, it's more of a configuration issue on the user's end rather than a bug in our system?", "utterranceID": "20261013-4-c7f7f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-4-c7f7f"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2977e519", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T22:36:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the logout process to explicitly invalidate session tokens by adding a token revocation step. This ensures that tokens are properly invalidated and sessions are securely terminated.", "utterranceID": "20260627-2-0a6af"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260627-2-0a6af"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T22:38:00", "text": "Great work, Fiona! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. This was a critical issue.", "utterranceID": "20260627-3-2a7c5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260627-3-2a7c5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T22:43:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_2977e519! This fix will definitely enhance our security posture.", "utterranceID": "20260627-4-eccc9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260627-4-eccc9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bb46d667", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T22:44:00", "text": "Nice job, Fiona. Do we need to inform the QA team to run any specific tests?", "utterranceID": "20260627-5-a293c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260627-5-a293c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2977e519", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T22:46:00", "text": "@eid_bb46d667, yes, I've already coordinated with QA. They'll run a suite of tests focused on session management to ensure everything is working as expected.", "utterranceID": "20260627-6-053d0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260627-6-053d0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T22:51:00", "text": "Perfect. Let me know if there's anything else needed from the product side.", "utterranceID": "20260627-7-ec295"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260627-7-ec295"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2977e519", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T22:54:00", "text": "Will do, Hannah. Thanks, everyone, for your support!", "utterranceID": "20260627-8-7e781"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260627-8-7e781"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-08-09T20:46:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with our ConnectForce product. Let's go through them and assign them to the right engineers. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260809-0-d58f2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260809-0-d58f2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-08-09T20:48:00", "text": "First up, we have the 'Cross-Field Dependency Misalignment' issue. The dependencies between fields aren't being identified correctly, causing data integrity issues. This affects the Data Mapping Engine and impacts customer CUST-0043. @eid_bb46d667, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20260809-1-d0dd0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260809-1-d0dd0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bb46d667", "timestamp": "2026-08-09T20:53:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the Cross-Field Dependency Misalignment issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260809-2-f558e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260809-2-f558e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-08-09T20:56:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Incorrect Data Mapping in API Integration'. Similar to the first issue, this one also affects the Data Mapping Engine and leads to data integrity problems. It's impacting customer CUST-0017. @eid_bb46d667, you're on this one too.", "utterranceID": "20260809-3-7cff5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260809-3-7cff5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bb46d667", "timestamp": "2026-08-09T20:57:00", "text": "Understood, I'll handle the Incorrect Data Mapping issue as well. I'll make sure to address both issues promptly. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260809-4-e8afd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260809-4-e8afd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-08-09T21:00:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks for taking those on! Lastly, we have 'Token Expiry Mismanagement'. The AI Connector isn't refreshing expired tokens in time, which affects the Authentication Module. This is causing connection issues for customer CUST-0043. @eid_80cffa39, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260809-5-f575c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260809-5-f575c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_80cffa39", "timestamp": "2026-08-09T21:01:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the Token Expiry Mismanagement issue and work on a fix. Thanks for assigning it to me! 🔧", "utterranceID": "20260809-6-d8b45"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260809-6-d8b45"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e0f240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-07-25T13:40:00", "text": "@eid_e5e36dc1 created this channel on 2026-07-25 13:40:00. This is the very beginning of the bug-alicedavis-ConnectForce channel.", "utterranceID": "20260725-0-ebb45"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260725-0-ebb45"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e0f240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-07-25T13:40:00", "text": "@eid_e5e36dc1 joined bug-alicedavis-ConnectForce. Also, @eid_71071933, @eid_f2474622, @eid_9a7b2132, @eid_399e4119, @eid_8605f7ee joined via invite.", "utterranceID": "20260725-1-030e0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260725-1-030e0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e0f240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-07-25T18:13:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ConnectForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260725-0-8a7c2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260725-0-8a7c2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e0f240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-07-25T18:17:00", "text": "First up, we have a Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Vulnerability in the AI Connector's web interface. This affects Network Security and puts users' sensitive data at risk. Impacted customer is CUST-0072. @eid_71071933, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20260725-1-52694"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260725-1-52694"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e0f240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_71071933", "timestamp": "2026-07-25T18:20:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the XSS vulnerability right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 🔍", "utterranceID": "20260725-2-3c6e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260725-2-3c6e2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e0f240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-07-25T18:25:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, there's an issue with Inefficient Load Balancing in the Backend API. It's causing slow system performance for CUST-0027. @eid_399e4119, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260725-3-dc3c9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260725-3-dc3c9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e0f240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_399e4119", "timestamp": "2026-07-25T18:30:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the load balancing issue and see what's causing the uneven distribution. ⚙️", "utterranceID": "20260725-4-49931"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260725-4-49931"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e0f240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-07-25T18:33:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a Security Vulnerability in Data Transmission, also affecting Network Security. This is another issue for CUST-0027. @eid_399e4119, could you handle this one as well?", "utterranceID": "20260725-5-11501"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260725-5-11501"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e0f240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_399e4119", "timestamp": "2026-07-25T18:36:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll tackle the data transmission vulnerability too. Ensuring data security is a top priority! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20260725-6-afe80"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260725-6-afe80"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e0f240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-07-25T18:37:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep communication open and update each other on progress. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or resources. 💬", "utterranceID": "20260725-7-b3f7b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260725-7-b3f7b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e0f240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_71071933", "timestamp": "2026-07-25T18:41:00", "text": "Will do! I'll keep you posted on the XSS fix. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260725-8-6af8b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260725-8-6af8b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e0f240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_399e4119", "timestamp": "2026-07-25T18:44:00", "text": "Same here, I'll update on both the load balancing and data transmission issues. Let's get these sorted! 💪", "utterranceID": "20260725-9-f6ffe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260725-9-f6ffe"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e0f240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-07-25T18:46:00", "text": "Perfect! Thanks for jumping on these so quickly. Let's make sure our customers are happy and secure. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260725-10-35e5b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260725-10-35e5b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e0f240"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-07-27T07:12:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current Salesforce issues. Let's take a look at them! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260726-0-8c37d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260726-0-8c37d"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-75e6bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T09:30:00", "text": "I agree with George. The audit report is comprehensive, and it's great to see the penetration testing scheduled with SecureTech. The follow-up plan for critical issues is clear and actionable. 👏", "utterranceID": "20260626-4-e4771"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260626-4-e4771"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-75e6bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T09:33:00", "text": "Also, I noticed that all the acceptance criteria are met. The documentation is spot on, and the scheduling looks solid. LGTM, approved! ✅", "utterranceID": "20260626-5-a41fd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260626-5-a41fd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-75e6bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T09:37:00", "text": "Same here, everything checks out perfectly. Thanks for the hard work on this, @eid_9f4e2c6f. Approved from my side too! 🎉", "utterranceID": "20260626-6-905e0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260626-6-905e0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-75e6bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T09:41:00", "text": "Thanks, @George and @Hannah! Appreciate the quick review and feedback. Let's keep our system secure! 🔐", "utterranceID": "20260626-7-cc646"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260626-7-cc646"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-75e6bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_55f01e31", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T14:27:00", "text": "Hi team, I wanted to discuss PR# 23. It's approved but not merged yet. Given the change in product direction, do we still need this PR?", "utterranceID": "20260625-0-b9888"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260625-0-b9888"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-75e6bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T14:31:00", "text": "Hey, I approved it because it seemed crucial for our security posture. Can someone clarify the new product direction?", "utterranceID": "20260625-1-b153e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260625-1-b153e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-75e6bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T14:36:00", "text": "I second that. The security audit and penetration testing seemed like a good proactive measure. What's changed?", "utterranceID": "20260625-2-f0fd1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260625-2-f0fd1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-75e6bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_40589c87", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T14:40:00", "text": "From what I understand, the focus has shifted more towards feature development rather than security enhancements right now.", "utterranceID": "20260625-3-b0b4d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260625-3-b0b4d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-75e6bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ddbe5577", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T14:43:00", "text": "Exactly, the leadership wants us to prioritize new features to meet market demands. Security audits might be postponed.", "utterranceID": "20260625-4-9dc7c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260625-4-9dc7c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-75e6bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_caf4619d", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T14:48:00", "text": "Does postponing the security audit pose any risks? I mean, are we still covered on the security front?", "utterranceID": "20260625-5-fa6a2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260625-5-fa6a2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-75e6bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7b85a749", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T14:50:00", "text": "Good point. We should ensure that delaying this won't leave us vulnerable.", "utterranceID": "20260625-6-3a7bc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260625-6-3a7bc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-75e6bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b814ccfb", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T14:53:00", "text": "I think we have some basic security measures in place. This was more about being thorough.", "utterranceID": "20260625-7-7a752"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260625-7-7a752"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-75e6bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_88e74382", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T14:58:00", "text": "If the product direction has indeed changed, it might make sense to hold off on this PR for now.", "utterranceID": "20260625-8-b648f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260625-8-b648f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-75e6bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T15:00:00", "text": "Thanks for the insights, everyone. I authored the PR with the previous priorities in mind. If the direction has changed, I'm okay with not merging it.", "utterranceID": "20260625-9-ae966"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260625-9-ae966"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-75e6bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_55f01e31", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T15:04:00", "text": "@eid_9f4e2c6f, could you please hold off on merging PR# 23 for now? We can revisit it if the priorities shift back.", "utterranceID": "20260625-10-7661c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260625-10-7661c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-ianjones-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-75e6bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-06-25T15:09:00", "text": "Sure, I'll make sure it stays unmerged. Let me know if anything changes and we need to revisit it.", "utterranceID": "20260625-11-e9db6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260625-11-e9db6"}

