{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T11:21:00", "text": "I agree, Flask's implementation could provide some great insights, especially in terms of performance and simplicity.", "utterranceID": "20261031-10-5e153"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261031-10-5e153"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2026-10-31T11:26:00", "text": "Great points, everyone! I'll take a closer look at the Flask PR and see how we can adapt some of their strategies. I'll keep you all updated. Thanks for the input! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261031-11-823ec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261031-11-823ec"}
