{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T14:34:00", "text": "Checking it out too! Thanks for the heads-up, @eid_3e076e53. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261106-2-15003"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261106-2-15003"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T14:36:00", "text": "Alright, I've gone through the code. The middleware correctly identifies and rejects requests with invalid or missing JWT tokens. Nice work on that! 👏", "utterranceID": "20261106-3-33f6a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261106-3-33f6a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T14:40:00", "text": "I agree with Charlie. The protected routes are only accessible with a valid JWT token, which is exactly what we need. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261106-4-07f32"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261106-4-07f32"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T14:45:00", "text": "Also, I see you've added unit tests to verify the middleware functionality. They look comprehensive and cover all the edge cases I could think of. Great job! 🧪", "utterranceID": "20261106-5-c307e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261106-5-c307e"}
