{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T21:40:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current Salesforce issues. Let's take a look at them together! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261229-0-55379"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-0-55379"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T21:44:00", "text": "First, there's a 'Data Corruption During Model Training' issue in TensorFlow. Users are experiencing data corruption with large datasets, leading to inaccurate predictions. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/1051. @eid_2347b567, this seems similar to our data corruption issue. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20261229-1-25f6e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-1-25f6e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T21:49:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This is definitely relevant. The TensorFlow issue might give us insights into handling large datasets more effectively. I'll review their approach and see if we can apply any of their fixes. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261229-2-45078"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-2-45078"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T21:54:00", "text": "Great! Next, we have an 'Inconsistent Model Serialization' issue in PyTorch. Serialized models are producing different results on different devices, which sounds a lot like our serialization problem. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/1052. Julia Smith, could you take a look at this one too?", "utterranceID": "20261229-3-a30ec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-3-a30ec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T21:59:00", "text": "Absolutely, Julia! The PyTorch issue could provide some valuable insights into ensuring consistency across devices. I'll dive into their PR and see what strategies they used. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261229-4-f7476"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-4-f7476"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T22:03:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's an 'Overheating Under Load' issue in Raspberry Pi OS. Devices are overheating during intensive tasks, causing throttling. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/raspberrypi/linux/pull/1053. Julia Jones, this seems similar to our thermal management issue. What do you think?", "utterranceID": "20261229-5-ec4c7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-5-ec4c7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T22:06:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This is very relevant. I'll review their thermal management strategies and see if we can adapt any of their solutions to our EdgeForce devices. 🔥", "utterranceID": "20261229-6-38810"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-6-38810"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T22:10:00", "text": "Perfect! Let's use these insights to improve our solutions. If anyone needs more info or resources, just shout. Let's keep our customers happy and systems running smoothly! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261229-7-857bc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-7-857bc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T22:15:00", "text": "Thanks for the resources, Julia! I'll keep everyone updated on my findings. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261229-8-06100"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-8-06100"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T22:16:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! I'll start testing some of the Raspberry Pi OS strategies and let you know how it goes. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261229-9-09bb1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-9-09bb1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T03:12:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Inadequate Thermal Management' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/35.", "utterranceID": "20261230-0-83273"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261230-0-83273"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T03:15:00", "text": "That's great news, @eid_bac7c6c4! Could you explain what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20261230-1-e69e6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261230-1-e69e6"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2027-03-27T20:36:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie! I'll review the TensorFlow PR to see how they approached the data drift detection problem. It could give us some insights for our Model Management & Update Module. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270327-2-1aa37"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270327-2-1aa37"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-03-27T20:40:00", "text": "Next, there's a bug in Kong titled 'JWT Token Expiry Mismatch'. This is quite similar to our token expiry issue in the API Layer. Here's the link: https://github.com/Kong/kong/pull/1088. Ian, this might be relevant for you.", "utterranceID": "20270327-3-4bd7b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270327-3-4bd7b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4555ba9c", "timestamp": "2027-03-27T20:43:00", "text": "Great find, Charlie! I'll dive into the Kong PR to understand how they handled the JWT token expiry mismatch. It might help us resolve the issue for CUST-0116. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20270327-4-dea16"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270327-4-dea16"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-03-27T20:46:00", "text": "Lastly, there's a JupyterLab bug about 'UI Freezes During Large Notebook Execution'. This sounds a lot like our UI freezing issue during model visualization. Check it out here: https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/pull/1089. Fiona, this could be useful for your work.", "utterranceID": "20270327-5-6b133"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270327-5-6b133"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5058fefc", "timestamp": "2027-03-27T20:47:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie! I'll look into the JupyterLab PR to see how they tackled the UI freezing problem. Hopefully, it will give us some ideas for improving our User Interface & Visualization Module. 💪", "utterranceID": "20270327-6-6da71"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270327-6-6da71"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-03-27T20:51:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for being proactive! If you find any useful strategies or solutions, let's discuss them and see how we can apply them to our products. Keep me posted! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270327-7-0d062"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270327-7-0d062"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2027-03-27T20:56:00", "text": "Will do, Charlie! Thanks for the resources. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270327-8-b2a3b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270327-8-b2a3b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4555ba9c", "timestamp": "2027-03-27T21:00:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie! I'll update you once I have more info. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270327-9-5c3b4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270327-9-5c3b4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5058fefc", "timestamp": "2027-03-27T21:05:00", "text": "Thanks, team! Let's get these issues sorted out. 🔧", "utterranceID": "20270327-10-14c40"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270327-10-14c40"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5058fefc", "timestamp": "2027-04-04T18:50:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'UI Freezes During Model Visualization' has been resolved. 🎉", "utterranceID": "20270404-0-ba3a6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270404-0-ba3a6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5058fefc", "timestamp": "2027-04-04T18:53:00", "text": "The issue was due to inefficient rendering algorithms that couldn't handle large data sets in the visualization component. I've optimized the rendering process to better manage memory and processing power.", "utterranceID": "20270404-1-64843"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270404-1-64843"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5058fefc", "timestamp": "2027-04-04T18:58:00", "text": "You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/51", "utterranceID": "20270404-2-729a6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270404-2-729a6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-04-04T19:00:00", "text": "Great work, Fiona! Thanks for tackling this. It was causing quite a few headaches.", "utterranceID": "20270404-3-8b27e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270404-3-8b27e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4555ba9c", "timestamp": "2027-04-04T19:01:00", "text": "@eid_5058fefc Awesome job! Can you explain a bit more about how you optimized the rendering?", "utterranceID": "20270404-4-117a9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270404-4-117a9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5058fefc", "timestamp": "2027-04-04T19:05:00", "text": "Sure, Ian. I implemented a more efficient data chunking strategy that processes the model in smaller, manageable pieces. This reduces the load on the UI and prevents it from freezing.", "utterranceID": "20270404-5-3c8fa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270404-5-3c8fa"}

