{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-11-23T23:19:00", "text": "Next, there's a feature from OpenTelemetry: 'Identify and Document Missing Instrumentation'. This PR reviews existing instrumentation libraries and documents gaps to improve observability across services. Here's the link: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-python/pull/3182.", "utterranceID": "20261123-5-9d76c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261123-5-9d76c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2026-11-23T23:22:00", "text": "OpenTelemetry's focus on observability is crucial. Their documentation approach might help us ensure we're thorough in identifying sensor gaps. Maybe we can borrow some of their documentation techniques?", "utterranceID": "20261123-6-499ef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261123-6-499ef"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-11-23T23:26:00", "text": "Absolutely, Alice. I'll explore their documentation methods and see how we can incorporate them into our process. 📚", "utterranceID": "20261123-7-73bb2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261123-7-73bb2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-11-23T23:28:00", "text": "Lastly, we have Kubernetes' 'Node Resource Gap Analysis'. This PR analyzes current node resource allocations and identifies gaps to optimize cluster performance. Check it out here: https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/3183.", "utterranceID": "20261123-8-59eca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261123-8-59eca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2026-11-23T23:33:00", "text": "Kubernetes is all about optimization. While it's a bit different from our focus, their analytical approach to identifying gaps could be beneficial. Maybe we can apply some of their analysis techniques to our sensor types?", "utterranceID": "20261123-9-6b5d5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261123-9-6b5d5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-11-23T23:35:00", "text": "Great idea, Charlie! I'll look into their analysis techniques and see if there's something we can leverage. Thanks for the input, everyone! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261123-10-ed3f8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261123-10-ed3f8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2026-11-23T23:39:00", "text": "Thanks for leading this, Julia! Looking forward to seeing how these insights shape our PR. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261123-11-9009d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261123-11-9009d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T05:01:00", "text": "Hi team, please check my PR for review: https://github.com/salesforce/EF_AIX/pull/18. This PR focuses on identifying and documenting sensor type gaps. Let me know your thoughts! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261127-0-64529"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-0-64529"}
