{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-24T09:18:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Weak API Authentication' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/37.", "utterranceID": "20270124-0-f2ffe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270124-0-f2ffe"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-24T09:22:00", "text": "The root cause was that our API relied on outdated authentication protocols, which were vulnerable to brute force attacks and credential stuffing.", "utterranceID": "20270124-1-cc5b7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270124-1-cc5b7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-24T09:26:00", "text": "To fix this, we implemented OAuth 2.0 with token-based authentication, which significantly enhances security by requiring valid tokens for access. Additionally, we've added rate limiting to mitigate brute force attempts.", "utterranceID": "20270124-2-b09ba"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270124-2-b09ba"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-24T09:30:00", "text": "Great work, Julia Smith! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. The new authentication mechanism should really help secure our API.", "utterranceID": "20270124-3-937bd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270124-3-937bd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-24T09:32:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_91523bad! Let me know if you need any further details or if there are any other issues.", "utterranceID": "20270124-4-f564e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270124-4-f564e"}
