{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-force-36f287"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T21:04:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a 'Transaction Rollback Loop' issue in the database layer. This is causing repeated rollbacks and impacting CUST-0107 with system unavailability and potential data loss. @eid_8986ddc3, this one's also for you.", "utterranceID": "20261003-5-6e00f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-5-6e00f"}
