{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:24:00", "text": "Great! Next up, we have a 'Token Expiry Misconfiguration' in OAuth2 Proxy. Their access tokens aren't expiring as expected, which is a security risk. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/oauth2-proxy/oauth2-proxy/pull/172. David, this seems to align with our token expiry issue. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20261019-3-a4a66"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-3-a4a66"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:29:00", "text": "Yes, Charlie, this is very relevant! I'll dive into their PR to see how they tackled the token expiry problem. It might give us some insights for our User Authentication Module. Security first! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261019-4-d805d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-4-d805d"}
