{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T00:54:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Suboptimal Data Caching Strategy' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/50.", "utterranceID": "20261224-0-3c8cb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-0-3c8cb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T00:57:00", "text": "The root cause was an inadequate cache size and improper cache invalidation policies, which led to frequent cache misses and increased database load for sentiment data queries.", "utterranceID": "20261224-1-b7d89"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-1-b7d89"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T00:58:00", "text": "To fix this, I increased the cache size and implemented a more efficient cache invalidation strategy. This should significantly reduce the number of cache misses and alleviate the database load.", "utterranceID": "20261224-2-62b27"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-2-62b27"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T01:01:00", "text": "Great work, Ian! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. The new caching strategy should help improve our system's performance.", "utterranceID": "20261224-3-ab5fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-3-ab5fb"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T17:10:00", "text": "Sure, Ian. The root cause was that our NLP model wasn't properly accounting for negation phrases. This led to sentences like 'I don't dislike this project' being misclassified as negative.", "utterranceID": "20260829-2-f99d3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-2-f99d3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T17:13:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, David. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20260829-3-5702c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-3-5702c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T17:15:00", "text": "We implemented a negation detection module that identifies negation phrases and adjusts the sentiment scoring accordingly. This involved updating our parsing logic to recognize common negation patterns and apply them before sentiment analysis.", "utterranceID": "20260829-4-145a0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-4-145a0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T17:17:00", "text": "Sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, @eid_6cc1a0f6!", "utterranceID": "20260829-5-9c56e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-5-9c56e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T17:20:00", "text": "Agreed, nice work, David. I'll run some tests to ensure everything's working as expected.", "utterranceID": "20260829-6-a6a7e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-6-a6a7e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T17:25:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie. Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing.", "utterranceID": "20260829-7-ea6b2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-7-ea6b2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T03:56:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SentimentForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261013-0-d74dd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-0-d74dd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T03:57:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Sentiment Model Drift' issue. The sentiment analysis model on the backend server has drifted, causing inaccurate sentiment scores on the Real-Time Dashboard. This is impacting CUST-0003, and it's crucial for maintaining effective real-time monitoring. @eid_31cb6db5, this one's for you!", "utterranceID": "20261013-1-42144"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-1-42144"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T04:00:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the model drift issue and see what's causing the inaccuracies. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261013-2-e648f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-2-e648f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T04:04:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Slack Channel Subscription Errors'. The system isn't automatically subscribing to new Slack channels, which means we're missing sentiment data. This affects CUST-0084 and could lead to incomplete insights. @eid_6cc1a0f6, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261013-3-b41c3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-3-b41c3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T04:09:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll check out the API Integration Module and fix the subscription errors. We can't afford to miss any data! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261013-4-17d54"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-4-17d54"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T04:11:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a 'Sarcasm Detection Failure'. Our sentiment analysis engine is struggling with sarcasm, leading to inaccurate sentiment reports. This is impacting CUST-0034. @eid_31cb6db5, could you also handle this one?", "utterranceID": "20261013-5-9e949"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-5-9e949"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T04:16:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll look into improving the sarcasm detection in the sentiment analysis engine. It's important we get those reports right! 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261013-6-2f1e1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-6-2f1e1"}

