{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:16:00", "text": "First, there's a 'Time Zone Misalignment in Scheduled Tasks' issue in Django. Scheduled tasks are running at the wrong times due to time zone misconfigurations. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/django/django/pull/171. @eid_fc4619fa, this sounds similar to our time zone issue, right?", "utterranceID": "20261019-1-49a27"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-1-49a27"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_96000199", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:29:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Product Vision Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some areas to address, especially around sarcasm detection, Slack integration, UI intuitiveness, performance with large teams, and customization options. Let's dive in! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260414-0-6eee5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-0-6eee5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:33:00", "text": "Hey @eid_96000199, for the sarcasm and humor detection, I think we should add a section in the NLP Engine part about enhancing our models with more diverse training data. We could also explore integrating a contextual analysis module to better handle these nuances. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260414-1-5aaa4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-1-5aaa4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2589c967", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:35:00", "text": "I agree with Emma. We should also consider adding a user feedback loop to continuously improve sarcasm detection. Maybe a feature where users can flag misinterpretations? This could be added to the User Interface Dashboard section. @eid_96000199, what do you think?", "utterranceID": "20260414-2-bae95"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-2-bae95"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_96000199", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:38:00", "text": "@eid_d96fb219 @eid_2589c967 Great suggestions! Let's definitely include those. I'll make a note to add a section on enhancing training data and contextual analysis in the NLP Engine. Ian, your idea about user feedback is spot on. Let's add that to the UI Dashboard section. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260414-3-19547"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-3-19547"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:43:00", "text": "For the Slack integration issues, we should mention improving our error monitoring and handling in the Slack Integration section. Maybe we can also explore alternative libraries that are better optimized for real-time processing. @eid_96000199, should we add this to the document?", "utterranceID": "20260414-4-cbdfd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-4-cbdfd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fd8cecea", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:43:21", "text": "@here Read about the latest trends in AI-driven sentiment analysis and its implications for workplace productivity in this insightful article. https://www.techcrunch.com/2023/06/15/ai-sentiment-analysis-workplace-productivity/", "utterranceID": "20260416-106-c9942"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-106-c9942"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_96000199", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:45:00", "text": "Yes, @eid_802e8eff, let's add those points. Improving error handling and exploring better libraries are crucial for consistent integration. I'll update the Slack Integration section accordingly. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260414-5-7ea49"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-5-7ea49"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_eb1756e0", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:48:00", "text": "Regarding the UI, we should emphasize user-centered design principles in the User Interface Dashboard section. Maybe we can also include a plan for regular UX testing and updates based on user feedback. This could help address the intuitiveness issue.", "utterranceID": "20260414-6-0ef69"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-6-0ef69"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_96000199", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:53:00", "text": "Good call, David. I'll add a note about incorporating user-centered design principles and regular UX testing in the UI Dashboard section. This should help make the interface more intuitive for new users. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260414-7-8d14f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-7-8d14f"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-22T14:57:00", "text": "First up, there's a bug in PostgreSQL titled 'Connection Pool Exhaustion Under Load'. It describes how high traffic scenarios lead to connection pool exhaustion, causing delays in query execution. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/postgres/postgres/pull/151. @eid_6cc1a0f6, this seems similar to our connection pool issue with SentimentForce. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20260822-1-5e157"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260822-1-5e157"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-22T15:01:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie! This is definitely relevant. I'll review the PR to see how they addressed the connection pool exhaustion. It might give us some insights for optimizing our database management system. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260822-2-8381e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260822-2-8381e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-22T15:02:00", "text": "Great! Next, we have a Redis bug titled 'Stale Cache Data Served'. It talks about outdated cache entries being served due to improper cache invalidation, affecting real-time data accuracy. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/redis/redis/pull/152. Ian, this sounds a lot like our stale sentiment cache issue. What do you think?", "utterranceID": "20260822-3-4216c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260822-3-4216c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-22T15:03:00", "text": "Absolutely, Charlie! This is spot on. I'll dive into the Redis PR to understand their approach to cache invalidation. It could help us ensure our Real-Time Dashboard is always up-to-date. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260822-4-f7714"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260822-4-f7714"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-22T15:07:00", "text": "Awesome, Ian! Lastly, there's a bug in NLTK titled 'Incorrect Negation Handling in Sentiment Analysis'. It highlights issues with negations not being properly parsed, leading to inaccurate sentiment scores. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/nltk/nltk/pull/153. David, this seems directly related to our negation handling error. Any insights?", "utterranceID": "20260822-5-07fe2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260822-5-07fe2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-22T15:08:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie! This is exactly what we need. I'll review the NLTK PR to see how they tackled the negation parsing. It might offer some valuable strategies for improving our sentiment analysis engine. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260822-6-45bb2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260822-6-45bb2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-22T15:12:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's use these insights to enhance our solutions. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or further discussion. Let's keep pushing forward! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260822-7-97b8f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260822-7-97b8f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-22T15:13:00", "text": "Will do, Charlie! Let's get these issues resolved. 💪", "utterranceID": "20260822-8-2278c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260822-8-2278c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-22T15:16:00", "text": "On it! Thanks for coordinating, Charlie! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260822-9-04cea"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260822-9-04cea"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:30:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Connection Pool Exhaustion' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/37.", "utterranceID": "20260825-0-debe4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-0-debe4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:34:00", "text": "The root cause was an insufficient connection pool size and a lack of connection reuse strategies, which led to the pool being exhausted under high load conditions.", "utterranceID": "20260825-1-77418"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-1-77418"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T14:55:00", "text": "Since this is an external API issue and not something within our control, a fix on our end isn't necessary. It's not a bug in our system.", "utterranceID": "20261207-3-e2a89"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-3-e2a89"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T15:00:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Fiona. So, it's more about handling the API's limitations rather than a bug in our code?", "utterranceID": "20261207-4-04277"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-4-04277"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T15:02:00", "text": "Exactly, @eid_8658e19c. We could consider implementing retries or caching to mitigate the impact, but the core issue lies with the API's availability.", "utterranceID": "20261207-5-ad120"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-5-ad120"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T15:05:00", "text": "Makes sense, Fiona. Thanks for clarifying. Do we need to inform the users about this behavior?", "utterranceID": "20261207-6-3cb92"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-6-3cb92"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T15:06:00", "text": "Good point, Emma. I suggest we add a note in the user documentation about potential data gaps due to Slack API connectivity issues.", "utterranceID": "20261207-7-ce066"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-7-ce066"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T15:11:00", "text": "Agreed. Let's make sure users are aware. Thanks for the thorough investigation, Fiona!", "utterranceID": "20261207-8-289bc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-8-289bc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T15:14:00", "text": "No problem, Bob. I'll draft a note for the documentation and share it with you all for review.", "utterranceID": "20261207-9-3b9de"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-9-3b9de"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T20:08:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the delayed sentiment updates in the real-time dashboard.", "utterranceID": "20261211-0-f29f4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261211-0-f29f4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T20:13:00", "text": "After reviewing the system logs and running some tests, I've determined that this is not a bug that requires fixing.", "utterranceID": "20261211-1-ecdde"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261211-1-ecdde"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T20:16:00", "text": "The delays are due to expected network latency and the current data processing setup on the backend server.", "utterranceID": "20261211-2-2a44a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261211-2-2a44a"}
