{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T20:22:00", "text": "Exactly, @eid_d96fb219. The system is functioning as intended, ensuring that the sentiment scores are accurate even if there's a small delay.", "utterranceID": "20261211-5-3f0e1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261211-5-3f0e1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T20:23:00", "text": "Did you find any way to improve the processing speed, or is it best to leave it as is?", "utterranceID": "20261211-6-af98e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261211-6-af98e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T20:26:00", "text": "I did explore some optimization options, Bob, but any changes would compromise data accuracy, which is not ideal for our use case.", "utterranceID": "20261211-7-cd013"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261211-7-cd013"}
