{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iansmith-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-ckaix-820d5b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9db3abf4", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T02:57:00", "text": "Sure, the middleware optimization seems to expose sensitive data through logging and lacks proper input validation, which could be exploited.", "utterranceID": "20260825-2-3a8df"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-2-3a8df"}
