{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1e7c8290", "timestamp": "2026-06-22T23:35:00", "text": "@eid_131494b8 Fiona, thanks for sharing! I noticed that the AI Engine section mentions a 95% accuracy benchmark for insights. Could we specify the datasets or scenarios this applies to? It might help set clearer expectations for users.", "utterranceID": "20260622-1-5baaa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260622-1-5baaa"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cf7cd7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T17:51:00", "text": "Awesome insights, guys! Lastly, let's discuss Redash's Customizable Query Dashboards. This feature enables users to design dashboards with queries and visualizations that align with their role-specific data requirements. Here's the link: https://github.com/getredash/redash/pull/4923. What do you think, George?", "utterranceID": "20260924-7-420fe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-7-420fe"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cf7cd7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13df35ed", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T17:56:00", "text": "Redash's approach is quite flexible, allowing users to tailor dashboards with specific queries. This could be a great way to empower advanced users who need more control over their data. We should consider how we can offer similar flexibility without overwhelming less technical users.", "utterranceID": "20260924-8-840fc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-8-840fc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cf7cd7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T17:57:00", "text": "Exactly, George. Balancing flexibility and usability is key. Redash's feature might give us some ideas on how to implement advanced options for power users while keeping the interface simple for everyone else.", "utterranceID": "20260924-9-c2ed9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-9-c2ed9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cf7cd7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T18:00:00", "text": "Thanks for the feedback, everyone! I'll take a closer look at these features and see how we can adapt some of these ideas into our implementation. Let's keep the conversation going if anyone has more thoughts. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260924-10-9e46e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-10-9e46e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cf7cd7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-09-25T19:44:00", "text": "Hi team, please check my PR for customizable dashboards: https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/26. This update allows users to personalize their dashboard layout and content based on their roles. Let me know your thoughts! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260925-0-53c5b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260925-0-53c5b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cf7cd7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13df35ed", "timestamp": "2026-09-25T19:48:00", "text": "Hey @eid_70223d0a, thanks for sharing! I'll take a look at it now. Excited to see how this enhances user experience! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260925-1-d2e5d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260925-1-d2e5d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cf7cd7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-25T19:50:00", "text": "Checking it out too, @eid_70223d0a. Customizable dashboards sound like a great feature! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260925-2-0c866"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260925-2-0c866"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cf7cd7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13df35ed", "timestamp": "2026-09-25T19:52:00", "text": "Alright, I've gone through the PR. The feature allowing users to customize and save their dashboard layout works smoothly. I tested it with different roles, and the predefined templates are a nice touch. Everything seems persistent across sessions as well. Great job, @eid_70223d0a! LGTM, approved! 🎉", "utterranceID": "20260925-3-b7ea8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260925-3-b7ea8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cf7cd7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-25T19:57:00", "text": "Just finished reviewing as well. I agree with George, the implementation is solid. The persistence of changes across sessions is seamless, and the role-based templates are intuitive. Well done, @eid_70223d0a! LGTM, approved! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260925-4-1e485"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260925-4-1e485"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cf7cd7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-09-25T20:00:00", "text": "Thanks, @George Jones and @David Miller! Appreciate the quick review and feedback. Glad you both liked it! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260925-5-21247"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260925-5-21247"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c2a92a40", "timestamp": "2027-02-01T02:27:00", "text": "Absolutely, Hannah! I'll take a look at how OWASP ZAP is addressing this. It's crucial to see different approaches to securing endpoints. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20270131-4-60546"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-4-60546"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2027-02-01T02:31:00", "text": "Lastly, there's a Bias in Model Predictions issue in TensorFlow. The model shows bias towards specific data inputs, similar to our AI Suggestion Engine problem. Here's the PR: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/4827. Hannah Miller, this could be insightful for your work!", "utterranceID": "20270131-5-18ffc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-5-18ffc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a1fab288", "timestamp": "2027-02-01T02:32:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah! I'll dive into the TensorFlow PR. Understanding how they tackle bias could really help us refine our algorithm. 🤖", "utterranceID": "20270131-6-be350"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-6-be350"}
