{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T03:00:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Flaw'. This vulnerability allows attackers to inject malicious scripts into collaborative discussions, which could expose sensitive data. It's affecting the Security Module and impacting CUST-0017. @eid_86f94a48, you're up again.", "utterranceID": "20270205-3-d4d74"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-3-d4d74"}
