{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T03:06:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks for jumping on that! Lastly, we have 'Delayed Data Point Updates'. The AI Suggestion Engine isn't incorporating the most recent data updates, leading to outdated recommendations. This affects the AI Suggestion Engine and is impacting CUST-0026. @eid_86f94a48, this one's also for you.", "utterranceID": "20270205-5-df108"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-5-df108"}
