{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-09T18:01:00", "text": "Agreed, nice work, George. I'll keep an eye on the performance metrics to ensure everything is running smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20270109-6-4b1cd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270109-6-4b1cd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-01-09T18:02:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian and Alice. Let me know if you notice any other issues. I'll be monitoring as well.", "utterranceID": "20270109-7-6773f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270109-7-6773f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-01-09T23:14:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'High Latency in API Calls' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ContextForce/pull/33.", "utterranceID": "20270109-0-466da"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270109-0-466da"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-09T23:17:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_92c62291! Can you explain what was causing the latency?", "utterranceID": "20270109-1-925f3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270109-1-925f3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-01-09T23:20:00", "text": "Sure, Ian. The root cause was network congestion combined with suboptimal configurations of our API endpoints. This was leading to increased response times between the dashboard UI and the database.", "utterranceID": "20270109-2-2e085"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270109-2-2e085"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-01-09T23:24:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Alice. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270109-3-8640e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270109-3-8640e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-01-09T23:26:00", "text": "We optimized the API endpoint configurations by implementing a more efficient load balancing strategy and adjusted the timeout settings to better handle peak traffic. Additionally, we improved the query performance by indexing the most frequently accessed database tables.", "utterranceID": "20270109-4-bd7b4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270109-4-bd7b4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-09T23:31:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, Alice!", "utterranceID": "20270109-5-1f041"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270109-5-1f041"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-01-09T23:33:00", "text": "Yes, much appreciated, @eid_92c62291. Let us know if there's anything else we need to test on our end.", "utterranceID": "20270109-6-0b388"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270109-6-0b388"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-01-09T23:35:00", "text": "Thanks, George and Ian. I'll keep you posted if any further testing is needed. For now, everything seems to be running smoothly!", "utterranceID": "20270109-7-f5e44"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270109-7-f5e44"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-11T07:09:00", "text": "Hi team, the customer has reopened the bug titled 'High Latency in API Calls'. It seems the issue is back. 😕", "utterranceID": "20270111-0-b468d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270111-0-b468d"}
