{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2027-03-05T12:22:00", "text": "Will do! If anyone needs help or has insights on the API issues, let's collaborate. 🤝", "utterranceID": "20270305-8-65383"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270305-8-65383"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-03-05T12:24:00", "text": "Absolutely, let's keep the momentum going. Thanks for coordinating, @eid_82e9fcef! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270305-9-b7f5e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270305-9-b7f5e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-03-05T12:26:00", "text": "Agreed! Let's get these resolved quickly for our customers. Thanks, team! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270305-10-502a3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270305-10-502a3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-03-08T23:22:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might give us insights into our current issues. Let's take a look and see how they tackled similar problems. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270308-0-b2014"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-0-b2014"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-03-08T23:23:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue from Apache Kafka titled 'Inaccurate Consumer Lag Metrics'. Users reported incorrect consumer lag metrics, which led to misinformed scaling decisions. You can check out the PR here: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/1983. @eid_92c62291, this seems similar to our 'Incorrect User Behavior Analysis' issue. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20270308-1-bc867"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-1-bc867"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-03-08T23:25:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! This is definitely relevant. It looks like they addressed the issue by refining their metric calculations. I'll dive into their approach and see if we can apply something similar to our Report Generation & Data Processing. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270308-2-65035"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-2-65035"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f2087c9", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T11:48:00", "text": "@eid_7c6dd6a6 Good point, Fiona. We should review the algorithms used and see if there's room for optimization.", "utterranceID": "20260924-3-1c3e0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-3-1c3e0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_798684b4", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T11:51:00", "text": "Another angle could be insufficient computational resources. Maybe the system isn't allocating enough resources for large datasets.", "utterranceID": "20260924-4-cef7b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-4-cef7b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36319f22", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T11:55:00", "text": "Agreed, David. We should check the resource allocation settings and see if they can be adjusted for better performance.", "utterranceID": "20260924-5-1d7b5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-5-1d7b5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T11:59:00", "text": "Also, let's not forget about the data storage and retrieval processes. Lack of optimization there could be a factor too.", "utterranceID": "20260924-6-25f21"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-6-25f21"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c7622c8e", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:00:00", "text": "Yes, Ian. We should look into optimizing those processes as well. It might help improve response times.", "utterranceID": "20260924-7-37fca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-7-37fca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_62db8640", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:00:15", "text": "@here Stay updated with this article on how Salesforce is leveraging AI to enhance customer insights and drive business growth. https://www.forbes.com/sites/salesforce-ai-insights", "utterranceID": "20260909-85-e68e0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260909-85-e68e0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7c6dd6a6", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:05:00", "text": "Sounds like we have a few areas to investigate. Let's make sure these issues are documented in the planning documents for the next release of extAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260924-8-2a037"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-8-2a037"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f2087c9", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T12:09:00", "text": "Agreed, Fiona. I'll start drafting the documentation and share it with the team for input.", "utterranceID": "20260924-9-3c45e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-9-3c45e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-09-10T13:38:00", "text": "@eid_62db8640 joined planning-extAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260910-85-1bdb7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-85-1bdb7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd4d2940", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T19:52:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Market Research Report and update it based on the latest issues reported. We need to address the AI misinterpretation, integration inconsistencies, UI complexity, performance issues, and lack of customization. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260910-0-a6dab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-0-a6dab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T19:57:00", "text": "@eid_bd4d2940 Julia Davis, I think we should add a section on improving AI training data. The current report doesn't mention the diversity of user behavior, which is crucial for accurate insights. We could also highlight plans for enhancing NLP capabilities. What do you think, @eid_82e9fcef?", "utterranceID": "20260910-1-2688f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-1-2688f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T20:02:00", "text": "Agreed, Julia Taylor. We should also include a feedback loop mechanism for continuous learning. This could be a new subsection under 'Future Developments'. It would show our commitment to improving AI models over time. 📈", "utterranceID": "20260910-2-ac52b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-2-ac52b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_62db8640", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T20:05:00", "text": "For the integration issues, we might want to emphasize our strategy for comprehensive testing across third-party applications. Maybe add a paragraph under 'Integration' about our approach to handling API variability and improving modularity. Thoughts, @eid_7f69c513?", "utterranceID": "20260910-3-330e9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-3-330e9"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T06:52:00", "text": "First up, there's a concurrency bottleneck in the PostgreSQL query planner. Similar to our ContextForce issue, queries are being executed sequentially, which increases response times under heavy load. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/postgres/postgres/pull/1951. @George, this might give us some insights for optimizing our query execution.", "utterranceID": "20261231-1-28226"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-1-28226"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T06:53:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! I'll review the PostgreSQL PR and see if there are any strategies we can apply to our concurrency issue. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261231-2-6ab40"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-2-6ab40"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T06:54:00", "text": "Great! Next, we have a bug in TensorFlow related to model overfitting on limited datasets. This is quite similar to our AI model issue where it's overfitting to a narrow set of user behaviors. Here's the PR: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/1952. George, since you're already on the AI model, this might be useful for you too.", "utterranceID": "20261231-3-83853"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-3-83853"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T06:56:00", "text": "Perfect timing! I'll dive into the TensorFlow PR and see how they tackled the overfitting problem. Let's make our AI insights more robust! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261231-4-db0ca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-4-db0ca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T07:01:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks George! Lastly, there's a high latency issue in Grafana's dashboard data fetching, which is causing delays similar to what we're seeing with our API calls. Here's the PR: https://github.com/grafana/grafana/pull/1953. @Alice, this might be relevant for the latency issue you're working on.", "utterranceID": "20261231-5-83fd8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-5-83fd8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T07:05:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! I'll check out the Grafana PR and see if there are any optimizations we can apply to reduce our API latency. Let's get those insights flowing smoothly again! 🔧", "utterranceID": "20261231-6-91d98"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-6-91d98"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T07:06:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep learning from these open-source projects and apply what we can to our own issues. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or want to discuss further. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261231-7-acd10"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-7-acd10"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T07:08:00", "text": "Will do! Thanks for pulling these together, Ian. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261231-8-37d3f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-8-37d3f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T07:10:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! I'll keep you posted on any progress or findings. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261231-9-50b6b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-9-50b6b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-05T15:24:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ContextForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270105-0-8f665"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270105-0-8f665"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-05T15:27:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Incorrect Scope Assignment'. Third-party applications are unable to access certain insights due to incorrect scope assignments during the authentication process. This affects the API Authentication Module and is impacting customer CUST-0017. @eid_5782059f, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270105-1-0c741"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270105-1-0c741"}

