{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T10:53:00", "text": "First, we have a bug in Django titled 'Session Expiry Not Enforced'. It seems sessions aren't expiring as expected, which could lead to unauthorized access. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/django/django/pull/1079. This sounds a lot like our 'Improper Session Management' issue. @eid_bac7c6c4, what do you think?", "utterranceID": "20270301-1-460e1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270301-1-460e1"}
