{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:26:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the System Design Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some feedback from the latest release of EF_AIX that we need to address. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260918-0-defa9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-0-defa9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a253c65a", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:30:00", "text": "Hey Charlie, I think we should start by enhancing the 'User Experience' section. The setup process is currently too complex. We could add a subsection on 'Setup Automation' and detail scripts or tools that could simplify this process. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260918-1-1d2ec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-1-1d2ec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a9002ae2", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:34:00", "text": "@Hannah Brown, I agree. Also, we should expand the 'User Experience' section to include more detailed user guidance. Maybe a step-by-step guide or a video tutorial link? This could help non-technical users a lot. 📚", "utterranceID": "20260918-2-c2bf8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-2-c2bf8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c9c3d8d5", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:35:00", "text": "Good point, Bob. We should also consider adding a 'Support Resources' section under 'Operational' to outline available support channels and resources. This could address the lack of support during setup. 📞", "utterranceID": "20260918-3-c9ddd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-3-c9ddd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9db3abf4", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:39:00", "text": "For the performance issues, we might need to revisit the 'Edge Processing Layer' section. We should specify improvements in data processing algorithms and resource management. Maybe add a note on optimizing for large datasets? 📈", "utterranceID": "20260918-4-e5750"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-4-e5750"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1a7d9807", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:42:00", "text": "Agreed, Alice. We should also mention the need for hardware compatibility checks in the 'Device Layer' section to ensure consistent performance across different devices. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20260918-5-40cb8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-5-40cb8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_caa2e58d", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:43:00", "text": "Regarding integration, the 'Integration Layer' should include a plan for developing more APIs and connectors. This will help with third-party application integration. Let's make it a priority in the development roadmap. 🔗", "utterranceID": "20260918-6-35b70"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-6-35b70"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d8eff4d", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:44:00", "text": "And for the UI issues, we should add a 'User Feedback Loop' section in the 'User Experience' part. This can help us continuously improve the UI based on user input. 🖥️", "utterranceID": "20260918-7-35619"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-7-35619"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:46:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! To summarize: we'll add setup automation details, enhance user guidance, outline support resources, optimize data processing, ensure hardware compatibility, expand integration options, and incorporate user feedback. Let's update the document accordingly and schedule a follow-up meeting to review the changes. Thanks for the input! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260918-8-f1ae0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-8-f1ae0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T08:54:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_ef_aix_system_design_document|System Design Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260918-0-abe02"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-0-abe02"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T08:57:39", "text": "@here Read about the latest advancements in edge AI technology and its potential to drive innovation in this TechCrunch article. https://techcrunch.com/2023/02/15/edge-ai-advancements/", "utterranceID": "20260919-137-7c026"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260919-137-7c026"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-03-07T20:16:00", "text": "The root cause was that session tokens were not being invalidated after logout or timeout. Additionally, they were being transmitted without encryption, which made them susceptible to interception.", "utterranceID": "20270307-1-d297a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270307-1-d297a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-03-07T20:19:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, @eid_bac7c6c4! How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270307-2-71580"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270307-2-71580"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-03-07T20:23:00", "text": "Good question, Julia. We implemented a fix by ensuring that session tokens are now invalidated immediately upon logout or timeout. We also added encryption for token transmission using TLS to prevent interception.", "utterranceID": "20270307-3-b7bf4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270307-3-b7bf4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2027-03-07T20:28:00", "text": "Great work, Julia Jones! This should significantly improve our security posture.", "utterranceID": "20270307-4-675ac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270307-4-675ac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-03-07T20:32:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie! Let me know if you notice any other issues or have further questions.", "utterranceID": "20270307-5-d6f7d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270307-5-d6f7d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-03-07T20:33:00", "text": "Will do, thanks again for the quick turnaround on this fix!", "utterranceID": "20270307-6-95768"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270307-6-95768"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T09:05:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with EdgeForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270312-0-5816c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270312-0-5816c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T09:09:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Suboptimal Model Compression' issue. The AI models on EdgeForce devices aren't optimally compressed, causing increased computational load and slower processing times. This affects the AI Processing Engine and impacts users who rely on real-time data processing, like those in autonomous systems. @eid_edf6a3fc, this one's for you. The impacted customer is CUST-0066.", "utterranceID": "20270312-1-94d29"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270312-1-94d29"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_edf6a3fc", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T09:11:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the AI Processing Engine and see what's causing the compression issue. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270312-2-7b77f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270312-2-7b77f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T09:15:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Data Serialization Error in API Responses'. The API is intermittently returning improperly serialized data, which is causing parsing errors in client applications. This affects the API Layer and impacts developers and applications relying on consistent data retrieval. @eid_bac7c6c4, can you take this one? The impacted customer is CUST-0028.", "utterranceID": "20270312-3-45069"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270312-3-45069"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T09:16:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll check out the API Layer and work on resolving the serialization errors. Thanks for assigning this to me! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270312-4-3ff18"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270312-4-3ff18"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-03-13T09:20:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have a 'Model Update Rollback Error'. Failed model updates aren't properly rolled back, leaving devices with incomplete or corrupted models. This affects the Model Management & Update Module and impacts users who may receive inaccurate insights. @eid_4df3bcc2, this one's yours. The impacted customer is CUST-0076.", "utterranceID": "20270312-5-6ba8e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270312-5-6ba8e"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-14T17:23:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these so quickly! Let's keep the impacted customers updated as we make progress. Feel free to reach out if you need any more info or support. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270214-7-8cb8d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-7-8cb8d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-02-14T17:26:00", "text": "Will do! I'll keep you posted on the memory leak fix. 📝", "utterranceID": "20270214-8-7dcc9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-8-7dcc9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-02-14T17:28:00", "text": "Same here, I'll update once I have a patch for the security issue. 🔧", "utterranceID": "20270214-9-cb5b7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-9-cb5b7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-02-14T17:31:00", "text": "I'll keep everyone in the loop on the inference delay improvements. Thanks for the heads-up! 📈", "utterranceID": "20270214-10-73209"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-10-73209"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-17T03:57:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current Salesforce issues. Let's take a look at them! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270216-0-106a8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270216-0-106a8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-17T03:58:00", "text": "First, there's a memory leak issue in TensorFlow during model training. It seems prolonged sessions lead to increased memory usage, which slows down model convergence. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/1075. @eid_bac7c6c4, this sounds similar to the memory leak we're dealing with in EdgeForce. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20270216-1-9aab0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270216-1-9aab0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-02-17T04:00:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This is definitely relevant. The gradual memory increase could be a clue for our neural network layer issue. I'll review their approach and see if we can apply any of their fixes. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20270216-2-88429"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270216-2-88429"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-17T04:03:00", "text": "Great! Next up, there's a security flaw in PyTorch that allows unauthorized access to model checkpoints, risking data integrity. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/1076. Julia Smith, this seems to align with the security vulnerability we're tackling. What do you think?", "utterranceID": "20270216-3-c093b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270216-3-c093b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-02-17T04:08:00", "text": "Absolutely, Julia! This is very similar to our issue. I'll dive into their solution and see if we can adapt it for our security & access control problem. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20270216-4-cfacc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270216-4-cfacc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-17T04:12:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks Julia! Lastly, OpenCV has an inference delay issue on ARM-based low-power devices, which affects real-time applications. Here's the PR: https://github.com/opencv/opencv/pull/1077. Alice, this might give us some insights for the delayed inference response we're seeing. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20270216-5-f6750"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270216-5-f6750"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-02-17T04:13:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This is spot on. I'll look into how OpenCV is addressing the delay and see if we can implement similar optimizations for our low-power devices. ⚡", "utterranceID": "20270216-6-95261"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270216-6-95261"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-17T04:15:00", "text": "Perfect, thanks everyone for jumping on these! Let's keep these open-source solutions in mind as we work on our fixes. Feel free to reach out if you need any more info or support. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270216-7-7e6b7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270216-7-7e6b7"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-02-13T08:11:00", "text": "The root cause was improper management of graphical resources. Specifically, objects were not being released after use, which led to excessive memory consumption.", "utterranceID": "20270212-1-2d5b4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-1-2d5b4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-02-13T08:15:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a resource cleanup routine that ensures all graphical objects are properly disposed of once they're no longer needed. This should prevent any further memory leaks and improve performance during extended use.", "utterranceID": "20270212-2-9d7f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-2-9d7f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_edf6a3fc", "timestamp": "2027-02-13T08:17:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_4df3bcc2! Thanks for tackling this issue so quickly. I'll run some tests to confirm everything is stable now.", "utterranceID": "20270212-3-b8e28"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-3-b8e28"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-13T08:20:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice! This should make a big difference for our users. I'll update the documentation to reflect the changes.", "utterranceID": "20270212-4-3e0f4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-4-3e0f4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-02-13T08:21:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona and Julia! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing or if there's anything else I can help with.", "utterranceID": "20270212-5-94424"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270212-5-94424"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-14T17:08:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with EdgeForce that need our immediate attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270214-0-247c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-0-247c0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-14T17:10:00", "text": "First up, we have a memory leak in the neural network layer. This is causing a gradual degradation of processing speed, impacting real-time data processing capabilities. Affected area is the AI Processing Engine. Customer ID: CUST-0028. @eid_bac7c6c4, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20270214-1-14e82"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-1-14e82"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-02-14T17:11:00", "text": "Got it, thanks! I'll start looking into the memory leak issue right away. Real-time processing is crucial, especially for autonomous systems. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20270214-2-cd1a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-2-cd1a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-14T17:16:00", "text": "Great, thanks @eid_bac7c6c4! Next, we have a security vulnerability allowing unauthorized access to local AI models. This is a big risk for environments handling confidential data. Affected area is Security & Access Control. Customer ID: CUST-0067. @eid_2347b567, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270214-3-95147"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-3-95147"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-02-14T17:17:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll prioritize this. Security is key, and we can't have unauthorized access to our models. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20270214-4-b4754"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-4-b4754"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-02-14T17:18:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_2347b567! Lastly, there's an issue with delayed inference response on low-power devices. This is affecting real-time insights, which is critical for time-sensitive applications. Affected area is again the AI Processing Engine. Customer ID: CUST-0076. @eid_4df3bcc2, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20270214-5-f2a85"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-5-f2a85"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-02-14T17:22:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the delayed inference issue. Ensuring smooth performance on low-power devices is essential. ⚡", "utterranceID": "20270214-6-5761e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-6-5761e"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2027-04-04T19:08:00", "text": "Nice work, Fiona! This should improve the user experience significantly.", "utterranceID": "20270404-6-3be6a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270404-6-3be6a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5058fefc", "timestamp": "2027-04-04T19:11:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie! Let me know if you encounter any more issues or if there's anything else I can help with.", "utterranceID": "20270404-7-c3065"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270404-7-c3065"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4555ba9c", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T05:20:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect token expiry times causing authentication failures has been resolved. You can check out the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/52.", "utterranceID": "20270409-0-afacf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270409-0-afacf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5058fefc", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T05:23:00", "text": "Great news, Ian! Can you explain what was causing the issue?", "utterranceID": "20270409-1-509d0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270409-1-509d0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4555ba9c", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T05:24:00", "text": "Sure, Fiona. The root cause was a synchronization issue between the API layer and the authentication service. During token refresh operations, there were discrepancies in how token expiry times were validated, leading to intermittent rejections.", "utterranceID": "20270409-2-b5112"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270409-2-b5112"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T05:27:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, @eid_4555ba9c. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270409-3-dcdcd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270409-3-dcdcd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4555ba9c", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T05:31:00", "text": "To resolve it, I implemented a consistent time-check mechanism across both the API layer and the authentication service. This ensures that both components are in sync when validating token expiry times, especially during refresh operations.", "utterranceID": "20270409-4-76dc9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270409-4-76dc9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T05:36:00", "text": "Nice work, Ian! This should help reduce those unexpected authentication failures we've been seeing.", "utterranceID": "20270409-5-0bb18"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270409-5-0bb18"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4555ba9c", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T05:41:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie Miller. Let me know if you encounter any more issues related to this. I'll be monitoring the logs closely for the next few days.", "utterranceID": "20270409-6-7b3dc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270409-6-7b3dc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5058fefc", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T05:44:00", "text": "Appreciate your efforts, Ian. This fix will definitely improve our API reliability.", "utterranceID": "20270409-7-4d481"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270409-7-4d481"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-04-09T05:46:00", "text": "Agreed. Thanks for jumping on this so quickly, Ian.", "utterranceID": "20270409-8-f88f9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270409-8-f88f9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2027-04-12T21:43:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect data drift detection has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/53.", "utterranceID": "20270412-0-e3c82"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270412-0-e3c82"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5058fefc", "timestamp": "2027-04-12T21:48:00", "text": "Great news, Charlie! Can you explain what was causing the issue?", "utterranceID": "20270412-1-f1135"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270412-1-f1135"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2027-04-12T21:50:00", "text": "Sure, Fiona. The root cause was an incorrect threshold setting in the data drift detection algorithm. It was set too high, causing the system to overlook significant changes in data patterns.", "utterranceID": "20270412-2-c5ccd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270412-2-c5ccd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-04-12T21:54:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, @eid_3e076e53. How did you fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270412-3-92411"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270412-3-92411"}

