{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bf6c7f21", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:04:00", "text": "Good points, both of you. For performance inconsistencies, we might need to revisit the 'Edge Processing Layer' section. Let's consider optimizing our data processing algorithms and resource management strategies. What do you think, @eid_e51b439b?", "utterranceID": "20260908-3-a140e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-3-a140e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e51b439b", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:07:00", "text": "Absolutely, Alice. We should also look into the architecture design to better handle large-scale data. Maybe add a subsection on scalability improvements in the 'System Architecture' part?", "utterranceID": "20260908-4-0b68f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-4-0b68f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_caa2e58d", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:12:00", "text": "Great suggestions! For integration options, should we expand the 'Integration Layer' to include more APIs and connectors? This could help with third-party app compatibility.", "utterranceID": "20260908-5-9cfaa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-5-9cfaa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:17:00", "text": "Yes, Bob. We need to shift from a closed ecosystem to a more open one. Adding more APIs could be a game-changer for flexibility.", "utterranceID": "20260908-6-e9c9b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-6-e9c9b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:20:00", "text": "On the UI front, let's make the interface more intuitive for non-technical users. We could add a section on UI redesign focusing on simplicity and customization options.", "utterranceID": "20260908-7-2ec03"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-7-2ec03"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bf6c7f21", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:25:00", "text": "Agreed, Julia. And for the update disruptions, we should enhance our testing protocols and rollback procedures. Maybe add a 'Reliability and Update Management' section?", "utterranceID": "20260908-8-54a2b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-8-54a2b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_caa2e58d", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:27:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! To summarize, we'll add sections on setup automation, performance optimization, expanded integrations, UI redesign, and update management. Let's draft these changes and reconvene next week to finalize. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260908-9-a384f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-9-a384f"}
