{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_caa2e58d", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T00:27:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Product Requirements Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We need to address the setup complexity, performance inconsistencies, limited integration options, UI challenges, and update disruptions. Let's dive in! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260911-0-d0bf6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-0-d0bf6"}
