{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T03:38:00", "text": "@here check some functionalities of our product here https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/EdgeForce/demo_2", "utterranceID": "20261113-0-d833e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-0-d833e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T19:38:00", "text": "Hi team, I wanted to discuss some open-source projects that have implemented JWT authentication features similar to what we're planning. Let's see if we can draw any insights from them. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261114-0-8dec8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-0-8dec8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T19:40:00", "text": "First up, we have Keycloak's feature: 'Implement JWT-Based Role Mapping'. This PR enhances role mapping by using JWT claims to dynamically assign user roles. You can check it out here: https://github.com/keycloak/keycloak/pull/3178", "utterranceID": "20261114-1-6c4de"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-1-6c4de"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T19:45:00", "text": "That sounds pretty useful! Keycloak's approach to dynamic role assignment could definitely streamline our access control. We should consider how they handle claims extraction and role mapping. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261114-2-cfc2d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-2-cfc2d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_edf6a3fc", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T19:46:00", "text": "Agreed, Julia. Keycloak's dynamic role mapping could help us reduce manual role assignments. It might be worth looking into their implementation details to see if we can adapt some of their strategies.", "utterranceID": "20261114-3-85878"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261114-3-85878"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4555ba9c", "timestamp": "2027-01-10T02:32:00", "text": "Thanks for the info, Charlie. Let's make it happen! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270109-10-1d87d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270109-10-1d87d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-03-24T15:44:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with EdgeForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270324-0-26ef9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270324-0-26ef9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-03-24T15:45:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Data Drift Detection Failure'. The system isn't detecting data drift, which means outdated models are being used for predictions. This affects the Model Management & Update Module and is impacting customer CUST-0095. @eid_3e076e53, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20270324-1-cc385"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270324-1-cc385"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2027-03-24T15:50:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the Model Management & Update Module to see why the data drift detection is failing. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270324-2-517bf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270324-2-517bf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-03-24T15:51:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an 'Authentication Token Expiry Mismatch'. API requests are being rejected due to mismatched token expiry times, affecting the API Layer. This is causing issues for customer CUST-0116. @eid_4555ba9c, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270324-3-4e315"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270324-3-4e315"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4555ba9c", "timestamp": "2027-03-24T15:54:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll check the API Layer and see what's causing the token expiry mismatch. I'll keep you posted on my progress. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20270324-4-7cab7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270324-4-7cab7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-03-24T15:56:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_4555ba9c! Lastly, there's a 'UI Freezes During Model Visualization' issue. The UI becomes unresponsive when visualizing complex models, particularly those with large parameter sets. This is affecting the User Interface & Visualization Module and impacting customer CUST-0028. @eid_5058fefc, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20270324-5-3c1b5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270324-5-3c1b5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5058fefc", "timestamp": "2027-03-24T15:59:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll look into the UI & Visualization Module to address the freezing issue. Let's get this sorted for CUST-0028! 💪", "utterranceID": "20270324-6-be387"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270324-6-be387"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-03-24T16:00:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these so quickly! If you need any more details or run into any roadblocks, just shout. Let's keep our customers happy! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270324-7-779b1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270324-7-779b1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2027-03-24T16:05:00", "text": "Will do! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_b6a30126. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270324-8-6aa1a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270324-8-6aa1a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4555ba9c", "timestamp": "2027-03-24T16:07:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_b6a30126! I'll reach out if I need anything. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270324-9-46446"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270324-9-46446"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5058fefc", "timestamp": "2027-03-24T16:12:00", "text": "Thanks, team! Let's get these issues resolved. 🔧", "utterranceID": "20270324-10-a1308"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270324-10-a1308"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-03-27T20:30:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current issues. Let's take a look at them! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270327-0-4e3ac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270327-0-4e3ac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-03-27T20:35:00", "text": "First up, we have a bug in TensorFlow related to 'Model Training Data Drift Detection Failure'. It seems similar to our data drift issue in EdgeForce. You can check it out here: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/1087. @eid_3e076e53, this might be useful for your investigation.", "utterranceID": "20270327-1-20406"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270327-1-20406"}

