{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EinsteinEdgeAI", "channelID": "ch-dgeai-df1b87"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T06:09:00", "text": "@eid_9c46088d, @eid_0719bc3e, @eid_061285c7, @eid_7f22371d joined planning-EinsteinEdgeAI.", "utterranceID": "20260828-32-05ada"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-32-05ada"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EinsteinEdgeAI", "channelID": "ch-dgeai-df1b87"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e42b000f", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T11:38:00", "text": "Hi team, I want to discuss about the Product Requirements Document for EinsteinEdgeAI. Let's brainstorm some ideas and outline the key sections we need to include. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260830-0-185b1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260830-0-185b1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EinsteinEdgeAI", "channelID": "ch-dgeai-df1b87"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T11:43:00", "text": "Hey @eid_e42b000f, sounds good! I think we should start with the problem statement and objectives. We need to clearly define what EinsteinEdgeAI is solving. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260830-1-70fb4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260830-1-70fb4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EinsteinEdgeAI", "channelID": "ch-dgeai-df1b87"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T11:48:00", "text": "Agreed, David. We should also include a section on technical requirements. We need to specify the hardware and software environments where the AI processing will occur. @eid_e42b000f, thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20260830-2-b2480"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260830-2-b2480"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EinsteinEdgeAI", "channelID": "ch-dgeai-df1b87"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e42b000f", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T11:51:00", "text": "Absolutely, Ian. Let's make sure we cover both the technical and user experience aspects. @eid_2490c02c, Bob, can you help with the UX research section?", "utterranceID": "20260830-3-abcd3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260830-3-abcd3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EinsteinEdgeAI", "channelID": "ch-dgeai-df1b87"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2490c02c", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T11:55:00", "text": "Sure thing, Hannah! I'll gather insights on user needs and pain points. We should also consider how real-time insights will improve user workflows. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260830-4-14ea6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260830-4-14ea6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EinsteinEdgeAI", "channelID": "ch-dgeai-df1b87"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8c71a7a9", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T11:56:00", "text": "For the engineering section, we should outline the architecture and any dependencies. Maybe a diagram could help visualize it better?", "utterranceID": "20260830-5-413aa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260830-5-413aa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EinsteinEdgeAI", "channelID": "ch-dgeai-df1b87"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T11:59:00", "text": "Good idea, Hannah M. I'll draft a preliminary architecture diagram. @eid_b67edbb4, can you review it once I'm done?", "utterranceID": "20260830-6-d02b4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260830-6-d02b4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EinsteinEdgeAI", "channelID": "ch-dgeai-df1b87"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T12:01:00", "text": "Of course, Ian S. Just ping me when it's ready. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260830-7-5b600"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260830-7-5b600"}
