{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-03-15T20:54:00", "text": "Same here, I'll share any relevant findings from the Django PR. Thanks, team! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270315-9-84f86"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270315-9-84f86"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-03-15T20:55:00", "text": "I'll make sure to update everyone on the Kubernetes PR insights. Let's get these issues resolved! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270315-10-2a3f0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270315-10-2a3f0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2027-03-19T01:00:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect scaling of visual elements has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/48.", "utterranceID": "20270318-0-a7bce"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270318-0-a7bce"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2027-03-19T01:03:00", "text": "The root cause was identified as a lack of responsive design in our visualization module. We were using fixed dimensions for graphs and charts, which didn't adapt well to different screen sizes.", "utterranceID": "20270318-1-dc059"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270318-1-dc059"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2027-03-19T01:06:00", "text": "To fix this, I replaced the fixed dimensions with relative units like percentages and viewport-based units. This ensures that the visual elements scale appropriately across various devices.", "utterranceID": "20270318-2-1ac9a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270318-2-1ac9a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-03-19T01:09:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_4b38019b! This should improve the user experience significantly.", "utterranceID": "20270318-3-c6807"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270318-3-c6807"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-03-19T01:13:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie! I'll test it on a few different devices to make sure everything looks good. Appreciate the quick turnaround.", "utterranceID": "20270318-4-8cc9c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270318-4-8cc9c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2027-03-19T01:15:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia and @eid_91523bad. Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing.", "utterranceID": "20270318-5-05f86"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270318-5-05f86"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-03-19T01:17:00", "text": "Will do, Charlie. Thanks again for addressing this so promptly!", "utterranceID": "20270318-6-f2726"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270318-6-f2726"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-03-30T03:24:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect data serialization in API responses has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/49.", "utterranceID": "20270329-0-123dd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270329-0-123dd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-03-30T03:25:00", "text": "The root cause was a bug in the serialization library we use in the API layer. It was causing incorrect data formatting, especially when handling outputs from complex AI models.", "utterranceID": "20270329-1-550f8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270329-1-550f8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-03-30T03:30:00", "text": "To fix it, I updated the serialization library to the latest version, which includes a patch for this issue. I also added additional unit tests to ensure that complex data structures are serialized correctly.", "utterranceID": "20270329-2-db044"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270329-2-db044"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_edf6a3fc", "timestamp": "2027-03-30T03:35:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_bac7c6c4! Thanks for jumping on this so quickly. I'll test it on our end to make sure everything's working smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20270329-3-4e693"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270329-3-4e693"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-03-30T03:37:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia Jones! This should help reduce the parsing errors we've been seeing on the client side. I'll update the client team.", "utterranceID": "20270329-4-4366c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270329-4-4366c"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:39:00", "text": "Hey @eid_a253c65a, for the setup complexity, I think we should add a section on setup automation tools. Maybe we can include scripts or a step-by-step guide to simplify the process. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260915-1-14fd9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-1-14fd9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:40:00", "text": "I agree with Julia. We could also enhance the user guidance section with more detailed documentation. Perhaps a quick-start guide for non-technical users? 📚", "utterranceID": "20260915-2-5b178"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-2-5b178"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c9c3d8d5", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:43:00", "text": "For the performance inconsistencies, should we look into optimizing the data processing algorithms? The document could include a section on performance tuning tips for large datasets. @eid_91523bad, what do you think?", "utterranceID": "20260915-3-b3572"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-3-b3572"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:47:00", "text": "Absolutely, @eid_c9c3d8d5. We should also consider adding a note on recommended hardware specs to ensure consistent performance across devices. 💡", "utterranceID": "20260915-4-9b42e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-4-9b42e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a9002ae2", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:48:00", "text": "Regarding integration options, we might want to expand the integration layer section to include potential APIs or connectors. This could help with third-party app compatibility. 🤝", "utterranceID": "20260915-5-b633c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-5-b633c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1a7d9807", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:51:00", "text": "Good point, Bob. We should also address the closed ecosystem approach in the design section. Maybe suggest a more open architecture to enhance flexibility? 🔄", "utterranceID": "20260915-6-0851a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-6-0851a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9db3abf4", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:56:00", "text": "For the UI, let's add a subsection on user feedback incorporation. We need to make sure the design is intuitive for non-technical users. Perhaps more user-friendly features or customization options? 🖥️", "utterranceID": "20260915-7-0eb18"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-7-0eb18"}
