{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d8eff4d", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:58:00", "text": "Agreed, @eid_caa2e58d. We could also emphasize the importance of thorough testing before deployment in the technical section. 🧪", "utterranceID": "20260915-9-ec3b0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-9-ec3b0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a253c65a", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:03:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! Here's a quick summary: \n1. Add setup automation tools and detailed user guidance. \n2. Optimize data processing algorithms and specify hardware recommendations. \n3. Expand integration options with APIs/connectors. \n4. Enhance UI with user feedback and customization options. \n5. Improve update management and ensure backward compatibility. \nLet's start drafting these changes and reconvene next week to finalize. Thanks for the input! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260915-10-05054"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-10-05054"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a253c65a", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T04:04:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_ef_aix_technical_specifications_document|Technical Specifications Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260917-0-57ecd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-0-57ecd"}

