{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T05:05:00", "text": "Alright, I've gone through the list of unsupported sensor types. It looks comprehensive and covers all the critical ones we discussed in the last meeting. Great job! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261127-3-83438"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-3-83438"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T05:06:00", "text": "I agree with Alice. The documentation is clear and outlines both current support and gaps effectively. The stakeholder feedback section is a nice touch. 📄", "utterranceID": "20261127-4-b7d72"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-4-b7d72"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-a13a7a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T05:08:00", "text": "Also, I checked with the stakeholders, and they confirmed the accuracy of the identified gaps. Everything seems to be in order. ✅", "utterranceID": "20261127-5-7ab60"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-5-7ab60"}
