{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-08-27T06:12:00", "text": "@eid_df282afb, @eid_e51b439b joined planning-EF_AIX.", "utterranceID": "20260827-32-1682a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260827-32-1682a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e51b439b", "timestamp": "2026-08-27T12:11:00", "text": "Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of EF_AIX. The report came from QA Specialist eid_0719bc3e.", "utterranceID": "20260911-0-946e8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-0-946e8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-08-27T12:13:00", "text": "Thanks, George. What exactly did they find?", "utterranceID": "20260911-1-b4fdf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-1-b4fdf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e51b439b", "timestamp": "2026-08-27T12:16:00", "text": "Some users are experiencing inconsistent performance when processing large datasets, which leads to delays in real-time insights.", "utterranceID": "20260911-2-48954"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-2-48954"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-08-27T12:17:00", "text": "Could it be due to inefficient data processing algorithms? Maybe the algorithms aren't optimized for large datasets.", "utterranceID": "20260911-3-cd984"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-3-cd984"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_df282afb", "timestamp": "2026-08-27T12:18:00", "text": "That's possible, Julia. We should also consider if the resource management isn't handling the load well.", "utterranceID": "20260911-4-ff0e1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-4-ff0e1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-08-27T12:23:00", "text": "Good point, David. Another angle could be the architecture. Maybe it's not designed to handle large-scale data efficiently.", "utterranceID": "20260911-5-d3b09"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-5-d3b09"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-08-27T12:28:00", "text": "Agreed, Charlie. We should also check if there's variability in hardware capabilities across different devices.", "utterranceID": "20260911-6-096f1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-6-096f1"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T03:16:00", "text": "Sure thing, Julia Smith. The root cause was that the thermal management system wasn't effectively dissipating heat, which led to the device throttling the CPU and GPU performance to prevent damage.", "utterranceID": "20261230-2-d49a5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261230-2-d49a5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T03:20:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Julia Jones. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261230-3-e70fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261230-3-e70fb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T03:23:00", "text": "We implemented a more efficient heat sink design and optimized the fan control algorithm to improve heat dissipation. This prevents the device from reaching critical temperatures and ensures the AI Processing Engine operates at full capacity.", "utterranceID": "20261230-4-2d4d6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261230-4-2d4d6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T03:24:00", "text": "Awesome work, @eid_bac7c6c4! This should really help with the performance issues we've been seeing.", "utterranceID": "20261230-5-b44b6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261230-5-b44b6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T03:26:00", "text": "Agreed, thanks for tackling this so quickly, Julia Jones. Looking forward to seeing the improvements in action.", "utterranceID": "20261230-6-62835"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261230-6-62835"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T03:27:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you encounter any more issues. Happy to help!", "utterranceID": "20261230-7-5bb20"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261230-7-5bb20"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-01T11:05:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect outputs due to data corruption during model updates has been resolved. 🎉", "utterranceID": "20270101-0-02fc9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270101-0-02fc9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-01T11:10:00", "text": "The issue was caused by an incomplete transaction handling mechanism during model updates, which led to partial writes and data inconsistency.", "utterranceID": "20270101-1-4bfac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270101-1-4bfac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-01T11:15:00", "text": "I've implemented a fix by introducing a more robust transaction management system that ensures atomicity during updates. This prevents partial writes and maintains data integrity.", "utterranceID": "20270101-2-6afe4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270101-2-6afe4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-01T11:18:00", "text": "You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/36", "utterranceID": "20270101-3-7411d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270101-3-7411d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-01-01T11:20:00", "text": "Great job, Julia Smith! Thanks for the update and for resolving this so quickly. I'll review the changes in the PR.", "utterranceID": "20270101-4-7fe4e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270101-4-7fe4e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-01T11:21:00", "text": "@eid_2347b567 Thanks, Julia! This was a critical issue, and I'm glad it's been addressed. I'll also take a look at the PR.", "utterranceID": "20270101-5-52cd1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270101-5-52cd1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-01T11:22:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia Jones and Julia Martinez! Let me know if you have any questions or need further clarification on the changes.", "utterranceID": "20270101-6-8a463"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270101-6-8a463"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-13T05:55:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with EdgeForce that need our immediate attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270112-0-82da9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270112-0-82da9"}

