{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T10:57:00", "text": "Great! Next up is a Grafana bug titled 'Dashboard Elements Misaligned on Resize'. Visual elements get misaligned when resizing the browser window. Check it out here: https://github.com/grafana/grafana/pull/1080. Charlie, this seems similar to our UI scaling issue. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20270301-3-55056"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270301-3-55056"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T10:59:00", "text": "Absolutely, Julia! This is very similar to what we're seeing with our visual elements. I'll dive into their solution and see if it can help us improve our UI scaling. 📊", "utterranceID": "20270301-4-d6c2c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270301-4-d6c2c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T11:04:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks Charlie! Lastly, there's a TensorFlow bug titled 'Model Version Mismatch in Serving'. It involves serving outdated model versions, leading to inconsistent results. Here's the PR: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/1081. Julia, this might help with our API versioning conflict.", "utterranceID": "20270301-5-f2540"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270301-5-f2540"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bac7c6c4", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T11:07:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! I'll look into how TensorFlow is handling this. Ensuring correct model versions is crucial for us too. 🤖", "utterranceID": "20270301-6-46080"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270301-6-46080"}
