{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-27T01:19:00", "text": "I've fixed the bug by updating the configuration parser to correctly handle edge cases in the YAML files. The parser now properly interprets all hyperparameter values, ensuring accurate model updates.", "utterranceID": "20270126-2-0f9f8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270126-2-0f9f8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-27T01:23:00", "text": "You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/EdgeForce/pull/38", "utterranceID": "20270126-3-60ac4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270126-3-60ac4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-27T01:25:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Julia Smith! Great job on resolving this quickly. I'll review the changes in the PR.", "utterranceID": "20270126-4-4baa6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270126-4-4baa6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-27T01:26:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia Martinez! Let me know if you have any questions or need further clarification on the changes.", "utterranceID": "20270126-5-21d02"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270126-5-21d02"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-27T01:30:00", "text": "Will do. Appreciate the swift resolution. This should help improve our model's performance significantly.", "utterranceID": "20270126-6-ebc34"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270126-6-ebc34"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:32:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with EdgeForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270129-0-78c77"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-0-78c77"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:35:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Memory Leak in Visualization Rendering'. This is affecting the User Interface & Visualization Module, causing slow performance and crashes. Customer CUST-0076 is impacted. @eid_4df3bcc2, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20270129-1-78766"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-1-78766"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:36:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the memory leak issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270129-2-329b6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-2-329b6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:38:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, there's a 'Version Mismatch in Model Deployment'. This is causing discrepancies in predictions, affecting Customer CUST-0088. It's in the Model Management & Update Module. @eid_4df3bcc2, you're also on this one.", "utterranceID": "20270129-3-06832"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-3-06832"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:43:00", "text": "Understood. I'll make sure to address the version mismatch issue as well. If anyone has insights on recent deployments, let me know! 🤔", "utterranceID": "20270129-4-80962"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-4-80962"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:44:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_4df3bcc2! Lastly, we have a 'Cache Invalidation Failure' in the API Layer. This is leading to stale data being served, impacting Customer CUST-0101. @eid_edf6a3fc, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270129-5-0708d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-5-0708d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_edf6a3fc", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:48:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the cache invalidation issue and see what's causing the stale data. If anyone has logs or recent changes to the API, please share! 📊", "utterranceID": "20270129-6-83917"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-6-83917"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:53:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these so quickly! Let's keep the communication open and update each other as we make progress. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270129-7-000b3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-7-000b3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:55:00", "text": "Will do! I'll keep you all posted on the visualization and model deployment issues. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20270129-8-fac61"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-8-fac61"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_edf6a3fc", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:56:00", "text": "Same here, I'll update once I have more info on the cache issue. Thanks for coordinating, @eid_91523bad! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270129-9-e583f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-9-e583f"}

{"title": "Implement AES-256 Encryption for Data at Rest", "summary": "This PR introduces AES-256 encryption for data stored in the system, ensuring that all sensitive information is securely encrypted when not in use. This includes implementing encryption and decryption functions and integrating them into the data storage workflow.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/ainAIX/pull/3", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "True", "number": "3", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_83b716d4"}, "created_at": "2026-07-31T04:05:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_e0e4b6d0"}, "comment": "The encryption and decryption functions look solid, and the comprehensive unit tests are great. The documentation updates are clear and concise, making the encryption process easy to follow. LGTM! Approved.", "submitted_at": "2026-07-31T14:40:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_eed289d3"}, "comment": "The tests cover a lot of edge cases, and the performance impact is minimal. The documentation is spot on, and everything meets the acceptance criteria. LGTM, approved!", "submitted_at": "2026-07-31T14:36:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_ainAIX_pull_3"}
