{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ghtAIX", "channelID": "ch-htaix-1ff460"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-04-11T12:37:00", "text": "Absolutely, @eid_ec5cb5c2, I'll specify the audit frequency. @eid_e3612e4a, I'll add examples of risks and mitigation strategies. And @eid_2d14387c, I'll draft a section on customer support and SLAs. Thanks for the valuable feedback, team! I'll make these updates and share the revised document by end of the week. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260411-8-66001"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260411-8-66001"}
