{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-04-23T02:59:00", "text": "Hey George, for the sentiment analysis misinterpretation, I think we should expand the NLP Engine section to include a focus on sarcasm and humor detection. We might need to incorporate additional datasets that include these elements. Thoughts, @eid_5890ce38?", "utterranceID": "20260422-1-808a1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260422-1-808a1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2470307f", "timestamp": "2026-04-23T03:01:00", "text": "Agreed, Emma. We should also mention the need for contextual analysis in the NLP Engine section. This could help differentiate between literal and sarcastic statements. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260422-2-f08a1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260422-2-f08a1"}
