{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-a-aix-2eecee"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-05-13T08:18:00", "text": "Dynamic integration sounds intriguing. It could be beneficial for us to explore how they manage dataset variability and real-time integration. Ian Garcia, what do you think?", "utterranceID": "20260512-7-68d78"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260512-7-68d78"}
