{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T01:50:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Load Balancer Misconfiguration' issue. The load balancer is unevenly distributing requests, causing some servers to overload. This is affecting Customer CUST-0078. @eid_a23a73c4, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20260902-3-eefb5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-3-eefb5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T01:52:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the load balancer settings and ensure even distribution across servers. Let's get this sorted! 💪", "utterranceID": "20260902-4-d3d2d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-4-d3d2d"}
