{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ContentForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-6f4188"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_06cddbb3", "timestamp": "2026-03-15T11:28:00", "text": "👍 Thanks for the insights, @Hannah Smith! It seems like a robust tool. We should keep an eye on how it evolves and impacts the market.", "utterranceID": "20260611-9-9c11c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260611-9-9c11c"}
