{"title": "Implement Secure Handshake Protocol for Initial Connections", "summary": "This PR introduces a secure handshake protocol for establishing initial connections between clients and servers, ensuring the authenticity and integrity of the communication setup.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/38", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "False", "number": "38", "state": "open", "user": {"login": "eid_7dfbbca2"}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T13:10:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_a88ee967"}, "comment": "The implementation aligns perfectly with TLS 1.3 standards. Great job!", "submitted_at": "2026-10-30T18:38:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_abbf3651"}, "comment": "The initial connection tests are solid, maintaining authenticity and integrity. Well done!", "submitted_at": "2026-10-30T18:42:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_4988ee2a"}, "comment": "Performance tests show acceptable latency, and the documentation is clear. Security benefits are well outlined. Nice work!", "submitted_at": "2026-10-30T18:47:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_CollaborateForce_pull_38"}
