{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a1fab288", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T15:24:00", "text": "Thanks for the info. @eid_76d9cb07, can you shed some light on these issues? Were these known before the merge?", "utterranceID": "20260908-4-2ede0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-4-2ede0"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T15:26:00", "text": "Hi all, I wasn't aware of these specific issues. The tests we ran didn't catch them. I'll look into it right away.", "utterranceID": "20260908-5-f49a3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-5-f49a3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9c876927", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T15:31:00", "text": "Given the impact, I think we should consider reverting the PR until these bugs are fixed. We can't afford to have our API unreliable.", "utterranceID": "20260908-6-7f37e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-6-7f37e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f3ea10f", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T15:36:00", "text": "Agreed. It's better to revert now and address the issues thoroughly before re-merging.", "utterranceID": "20260908-7-449e1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-7-449e1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T15:39:00", "text": "Understood. I'll prepare to revert the PR. I'll ensure the issues are fixed before we attempt another merge.", "utterranceID": "20260908-8-6df45"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-8-6df45"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_73a50f06", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T15:44:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_76d9cb07. Let us know if you need any help with testing once the fixes are in place.", "utterranceID": "20260908-9-fef94"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-9-fef94"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T15:49:00", "text": "Will do. I'll keep everyone updated on the progress. Thanks for catching this early, team.", "utterranceID": "20260908-10-22a71"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-10-22a71"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T21:57:00", "text": "https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/21", "utterranceID": "20260908-0-c76be"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-0-c76be"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67416adf", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T22:02:00", "text": "Approved", "utterranceID": "20260908-1-53c03"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-1-53c03"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a1fab288", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T22:05:00", "text": "Looks good", "utterranceID": "20260908-2-76ae4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-2-76ae4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-26T22:02:00", "text": "Hi team, I wanted to kick off a discussion about our new PR for AI-powered suggestions. I found some interesting open-source projects that have implemented similar features. Let's see what we can learn from them! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260926-0-7d8a7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260926-0-7d8a7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-26T22:07:00", "text": "First up, JupyterLab has a feature called AI-Driven Code Suggestions. It integrates AI to provide real-time code suggestions and improvements within the notebook environment. Check it out here: https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/pull/4924", "utterranceID": "20260926-1-29a71"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260926-1-29a71"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c2a92a40", "timestamp": "2026-09-26T22:08:00", "text": "That sounds pretty cool! Real-time code suggestions could really enhance user productivity. I think it aligns well with our goal of enhancing collaboration features. What do you think, @eid_a1fab288?", "utterranceID": "20260926-2-3a52b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260926-2-3a52b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a1fab288", "timestamp": "2026-09-26T22:13:00", "text": "Absolutely, David! I like how it focuses on real-time interaction. It could be a great reference for our implementation. Maybe we can look into how they handle the AI model integration. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260926-3-37c9c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260926-3-37c9c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-09-26T22:15:00", "text": "Great points! Next, let's look at Apache Superset's Smart Visualization Recommendations. It uses AI to suggest optimal visualizations based on dataset characteristics and user queries. Here's the link: https://github.com/apache/superset/pull/4925", "utterranceID": "20260926-4-ee562"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260926-4-ee562"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ce946d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a1fab288", "timestamp": "2026-09-26T22:19:00", "text": "Visualization recommendations are super useful, especially for users who might not be familiar with data visualization best practices. This could definitely inspire our approach to suggesting relevant data points. 📊", "utterranceID": "20260926-5-6291e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260926-5-6291e"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67416adf", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:26:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the cache invalidation problem and ensure we get fresh data served to users. Thanks for the heads-up! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270129-2-192c9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-2-192c9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:31:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an API Endpoint Exposure issue. Unsecured endpoints are allowing unauthorized access to collaborative features and sensitive data, impacting the Security Module. This poses a significant risk for CUST-0038. @eid_c2a92a40, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270129-3-622b7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-3-622b7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c2a92a40", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:32:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll secure those endpoints and ensure our data integrity is maintained. Security is a top priority! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20270129-4-00644"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-4-00644"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:35:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a Bias in Recommendation Algorithm issue. The AI Suggestion Engine is biased towards certain data sources, affecting the AI Suggestion Engine and leading to skewed recommendations for CUST-0052. @eid_a1fab288, can you look into this?", "utterranceID": "20270129-5-d4c7d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-5-d4c7d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a1fab288", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:40:00", "text": "On it! I'll review the algorithm and make sure our recommendations are balanced and trustworthy. Let's get that trust back! 🤖", "utterranceID": "20270129-6-c1d8c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-6-c1d8c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:42:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep the communication open and feel free to reach out if you need any help or further details. Let's get these issues resolved for our customers! 💪", "utterranceID": "20270129-7-8d44d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-7-8d44d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67416adf", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:46:00", "text": "Will do! If anyone has insights on cache strategies, feel free to share. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270129-8-9cc92"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-8-9cc92"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c2a92a40", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:51:00", "text": "Same here, any security tips are welcome! 🔍", "utterranceID": "20270129-9-fd359"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-9-fd359"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a1fab288", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:55:00", "text": "And if anyone has experience with AI bias, let's chat! 🤝", "utterranceID": "20270129-10-426b9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-10-426b9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:58:00", "text": "Perfect! Let's keep the collaboration going. Thanks, team! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270129-11-4290f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-11-4290f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2027-02-01T02:16:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that mirror the issues we're tackling. Let's dive in and see what we can learn! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270131-0-8eaac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-0-8eaac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2027-02-01T02:17:00", "text": "First up, we have a Cache Invalidation Failure in Redis. Stale data is being served due to improper cache invalidation, similar to our issue with CollaborateForce. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/redis/redis/pull/4825. @eid_67416adf, this might give you some insights!", "utterranceID": "20270131-1-0d6de"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-1-0d6de"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67416adf", "timestamp": "2027-02-01T02:22:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah! I'll review the Redis PR. It's always helpful to see how others handle cache invalidation. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270131-2-959c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-2-959c0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2027-02-01T02:23:00", "text": "Next, there's an Unsecured API Endpoints issue in OWASP ZAP. Certain endpoints are exposed without proper authentication, which is quite similar to our API Endpoint Exposure problem. Here's the PR: https://github.com/zaproxy/zaproxy/pull/4826. David, this might be useful for you!", "utterranceID": "20270131-3-6477e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-3-6477e"}

