{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ca0da"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13df35ed", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:20:00", "text": "Hi team, please check my PR for optimizing the WebRTC signaling process: https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/3. 🚀 I've implemented improvements to reduce latency during the initial connection setup phase by optimizing the exchange of SDP messages and ICE candidates. Let me know your thoughts!", "utterranceID": "20260715-0-f070d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-0-f070d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ca0da"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_69130545", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:25:00", "text": "Hey @eid_13df35ed, thanks for sharing! I'll take a look at it today. Just to confirm, we're aiming for at least a 20% reduction in signaling latency, right?", "utterranceID": "20260715-1-7927e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-1-7927e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ca0da"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13df35ed", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:26:00", "text": "Exactly, George! The goal is to make the initial connection setup much faster. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260715-2-91c0a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-2-91c0a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ca0da"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:29:00", "text": "Hi @eid_13df35ed, I'll review it as well. Have you tested the connection establishment under different network conditions?", "utterranceID": "20260715-3-0f1ec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-3-0f1ec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ca0da"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13df35ed", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:31:00", "text": "Yes, David, I ran tests under various conditions like high latency and packet loss. The results were promising, but I'd love your input on it.", "utterranceID": "20260715-4-734eb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-4-734eb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ca0da"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_69130545", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:34:00", "text": "Just finished a quick review. The code looks clean, and I see you've added unit tests. 👍 However, I'm not sure if the latency reduction is hitting the 20% mark consistently. Could you provide more data on that?", "utterranceID": "20260715-5-917e6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-5-917e6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ca0da"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13df35ed", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:36:00", "text": "Thanks for the feedback, George! I'll gather more detailed metrics and update the PR with those. 📊", "utterranceID": "20260715-6-9fe12"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-6-9fe12"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ca0da"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:41:00", "text": "I noticed the unit tests are passing, which is great. However, I think we might need more tests covering edge cases, especially for network fluctuations. What do you think, @eid_13df35ed?", "utterranceID": "20260715-7-a650f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-7-a650f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ca0da"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13df35ed", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T14:42:00", "text": "Good point, David. I'll add more tests to cover those scenarios. Thanks for catching that! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260715-8-7f915"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-8-7f915"}
