{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionamiller-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-27cdca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4988ee2a", "timestamp": "2026-09-20T19:08:00", "text": "Great points! Next, let's look at Rocket.Chat's feature. They've introduced end-to-end encryption for group messaging to protect user data and privacy. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/RocketChat/Rocket.Chat/pull/4919. Thoughts, @Hannah Williams?", "utterranceID": "20260920-4-ea611"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260920-4-ea611"}
