{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionamiller-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-27cdca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0aa9f1f7", "timestamp": "2026-09-20T19:13:00", "text": "Yeah, I agree with Hannah. Making encryption accessible and easy to use is key. We should definitely consider how they integrate encryption settings into the user experience.", "utterranceID": "20260920-6-1c750"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260920-6-1c750"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionamiller-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-27cdca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4988ee2a", "timestamp": "2026-09-20T19:15:00", "text": "Absolutely! Lastly, let's discuss Signal-Desktop's enhancement. They've improved the encryption protocol for group conversations to ensure only authorized users can decrypt messages. Check it out here: https://github.com/signalapp/Signal-Desktop/pull/4920. Ian, any thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20260920-7-3895d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260920-7-3895d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionamiller-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-27cdca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0aa9f1f7", "timestamp": "2026-09-20T19:19:00", "text": "Signal is known for its strong encryption protocols. Their focus on ensuring only authorized users can decrypt messages is something we should definitely consider. It aligns well with our security goals. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20260920-8-0bd69"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260920-8-0bd69"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionamiller-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-27cdca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a88ee967", "timestamp": "2026-09-20T19:21:00", "text": "Signal's approach to authorization is top-notch. We might want to look into their methods for verifying user identities within group chats. That could enhance our security model.", "utterranceID": "20260920-9-e9f8a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260920-9-e9f8a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-fionamiller-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-27cdca"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4988ee2a", "timestamp": "2026-09-20T19:23:00", "text": "Thanks for the insights, everyone! I'll take a closer look at these projects and see how we can adapt some of their strategies for our implementation. Let's aim to incorporate the best practices from each. I'll keep you all updated! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260920-10-5049d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260920-10-5049d"}
